ant dining area. All bedrooms provide privacy on the upper level. The master suite features a double sink with stylish wall sconces, a sizable soaking tub and generous walk-in shower with a luxurious bench. The front bedrooms are elegantly appointed and offer peek-a-boo ocean views directly out to the front of the property. One of the other two bedroom is extremely spacious, essentially serving the home like a second master bedroom. You?ll find storage plentiful in the 2 car attached garage with built in shelving and sealed closets. There is a laundry room downstairs right next to a powder room perfect for visitors and guests. Don?t forget to enjoy the incredibly private backyard perfect for reading a book or hosting a dinner party. This homes offers everything you?ll ever need.","Shingle","All Bedrooms Up, Primary Suite, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Veronica","Xu","PVXUVER","V8107","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","1780000","False","Full Service","Call first alarm on the property, seller will disarm before showing. Thank you!!","","None","False","","2546","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Pepper Tree","","9","Lane","","Cape Cod","Conventional","","53174","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Water Connected","Peek-A-Boo","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=sWmiXfYWqZP&mls=1","","","2002","90274","5406","RECL*"
"","0.4732","Offers will be reviewed by seller after 5:00 pm on Monday. April 8th. TDS, SPQ AND EQ HAZARDS REPORT CAN BE VIEWED IN SUPPLEMENTS. Home is being sold ""as-is"" in its present condition and is priced accordingly. Email offer to gary@sellnsp.com with the usual supporting documents (POF, preapproval letter, DU and FICO scores).","6 Burner Stove, Dishwasher, Double Oven, Electric Oven, Disposal, Gas Cooktop, Trash Compactor, Water Heater","True","172 - La Cresta","Unknown","True","7574021005","","0","","False","2","","","","2","3","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","20","1800000","#ERR","03/21/2024 2:16:56 PM","","","04/10/2024 12:00:00 AM","04/25/2024 10:45:31 AM","","","03/21/2024 12:00:00 AM","04/10/2024 12:00:00 AM","04/25/2024 10:44:57 AM","04/25/2024 12:00:00 AM","04/25/2024 12:00:00 AM","","West","20","","True","Area, Dining Room, Country Kitchen, See Remarks","Barbecue Private, Rain Gutters","","","","","Cash","Living Room, Primary Retreat","True","Carpet, Tile","True","Central, Forced Air","True","Beamed Ceilings, Cathedral Ceiling(s), Recessed Lighting, Sunken Living Room","True","True","Front Door","Supra","False","","","","33.765629","Individual Room, Inside","True","False","","","1795000","","","1795000","#ERR","310-732-1202","","gary@sellnsp.com","310-832-7682","Gary","310-519-8422","","Krill","","SKRILGAR","","","","","SB1350760","","Compass","310-241-3038","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.365248","","5","20614","Back Yard, Front Yard, Landscaped, Lot 20000-39999 Sqft, Secluded, Sprinkler System, Treed Lot, Yard","Biking , Dog Park, Fishing, Golf, Hiking , Horse Trails, Watersports, Sidewalks, Street Lights","","Assessor","","","SB24033193","","2","6","","1","Vacant","","","","Shed(s), Workshop","Driveway, Garage, Workshop in Garage","True","Deck, Front Porch","True","36","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","718.85","Great buy in the La Cresta area of RPV! Nestled at the end of a private drive on a quiet cul-de-sac in the desirable Crestridge neighborhood is where you'll find this unique one-level ranch style home. It's situated on a completely usable & beautifully landscaped 20,614 sq ft lot that gives you the opportunity to develop the home & yard into something spectacular while enjoying ultimate privacy. The home is definitely livable as it is but we have priced it so there's plenty of room to invest in a remodel & have plenty of equity left over when completed. The 2504 sq ft interior offers a step-down formal living room with natural rock fireplace, large dining area adjoining an informal living space, spacious sunlit kitchen, two nice-sized secondary bedrooms, indoor laundry room, full hall bath and the wonderful primary suite that features, vaulted beam ceiling, attractive fireplace, walk-in closet, huge bathroom, French doors that open to the deck & the former 4th bedroom that makes as a great sitting area or work space. Some upgrades/features include recessed lighting, dual-pane vinyl & wood-clad windows, newer central heat and AC system, two water heaters & a lightweight concrete tile roof. There's a two car garage with direct access to the interior and a workshop that was added to the back of the garage. Now to the best part, the yard. The serenity you will experience when you walk onto the expansive deck is very hard to come by. It provides a great space for entertaining & comes equipped with a BBQ island, pergola, lighting & multiple areas for dining al fresco & relaxing. Walk down the stairs from the deck into the amazing rear yard that will have you immersed in nature. It's like having a botanical garden & enchanting forest all to yourself. As you make your way along the meandering paths that travel through the yard you will enjoy the lush greenery & extreme privacy that make you feel like you're far away from the city. The yard also features fruit trees, garden beds, a shed & access to a bridle trail behind the property. The yard is fabulous as it is, but for those that would prefer to have a pool, sports court or whatever else you have in mind, the possibilites are endless. The home is also conveniently located just a short distance from the Promenade, Peninsula Center & the other local restaurants, shopping and theatres. This is a great opportunity to get into a fabulous property in a super desirable location at an entry level price. Don't miss it!","Concrete","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Office, See Remarks, Workshop","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Fatima","Jen","SBJENFATI","S6486","2.5","%","Home Team Realty","1800000","False","Full Service","Submit request through Showingtime link in the listing. CBS code will be in the confirmation. Please be sure to turn off lights and lock doors. Thanks for showing and good luck!","True","None","False","True","2504","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Middlecrest","","5205","Road","","Ranch","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Submit","","23399","","Single Family Residence","","","Trees/Woods","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=JHfbubfCGnt&brand=0","","Bay Window(s), Double Pane Windows, Wood Frames","1959","90275","5031","RPRS20000&E*"
