"","11.0092","This is a Trust Sale, property Sold AS IS, Seller to be listed as The Glowacki Family Trust.  No one passed in home. Offers due Wednesday 13th. Email offers with preapproval/proof of funds to Paula@aragoneassoc.com and Dawnakuch@gmail.com. Thank you for showing! Commission paid to MLS members only.  Buyer is required to verify all square footage, permit, and easement information and to satisfy themselves as to such. Any numerical statements regarding square footage ,room dimensions and/or lot size are approximations only and have not been verified by seller or broker. Buyer is advised to investigate the condition and suitability of all aspects of the property, including but not limited to the foregoing. Agent has not verified any information.","Dishwasher, Double Oven, Disposal, Gas Range, Microwave, Refrigerator","True","172 - La Cresta","Unknown","True","7585035038","Insurance, Maintenance Grounds","375","","False","3","","","","3","3","","Rolling Hills Estates","#ERR","","","Dawnakuch@gmail.com","714-998-0425","Dawna","","0","Kuch","OCKUCHDAW","","","0","714-726-9262","0","H04812","714-986-1771","First Team Real Estate","714-996-6070","0","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","6","1865000","#ERR","09/04/2023 3:30:08 PM","","","10/03/2023 12:00:00 AM","10/03/2023 1:52:06 PM","","","09/04/2023 12:00:00 AM","09/14/2023 12:00:00 AM","09/09/2023 5:04:12 PM","10/03/2023 12:00:00 AM","10/03/2023 12:00:00 AM","","","6","","False","Family Kitchen, Dining Room","","Stucco","","","","Cash","Living Room, Primary Bedroom","True","Laminate, Tile","True","Central","True","Cathedral Ceiling(s), Granite Counters, High Ceilings","True","True","front door","Supra","False","","False","","33.768393","Individual Room, Inside","True","False","","","1700000","","","1700000","#ERR","","","paula@paulaaragone.com","714-998-0425","Paula","","0","Aragone","","OCARAGPAU","","0","","0","H04812","714-986-1771