t features French doors that open to the deck, a vaulted beam ceiling, natural rock fireplace, recessed lights, picture windows, and an opulent bathroom with a walk-in closet. The primary bathroom features a beautiful double vanity, a huge walk-in shower area with freestanding tub, and dual shower fixtures that truly elevate the bathroom experience. The two car garage has a 220V outlet and direct access to the kitchen and an attached bonus room that can be used as a workshop or home gym. Other upgrades include recessed lighting throughout, new plumbing and electrical, central heating and AC, dual pane vinyl windows, new flooring, and more. This home offers a peaceful retreat from the hustle and bustle of city life, yet is still conveniently located just minutes away from amenities like grocery stores, restaurants, banks, shops, movie theaters, pet needs, and more). The residence is in the highly sought after award-winning PVP Unified School District. Beautiful beaches, golf courses, and hiking trails are close by, and the home has direct access to a horse trail in the rear of the property. One of the best places to call home in Southern California! A safe, peaceful neighborhood great for dog walking and extremely family friendly.","Bitumen, Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Bonus Room, Den, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet, Workshop","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Alvaro","Zavala","PWZAVAALV","PB17474","","","SellorBuy Inc.","2360000","False","Full Service","Vacant go direct","","None","False","True","2504","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Middlecrest","","5205","Road","","Ranch","Conventional","","23399","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Underground Utilities, Water Connected","Park/Greenbelt, Pasture, Trees/Woods","True",""