gners, or end-users to create a true coastal masterpiece. Located just minutes from award-winning schools, scenic hiking trails at nearby Del Cerro Park, and the stunning Palos Verdes shoreline, this home offers both privacy and opportunity in one of the South Bay?s most desirable enclaves.  Property has been priced according to the appraisal attached. This is a trust sale.  Bring your vision and transform this diamond in the rough into a legacy ocean-view estate.   Highest & Best offers requested by 8/26/ 25 to be reviewed 8/27/25.   Thank you!","Tile","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Vista Grande","Peninsula","Ridgecrest","","Dawei","Hao","OCHAODAWE","H07270","","","Pacific Sterling Realty","2390000","False","Full Service","Supra will be installed this evening!   GO DIRECT! Vacant, Supra located at front door, please make sure to turn off the lights and lockup.","True","None","False","","2981","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two, Multi/Split ","","","Oceanaire","","47","Drive","","Traditional","Cash, Conventional","","24817","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean","True","","","","1964","90275","5041","RPRS20000-OH*"
