s Verdes","310-544-6100","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.364451","","1","20903","Cul-De-Sac, Landscaped, Lawn, Lot 20000-39999 Sqft, Park Nearby","Golf, Hiking , Park, Suburban","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","PV24243885","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","Guest House Detached","Built-In Storage, Direct Garage Access, Garage Faces Front, Garage - Single Door","True","Patio Open, Front Porch, See Remarks","True","48","","Private, In Ground","True","Close Of Escrow","821.96","VIEWS, VIEWS, VIEWS! This charming one-level mid-century estate with guest house boasts breathtaking ocean and Catalina Island views from every bedroom and most living areas! Nestled on a serene cul-de-sac on 20,000+ sq ft lot, the beautiful home offers tranquil living in the sought-after Del Cerro neighborhood. The main house, built in 1961, spans 2,144 sq ft with 4 bedrooms and 2.5 baths. Meanwhile, a spacious 1,080 sq ft guest house, built in 1984, boasts breathtaking views from most living areas, a private bedroom, full bath, great room, and an open kitchen with a walk-in pantry/storage?a perfect retreat for guests, extended family, or creative uses. A welcoming grassy lawn and oversized driveway lead to the inviting porch and a double-door entry to the main house. Inside, the home has been freshly updated with new paint & flooring while cathedral ceilings and expansive windows/glass doors frame the stunning views. The sunken living room, complete with a cozy fireplace, opens to a manicured backyard. French doors in the dining area connect seamlessly to an outdoor deck, perfect for entertaining. The updated kitchen dazzles with new countertops, new stainless-steel appliances, and an inspiring ocean view is ideal for any home chef. The versatile family room is ready to transform into your ideal space?whether it?s for daily home entertainment, a productive home office, or any other purpose that suits your lifestyle. The private primary suite is a sanctuary, featuring panoramic views, a separate vanity area, and a dedicated bath area. Three other ocean-view bedrooms are all good size and share a separate wing with a full bathroom. A spacious garage provides extra convenience with a powder room, laundry area, and multiple built-in storage areas. Step outside to discover your personal oasis. A sparkling pool, expansive Trex deck, terraced gardens, and tranquil seating areas invite relaxation while taking in the views. This exceptional home is also close to award-winning Palos Verdes schools, parks, and trails. Don?t miss this rare opportunity to own a slice of paradise and enjoy an exceptional lifestyle.","","Entry, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, See Remarks, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Vista Grande","Peninsula","Ridgecrest","","Angelique","Lyle","vlyleang","PV8606","","","Compass","2650000","False","Full Service","Please contact the co-listing agent, Cindy Carter, at 310-388-2533 for all showings.","True","None","False","","3224","See Remarks","","CA","Closed","One","","","Oceanaire","","26","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","24817","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","Jalousies/Louvered, Plantation Shutters","1961","90275","5073","RPRS20000*"
