.5-bathroom estate offers 4,510 sqft of luxurious living space on a generous 12,057 sqft lot. Enjoy breathtaking peek-a-boo views of Catalina Island from your private retreat, complete with a sparkling swimming pool, relaxing jacuzzi, and a separate pool house featuring its own shower and bath. The outdoor oasis includes a built-in BBQ grill, perfect for entertaining or unwinding in the sunny California weather. Inside, this beautifully designed home boasts spacious bedrooms, modern finishes, and thoughtful details throughout. With plenty of room to gather, the home also provides a harmonious flow between the indoors and outdoors. The property also boasts a spacious 3-car garage, complemented by two dedicated electric vehicle charging stations and is fitted with an advanced Aquasana whole-house water filtration and softening system, ensuring optimal water quality throughout the home. Don?t miss this rare opportunity to own a slice of paradise in Rancho Palos Verdes.","","Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Multi-Level Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Montemalaga","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Ridgecrest","","Min","Zhu","SBZHUMIN","SB1312000","","","Realty ONE Group United","2700000","False","Full Service","Appointment only; call or text listing agent cell: 562-473-9331","False","In Ground","True","True","4510","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","King Arthur","","28835","Court","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","37205","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Not Available, Electricity Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Available, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Not Available, Sewer Available, Sewer Connected, Water Available, Water Connected","Catalina, Neighborhood, Ocean, Peek-A-Boo, Pool","True","","","","1985","90275","7210","RPRS"
"","0.4534","Note to Buyer and Buyer?s agent ? Listing Agent/Broker has not independently verified information stated on the MLS and has either relied on public sources of data or Seller representations. This information is not guaranteed. Buyer shall not rely on any such information and Buyer is strongly advised to independently verify all information contained herein. There were two recent deaths on the property.  Please contact listing agent for additional information.","","","172 - La Cresta","Special Assessments","True","7585036002","Controlled Access","664","","False","5","","","","5","5","","Rolling Hills Estates","#ERR","","","Damian@DeBlisGroup.com","","Damian","949-836-1140","","DeBlis","OCDEBLDAM","","","","","","OC06287","866-301-3034","The DeBlis Group, Inc","949-433-6095","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","58","2735000","#ERR","11/13/2025 10:50:19 AM","","","01/27/2026 12:00:00 AM","01/28/2026 8:31:19 AM","","","11/13/2025 12:00:00 AM","01/11/2026 12:00:00 AM","11/14/2025 9:01:10 AM","01/27/2026 12:00:00 AM","01/27/2026 12:00:00 AM","","","58","","False","","","","","","","Cash","Family Room, Living Room, Primary Bedroom","True","","True","Central","True","","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.758434","Individual Room","True","False","","","2795000","","","2795000","#ERR","949-433-6095","","JoAnne@DeBlisGroup.com","","Joanne","949-433-6095","","DeBlis","","OCDEBLJOA","","","","","OC06287","866-301-3034","The DeBlis Group, Inc","949-433-6095","","Exclusive Right With Exception","-118.386099","","2","19748","Back Yard","Suburban","","Assessor","","","OC25259758","","4","4","","1","Vacant","","","","","","","","","27","","None","False","","762.9","Single-Story Ocean-View Estate in Vantage Point  -  Inside the 24-hour guard-gated community of Vantage Point lies one of the area?s rare single-story homes with views and nearly half an acre of land. It?s the kind of property that carries a quiet confidence?the space, the air, and the light all working together in harmony.  The entry sets the tone: glass, height, and balance. Natural light moves through every room, connecting the living spaces to the landscape beyond. The step-down living room, centered around a stone fireplace, opens through French doors to the horizon. It?s an effortless transition between indoors and out, a design that lets the view do the talking.  The dining room is built for real use?comfortable for two, generous enough for twelve. Subtle ceiling detail and even light make it both formal and relaxed. The kitchen continues that rhythm: practical in layout, bright through the day, and positioned to capture the expansive backyard. The breakfast nook and family room carry that same ease, connected by flow rather than walls.  Down one hall, secondary bedrooms offer privacy and calm. Across the home, the primary suite anchors its own wing?spacious, quiet, and perfectly oriented for morning light. A nearby room serves naturally as an office, den, or guest space, depending on what life demands.  Outside, the lot opens in every direction. Nearly half an acre of usable ground, bordered by coastal air and a sense of elevation that?s hard to find anywhere else. There?s room here to breathe, to gather, to stay awhile.  Homes in Vantage Point don?t change hands often, and single-story view properties even less. This is the kind of home that fits the landscape?and the kind of address people hold onto.","","All Bedrooms Down","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Terry","Niemann","PVNIEMTHE","V8302","","","Terranea Real Estate","2735000","False","Full Service","Text Damian at (949)836-1140.  Gate access required.  Agents and Buyers will be called in and 24 hours notice appreciated.  Agents to provide business card to enter.","True","","","","3585","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Anacapa","","3","","","","Cash to New Loan","","52016","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean