nctionality and style to the space. A walk-in pantry and an adjacent laundry room further increase the functional charm. A guest/in-law bedroom en-suite on the main level also provides both privacy and convenience. On the Upper Level, the primary bedroom suite includes a sitting area with fireplace. The primary bathroom has undergone a complete transformation, featuring a spacious walk-in closet, a reconfigured shower and a standalone bathtub, as well as built-in double sinks and cabinets. A Toto automatic toilet further enhances the modern, luxurious feel of the space. Meanwhile, two additional generously sized bedrooms share a full hallway bathroom, providing comfort for family and guests. Step outside from the family room or kitchen to a beautiful large yard, featuring a sparkling pool and ample space for a BBQ area for entertaining friends and family. Additionally, a state-of-the-art water softener system has been installed, ensuring the highest quality of water throughout the home. Amenities in the gated community include 4 tennis courts, horse facilities, horse trails, and a park. This is more than a home; it's a lifestyle you will enjoy for years to come.","","Entry, Foyer, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Vista Grande","Peninsula","Ridgecrest","","Beidi","Tan","pvtanbei","v8538","2.5","%","Harvest Realty Development","2743000","False","Full Service","For all showings, please call/text Cindy Carter at 310-388-2533 to set it up. When you reach the community gate's call box, please push 523, then push ""call"" button, the phone will ring at Cindy Carter's cell phone and she will open the community gate for you.","","None","False","","3492","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Arrowhead","","12","Lane","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","30420","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Con