ce and framed by multiple French doors that invite the outdoors in. The heart of the home is the impressive chef?s kitchen?designed for both beauty and function?with a massive quartz center island featuring barstool seating, integrated sink, designer lighting and a striking pot filler over a ZLINE 6-burner stove. A custom hood, Sub-Zero refrigerator, skylights and crisp white cabinetry with matching quartz backsplash complete this bright and modern space. The kitchen opens seamlessly to the spacious family room with a cozy stone fireplace and even more French doors leading to the backyard. Outdoors, you?ll find a tranquil setting made for entertaining and relaxing. A lush lawn, sparkling pool and spa with retractable cover and multiple seating areas?including a fire pit with gas line and a dreamy al fresco dining spot nestled beneath mature trees?offer the ultimate Southern California lifestyle. The thoughtful floorplan offers privacy and versatility. A guest suite or home office with custom built-ins is situated on one end of the home, along with a full laundry room and direct access to the attached 3-car garage. On the opposite end of the house, the bedroom wing features a luxurious primary suite with a walk-in closet and spa-inspired bathroom, complete with soaking tub, glass-enclosed shower with rainfall head, dual marble-topped vanities and a dedicated makeup station. Three additional bedrooms have nice features such as vaulted ceilings, built-in desks, closet organization and custom wood details?share a second family room with sliding doors to the yard and a stylish bathroom with dual sinks and a tub/shower combo. Additional highlights include heating and A/C installed in 2020, roof installed in 2022 with 30 year warranty, recessed lighting, updated windows and doors?making this turnkey home a rare find in one of the Peninsula?s most sought-after neighborhoods.","","Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Chris","Adlam","VADLACHR","V810