ome gym. The gourmet kitchen is a showpiece with Subzero refrigerator, Wolf induction cooktop, Wolf oven, Wolf warming drawer, microwave drawer, Bosch dishwasher, and large island perfect for entertaining. The spacious primary suite offers vaulted ceilings, sweeping city views. The spa-like primary bath features a freestanding soaking tub and an expansive glass-enclosed shower. Each bathroom features modern finishes and attention to detail, such as LED-lit mirrors. The generously-sized downstairs family room boasts serene views and features a built-in bar area with mini fridge and convenient bar sink. Additional highlights include engineered hardwood flooring, thoughtfully placed lighting, and custom built-ins throughout. Outside, multiple patios and deck provide calm spaces for dining and entertaining, complemented by a hot tub and lush landscaping. The three-car garage features a work bench with built-in cabinets, an additional storage room with large utility sink, and the large driveway provides ample parking for guests. Surrounded by nature and framed by panoramic downtown and city-light views, this property offers a sense of calm and seclusion that is rare to find.  Conveniently located near Peninsula Center?s shops and restaurants and within the award-winning Palos Verdes Peninsula school district, this home offers a perfect blend of quiet luxury, privacy, and sophistication. A rare opportunity to experience refined living.","","Bonus Room, Laundry, Office, Sauna","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Mary","Swanson","CLW-X94649","CLW-B2000101","","","Coldwell Banker Realty","2830000","False","Full Service","Easy to show. Showing hours between 9 am - 4 pm. Text Shirley for showing instructions. 310-701-3346.","False","","","","3696","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Middlecrest","","5204","Road","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","23399","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected","City Lights, Neighborhood, Panoramic