en, Miele dishwasher, and Sharp microwave drawer, all beautifully complemented by quartz countertops and custom cabinetry. The spacious family and living rooms, each with its own inviting fireplace, offer an ideal setting for relaxation or entertaining. The luxurious master suite serves as a serene escape, boasting a spa-like master bath with stunning marble finishes and an expansive walk-in closet. Throughout the home, engineered white oak floors add warmth and brightness, while sleek recessed lighting and upscale tile work elevate every bathroom. New Milgard windows enhance the home?s energy efficiency and aesthetic appeal. The home has been meticulously upgraded with mostly new copper and PEX plumbing, new ABS drain lines, and a new 200-amp electrical panel. The flat-roof section has been replaced, and a new HVAC system, including air conditioning condensers in the garage, ensures year-round comfort. For added convenience, a universal plug for an electric car charger has been installed. The oversized 2-car garage, with premium epoxy concrete flooring, offers direct access to the home. Outside, lush landscaping, mature trees, and a new redwood deck create an enchanting oasis for relaxation and outdoor entertaining. From the expansive backyard, enjoy unblockable, twinkly city lights and breathtaking mountain views, offering a picturesque backdrop for every occasion. The new irrigation system, with a timer, ensures the front and back yards remain pristine. With a Ring security system, new interior doors, and a new garage door, this home provides both beauty and security. A truly custom, high-end remodel, this storybook home offers the perfect setting for creating cherished memories.","","Family Room, Great Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Christina","Blue","SCABLCHR","S6669","","","Keller Williams South Bay","2840000","False","Full Service","Ple