"","0.2309","Broker/Agent does not guarantee the accuracy of the information provided, including square footage, lot sizes, acreage, HOA info, permitted or unpermitted spaces, and/or bedroom/bathroom count. Buyer/buyer representative verify the accuracy of all information. HOA dues are billed quarterly.  Please email all offers to esther@estherliving.com. Please include the RPA, pre-approval letter, and proof of funds. The seller will choose all services. Text or Call LA1 with any questions. Thank you for showing!","Dishwasher, Double Oven, Gas Cooktop, Microwave, Refrigerator","True","172 - La Cresta","","False","7585013025","","540","","","5","0","0","0","5","5","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Co-Agent Email","","","Los Angeles","138","2850000","#ERR","08/06/2024 3:17:41 PM","","","10/29/2024 12:00:00 AM","12/18/2024 11:22:18 AM","","","08/02/2024 12:00:00 AM","10/29/2024 12:00:00 AM","12/18/2024 11:11:04 AM","12/17/2024 12:00:00 AM","12/17/2024 12:00:00 AM","","West","138","Double Door Entry, French Doors","","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Dining Room","","","","","","Cash, Conventional","Gas","True","","","Central","True","Dry Bar, Home Automation System, Open Floorplan, Recessed Lighting, Wainscoting, Wet Bar","True","True","See Remarks","Supra","","","","","33.770317","Washer Included","True","","","","3150000","","","3150000","#ERR","714-745-4727","","esther@estherliving.com","","Esther","","","Kim","","CLW-C138198","","","","","CLW-X82812","","The Partners Real Estate","213-703-6486","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.384287","75x124","","10059","Back Yard, Front Yard","","","","","","24423317","","3","3","","","","","","","","Driveway, Street","True","Enclosed","True","1","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","680.35","Located in the highly coveted Wallace Ranch of Rancho Palos Verdes, this home is turnkey and nothing short of a dream come true! Completely remodeled and upgraded, this stunning property boasts custom built-ins, fresh interior and exterior paint, new piping, upgraded outdoor drainage, exterior waterproofing, smart home features, and so much more! Spanning over 4,100 square feet of luxurious living space, this home offers five expansive bedrooms, each with its own ensuite or Jack & Jill bathroom. With four bedrooms on the second floor and one conveniently located on the first floor, this layout provides both privacy and convenience for every family member. The open floor plan and abundant windows flood the home with natural light, accentuating the modern design, wide plank luxury vinyl flooring, and elegant marble finishes. The chef's dream kitchen is a masterpiece with brand-new appliances, custom modern white cabinets, and sleek quartz countertops. The ultra-expansive primary suite is a sanctuary featuring a marble fireplace, wet bar, and dual walk-in closet. The massive dual master bathroom includes a walk-in shower and a soaking tub, providing a spa-like retreat. Step out onto the private balcony and take in the lush backyard, bursting with apple, fig, and lemon trees. Across from the primary suite, another large bedroom with a spacious ensuite offers a grand terrace perfect for enjoying stunning front yard sunsets. The step-down family room is designed for entertaining, complete with a marble fireplace and wet bar. The private and spacious outdoor living area is an entertainer's paradise with meticulously polished mature landscaping and vibrant flower beds. This estate is not just beautiful but also practical, featuring a comprehensive water filtration system and a central vacuum system throughout the house. Situated in the highly sought-after Palos Verdes Peninsula School District and just a short stroll to the middle school, this home is an absolute gem for families! Opportunities to own an estate in the exclusive Wallace Ranch community are few and far between. Seize this chance to make this spectacular property your forever home today! We can't wait to show you this extraordinary home, where every detail has been thoughtfully designed and executed to perfection. Don't miss out on this exceptional opportunity to own a piece of paradise in Wallace Ranch! Looking forward to showing you this gorgeous home! Contact Esther Kim 714-745-4727 for showings.","","Jack & Jill, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","CLW-C121738","Mia","Shin","CLW-C121738","CLW-X82812","","","The Partners Real Estate","2850000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions:  Showing Information: Call LA 1 ","","None","False","True","4189","","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Malona","","30","","","","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=JY4Uugt8CuT","","Drapes","1990","90275","4882","RPRS10000*"
