e island with built in wine refrigerator is ready to hold all your favorite wines. With Italian travertine floors in the kitchen dining room and living room, the kitchen opens up to a very private outdoor paradise with large patio, pool/spa, pergola cabana, wet bar, fire pit, several mature fruit trees.  The spectacular custom pool and patio, with grottos, waterfalls and exquisite plants, took almost one year to build.  It can only be seen to believe!  It?s the perfect setting for indoor-outdoor Southern California style living.  With 4 bedrooms, and 3.5 baths, the very large master suite upstairs has a relaxing commercial steam shower. The master suite downstairs has a pool view and the 2 other bedrooms share a Jack and Jill bathroom. The large driveway and garage provide spacious car/RV parking.","","Entry, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bedroom, Retreat, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Ridgecrest","","Larissa","Rubijevsky","VRUBILAR","V7946","2.5","%","RE/MAX Estate Properties","3010000","False","Full Service","Text or call Cathy at (310) 350-5334 or Bart at (310) 872-0778 for appointment.","True","In Ground","True","True","2935","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Crestridge","","28658","Road","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","23399","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","https://www.wellcomemat.com/mls/54fb5f767d0a1lird","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=UKZNemPPHpE&brand=0&mls=1&","","1959","90275","",""
