 conveniently located near top-rated schools, shopping, dining, and recreational amenities. This home features five spacious bedrooms, including a luxurious master suite with three closets, a soaking tub, and direct access to the pool. There are four elegantly appointed and recently updated bathrooms. The expansive living space spans 3,247 sq. ft., designed on a single level to offer abundant natural light. The gourmet kitchen boasts quartzite countertops, two ovens, two wine refrigerators, and a wet bar, making it perfect for the home chef and entertainer. The formal living room includes a cozy fireplace, a separate family room, and a formal, spacious dining area.  The beautifully landscaped yard features a spacious Ipe wooden deck, ideal for outdoor dining and relaxation, plus a sparkling swimming pool and built-in water fountain. An attached three-car garage includes ample built-in storage. Modern amenities include dual-zoned heating, and a security system for added peace of mind. Situated in one of Rancho Palos Verdes' most sought-after neighborhoods, this home offers easy access to scenic hiking trails, pristine beaches, and premier golf courses. Enjoy panoramic views of the canyon and trees from multiple vantage points within the home. Located within the highly acclaimed Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District, this meticulously maintained property offers the perfect blend of elegance and functionality, making it an ideal home for families and entertainers alike. Don?t miss the opportunity to make 5201 Middlecrest Rd your new address. Schedule a private tour today and experience the luxury and serenity this exceptional home has to offer!","Composition","Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Chris","Broadhurst","SBROACHR","SB1359480","2.5","%","Chris Broadhurst","3015000","False","Full Service","Easy to show! Please schedule