al vanities, and separate shower. An adjacent room, accessible through French doors, adds flexibility as an inner sanctum or fifth bedroom. Additional highlights include a full-size laundry room with elevated appliances, a three-car garage with framed glass doors, and eco-friendly upgrades like dual-pane windows and solar panels (fully paid!) for both home and pool?cutting electric bills to near zero. The home also features newer central HVAC and a Presidential shingle roof. Commuting downtown  and just Minutes from scenic beaches, parks, horse trails, and award-winning Palos Verdes schools?this home is exceptional!","Composition, Shingle","Entry, Family Room, Foyer, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Multi-Level Bedroom, Office, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Tom","Replogle","SREPLTOM","S5747","","","The Realestate Group","3028000","False","Full Service","Please call Sandy Yousif for a private showing at (424) 254 9094  and try to give at least 2 hours of advance notice.","True","In Ground, Solar Heated","True","","3767","Estimated","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Crestridge","","28852","Road","","Contemporary, Craftsman, Mid Century Modern","Cash to New Loan","","23163","","Single Family Residence","","Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Underground Utilities, Water Connected","Canyon, City Lights, Pasture","True","","","Bay Window(s), Double Pane Windows","1976","90275","5063","RPRS20000&E*"
