 community of Rancho Palos Verdes. Built in 1988 and situated on an expansive 15,000+ sq ft lot, this impressive home offers over 7,200 sq ft of living space, featuring 6 bedrooms, 4.5 bathrooms, and a 4-car garage. The property exudes volume and light with soaring ceilings, bright interiors, and unobstructed views of the Pacific Ocean. Designed for the ultimate Southern California coastal lifestyle, the backyard features a sparkling pool, spa, and cold plunge pool, ideal for entertaining or relaxing beneath endless blue skies. The Island View community offers two tennis/pickleball courts and a prime location central to top-rated Palos Verdes Unified schools, shopping, and dining. While the home needs some TLC, it presents an incredible opportunity to reimagine a classic architectural gem into a modern coastal masterpiece. Live the Palos Verdes dream ? where every day feels like a vacation and every sunset paints your ocean-view backdrop.","","Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","CRYSTAL","CHEN","SBCHENCRY","SB1376000","","","Crystal Real Estate","3500000","False","Full Service","IN COMPLIACNCE WITH MLS ""COMING SOON"" RULES, ABSOLUTELY NO SHOWING UNTIL MLS STATUS CHANGES TO ""ACTIVE"". Please DO NOT ASK.  After we go live on MLS, very easy to show. Call/Text Sep at 310-346-4666 to set up an appointment. Once it is confirmed, L/A will provide the location of the Supra Lockbox. Thanks for showing. Feel Free to use ShowingTime if you want.","","","","","7273","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Three Or More ","","","Santa Catalina","","40","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, Submit","","38848","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://show.tours/40santacatalinadr?b=0","","","1988","90275","",""
