n Ground","True","","901.44","Located in the sought-after Del Cerro neighborhood, this stunning custom-built residence on almost half an acre blends modern design, resort-style amenities and thoughtful details throughout. Designed for everyday comfort as well as entertaining, the home offers seamless indoor/outdoor living with 5 sets of NanaWall accordion doors, open-concept living spaces and a floor plan that balances functionality with luxury. From the climate-controlled wine cellar to the custom kitchen and ADU, every element of this property has been carefully curated. Inside, the exhibition kitchen serves as the heart of the home, anchored by a large center island with abundant storage. High-end features include a powerful wok burner, new Sub-Zero refrigerator, dual Bosch dishwashers and stainless countertops that extend into an oversized pantry with an additional refrigerator and freezer. A built-in dining credenza adds convenience, while the living area is enhanced by a cozy fireplace. The primary suite offers a California Closets wardrobe system and a spa-style bath with heated floors, dual vanities, large walk-in shower with rain head and Toto washlet. Additional bedrooms feature custom closets, a built-in Murphy bed and sliding doors leading to the lush backyard. A dedicated laundry room with washer, dryer and generous folding counters adds ease of living. Wine enthusiasts will appreciate the temperature-controlled, 1,200+ bottle wine cellar, while upgraded media features include a new 80? smart TV, surround sound and Sonos audio system throughout. The ADU provides ultimate flexibility with a Viking stove, refrigerator drawers, heated floors, large shower, built-in seating area, and its own HVAC system. The exterior offers true resort-style amenities. Outdoor features include a sport court, large Jacuzzi with WiFi control, pool with new electric cover and auto-fill, multiple fire features with seating areas, a custom putting green with six holes and covered patios with sunshades. Premier landscaping frames the property, with raised vegetable beds, mature fruit trees and a rose garden, all maintained by a WiFi-enabled Rachio sprinkler system. Additional highlights include 59 solar panels with two Enphase battery backups, a Halo whole-house water filtration system, rare four-car garage with EV charging, no-step entries and custom metal gates. With a perfect blend of comfort, style, and innovation, this Del Cerro home sets a new standard for Rancho Palos Verdes living.","","Laundry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Brittney","Austin","SBUNNBRI","S5267","","","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","3750000","False","Full Service","Call or text Britt for showings","","Heated, In Ground","True","","4160","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Crestwind","","1","Drive","","","Submit","","24872","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood","True","","","","2008","90275","",""
