e to your private oasis?an entertainer?s dream. The backyard showcases a spectacular pool with cascading waterfalls and fire features, spa, swim-in-place pool, built-in barbecue, and firepit?designed to rival any luxury resort. Other premium features include a whole-home water softener and filtration system, elegant architectural details, and a rare combination of scale, style, and comfort. Homes of this caliber rarely come to market?don't miss the chance to experience this extraordinary residence for yourself.","Tile","Bonus Room, Den, Exercise Room, Family Room, Formal Entry, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Jack & Jill, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Ian","Ferguson","CLW-C121665","CLW-X82304","","","Greenspan Realty","3980000","False","Full Service","The property is occupied. Please text/call Sherif @ 310-694-4671 three hours in advance to arrange private showings.","True","Gunite, Heated, In Ground","True","True","4732","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Costa Verde","","51","","","Contemporary, Custom Built, Modern","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","44514","","Single Family Residence","","","Trees/Woods","True","https://www.wellcomemat.com/mls/5a88e4a81bcd1m4v1","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=nAzmwNJwxUs&mls=1","Roller Shields, Screens, Skylight(s), Tinted Windows","1990","90275","4880","RPRS10000*"
