-new kitchen, featuring new cabinets and top-of-the-line Viking appliances, perfect for any cooking enthusiast. Adjacent to the kitchen is a charming breakfast room with a beautiful view of the expansive backyard. The elegant formal dining room and nearby family room, which opens to the huge private backyard, offer additional spaces for gatherings and entertaining. The outdoor kitchen enhances the backyard?s appeal, making it perfect for alfresco dining and entertaining. The primary suite, featuring brand-new carpet, includes a fireplace, a private balcony overlooking the lush backyard garden, and a luxurious bathroom with a separate tub, a roomy shower, dual sinks, a vanity, and a separate toilet room with a bidet. The master bedroom also offers a cozy sitting area with its own fireplace. A notable feature of this home is the two individual 2-car garages, providing space for up to 4 vehicles, built-in storage, and a laundry room adjacent to one of the garages. Additionally, the home is equipped with a solar roof and had a new roof installed in 2021. The home also includes a one-bedroom suite on the first floor, ideal for guests or a home office. The elegant formal dining room, expansive family room, and sparkling pool add to the charm of this designer home. Located in the heart of the Palos Verdes Peninsula, this home is close to shopping, dining, top schools, golf courses, hiking trails, and parks. The lushly landscaped, park-size 17,277 square foot lot provides a serene and picturesque setting. This exquisite home features the preferred Vantage Pointe floor plan in one of the finest neighborhoods on the Palos Verdes Peninsula. With a 24/7 guard-gated entrance, you can enjoy peace of mind and a true sense of community. Don't miss the opportunity to own this magnificent property in The Vantage Pointe. This is a must-see!","","Family Room, Foyer, Living Room, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Ian","Ferguson","CLW-C121665","CLW-