 Extremely private and beautifully updated 4-bed and 4-bath residence is spacious, stylish, & ready to move in. The elegant foyer offers double door entry, the formal dining room has built-in cabinets and a beautiful chandelier. The completely remodeled kitchen has a large countertop space, oak eating table, two dishwashers, 6 gas burners with grill, a microwave, a sub-zero freezer, pantry, an abundance of storage, and cozy Breakfast nook. A gracious living room and comfortable family room has custom built-in cabinets, double sided marble finished fireplace, artwork lights, and provides for plenty of entertaining space at the center of the home. Spacious bedrooms and updated bathrooms. One bedroom has a built-in Murphy bed and desk.  The expansive primary suite offers a sitting area with a fireplace, his/her separate walk-in closets with cabinets/shelves, a huge bath with a separate tub and a roomy shower, two sinks, marble heated floor, heated towel rack, and French door to backyard. Professionally landscaped entertainer's backyard with covered seating area with fans, heaters, speakers, outdoor built-in kitchen and LYNX BBQ sets. Luxurious resort style pool with automated cover and jacuzzi holds infinite possibilities for impeccable entertaining and amazing year-round indoor-outdoor living. Separate laundry room with sink, built-in laundry bins, and shelves. Direct access to 4 car garage (Currently Art Studio in one car parking space). Beautifully landscaped front yard with circular driveway and fountain. Additional features are wide plank wood flooring, recessed lights, crown moldings, window coverings, water filter system, SONOS sound system, wired for emergency generator, and too many upgrades to list. Superb location in the heart of Palos Verdes Peninsula, close to shopping, restaurants, award-winning schools, golf, hiking, and parks. This upscale home is truly a masterpiece and won't last long!","","Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laund