hrough the double doors to the two-story foyer.??The large living room to the right features cathedral ceilings and a magnificent fireplace adjacent to the formal dining room.??The spacious kitchen is appointed with high end appliances and an oversized island open to the breakfast table and living room complete with another cozy fireplace.??The main level is designed for family living and entertaining with its connection to the backyard and game room off the living room.??The back yard has been transformed into a resort like oasis including a pool with a slide, separate hot tub, sport court, putting green, Argentinian style BBQ and lush landscaping with views of the Pacific Ocean.??Walk around the corner to access a second, freestanding garage which can double as a guest house, artist's studio or gym.  Back inside, two large bedrooms with connected baths, a large laundry room and powder bath complete the downstairs.??The primary suite on the second floor is the perfect place to escape to after a long day with a spa like bathroom, separate sitting area with a fireplace and a private balcony with spectacular ocean views.??Two other bedrooms on this level are perfect for kid?s rooms, guest rooms or at home offices.??This opulent estate is ready for you to call home.","Tile","Family Room, Game Room, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Vista Grande","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Ridgecrest","","Mingli","Wang","SWANGMIN","SB1365220","2.5","%","Realty One Group United","4450000","False","Full Service","Call Heather Jacobson at 650-392-4484.  Gated community, must have appointment and show business card at front gate for entry.","False","Private","True","","4678","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Santa Cruz","","12","","","","Cash to New Loan","","52016","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Neighborhood, Ocean, Water","True","","","","2000","90274","5402","RESRD*"
"","0.5638","Enclosed sun porch is included in square footage. Subject to seller buying upleg property already identified.","Dishwasher, Disposal, Microwave, Refrigerator","True","172 - La Cresta","Unknown","True","7585037017","Maintenance Grounds, Guard, Security, Controlled Access","617","","False","5","","","","5","4","","Rolling Hills Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Email","Agent Text Message","Office Fax","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","33","4450000","#ERR","09/14/2023 6:19:45 PM","","05/28/2024 9:23:33 AM","06/05/2024 12:00:00 AM","07/19/2024 3:08:24 PM","06/04/2024 12:00:00 AM","","09/14/2023 12:00:00 AM","06/05/2024 12:00:00 AM","06/03/2024 2:13:31 PM","07/19/2024 12:00:00 AM","07/19/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","33","","False","Breakfast Nook","","","","","","Cash","Living Room","True","Carpet, Tile, Wood","True","Central","True","Cathedral Ceiling(s), High Ceilings, Open Floorplan, Pantry, Recessed Lighting","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.760016","Individual Room","True","False","","CC And R's, Homeowners Association","4750000","","","4699000","#ERR","","","suzannetdyer@gmail.com","","Suzanne","","","Dyer","","VDYERSUZ","","","","","V8407","310-541-6560","Strand Hill Properties","310-541-6566","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.38807","","58","24559","Back Yard, Cul-De-Sac, Front Yard, Landscaped, Lawn, Lot 20000-39999 Sqft, Yard","Curbs","","Assessor","","","PV23172751","","4","8","","67","Owner","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Garage","True","Enclosed Glass Porch","True","75","","Private, Heated","True","Close Of Escrow","878.58","Situated on high ground in the center of the sought-after 67-home, 24/7 Guard-Gated community, The Vantage Pointe. This two-level Mediterranean home features 4 bd, 5ba and 5,065 Sq Ft; the portico reveals a large motorcourt and the 2 garages leading into the house. One may immediately notice the carpet of thick green lawn surrounding the house, which is weed-resistant, drought-tolerant Kurapia groundcover; it requires mowing only once a year. An impressive, grand hallway welcomes visitors, with a view into the glass walled office to the left and the ocean in front. Stepping into the living room, one notices the two-story high ceiling, inviting two-way fireplace and openness to the dining room and kitchen beyond to the right. The kitchen has all new appliances with ?two of everything,? from microwave ovens to full size Thermidor ovens to dishwashers and sinks as well as a warming oven, walk-in pantry, and breakfast area. The glass walled patio is equipped with ceiling-mounted heaters and sun-blocking shades for year- round use and offers inviting views of the waterfall/heated saltwater pool, ocean, firepit, lush landscaping, and outdoor kitchen.The pool has a multitude of colorful underwater lighting options after dark. Enjoy movie night in the expansive family room with its own fireplace, and an adjacent second heated patio with automated sun-blocking shades and raised outdoor kitchen beyond. Stepping back into the house, you will find the laundry room with a second refrigerator, and a large bedroom suite on the main level. All of the bedrooms have completely renovated, full en suite bathrooms. The primary bedroom and guest bedroom have views of the ocean and Malibu,with particularly spectacular sunsets in the winter. The primary bedroom has two large walk-in closets. All but one closet in the house were designed and installed by California Closets. The Master Bath has a separate lavatory with two towel warming/drying racks and contains a large, two-headed shower and a luxurious tub with a unique feature: a ceiling tub-filler, which is a grand surprise to everyone who turns it on and discovers water splashing down into the tub from the ceiling fixture hidden amongst the hanging ceiling lights and a third warming towel rack which doubles as a modern chrome sculptural work of art. The dual 2 car garages feature newly installed, wall-mounted electric car charging outlets and California Closet cabinets. There are 2 new water heaters and 2 new A/C units.","","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Sun, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Stephen","Haw","VHAWSTE","V8040","2.5","%","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","4450000","False","Full Service","Showings start Friday May 10th.  Text agent to show with 24 hour notice.  310-528-7480. Agent to meet for all showings.  Gated community.","True","Private","True","","5065","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Santa Rosa","","3","","","","Cash, Cash To Existing Loan, Cash to New Loan","","52016","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Ocean","True","https://unbranded.youriguide.com/3_santa_rosa_rolling_hills_estates_ca","https://realestateconnectpro.com/3-Santa-Rosa/idx","","1999","90274","5405","RESRD*"
