, panoramic ocean vistas. This home, lovingly maintained by its original family, occupies a coveted location carefully selected for its expansive views and tranquil surroundings. Developed by Cayman Development, homeowners were granted the unique opportunity to 'semi-customize' their residences, and these discerning owners spared no expense in selecting the finest materials and upgrades, including the installation of an elevator.  For a comprehensive list of upgrades, please refer to the MLS addendum. Presently configured as a four-bedroom home with an office, this model offers the flexibility of converting the upstairs family room into a fifth bedroom with a private bath. Additionally, a spacious landing with breathtaking views presents the perfect space for a second office or den area.  The grandeur of this residence is evident upon entry, with a formal living room featuring soaring two-story ceilings with fireplace and walls of glass, while the formal dining room exudes both drama and coziness. A sizable downstairs family room, located adjacent to the kitchen, seamlessly connects to beautiful patios, ideal for entertaining while relishing the expansive views.  The kitchen, both dramatic and elegant, boasts top-of-the-line appliances, a generous island, a walk-in pantry, a butler?s pantry, and a casual dining area, all overlooking the stunning ocean vistas. A large laundry room is located off the kitchen with an additional Sub-Zero refrigerator and ample cabinet space for storage. Completing the main level is an extraordinary four-car attached garage with additional storage room and built in storage.  The primary suite epitomizes luxury, offering a fireplace, a private deck, a private living room, and a spectacular bath with expansive his and her closets. Outside, the meticulously manicured grounds feature lush landscaping and a spacious lawn, perfect for hosting gatherings. There are three bedrooms upstairs with the potential for a fourth and a guest suite with p