windows, plantation shutters, an automatic sprinkler system in both the front and the back yards, and central heating. The location is an easy walk to Vista Grande Elementary School but not close enough to hear daily activities during recess. This home is a must-see. The homeowner loved living in this active yet quiet neighborhood and never thought to move.","Composition","All Bedrooms Down, Attic, Center Hall, Entry, Galley Kitchen, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes / LAUSD ? inquire","Vista Grande","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Ridgecrest","","Kevin","Gallaher","CLW-V81311","CLW-X2002570","2.5","%","RE/MAX ESTATE PROPERTIES","1500000","False","Full Service","Please call Karen at 310-614-2504 for time of showing. 7:30am to 9pm showing times.","True","None","False","True","1434","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Golden Meadow","","28236","Drive","","Bungalow","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","27132","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","None","False","","","Double Pane Windows, Plantation Shutters, Skylight(s)","1962","90275","2922","RPRS10000"
