lose Of Escrow","788.53","A Place to Call Home in Rancho Palos Verdes!  For the first time in over 60 years, this cherished four-bedroom, two-bathroom single-level home is ready to welcome a new owner. Nestled in the highly desirable Los Verdes neighborhood and located within the award-winning Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District, this is more than a house?it?s an opportunity to create a lifetime of memories.  Step inside to this one story charmer with over 2,000 square feet of thoughtfully designed living space with vaulted ceilings, new carpet, and fresh interior paint. The spacious family room is truly the heart of the home?generously sized with custom built-ins and sliding doors that open to a peaceful backyard, perfect for gatherings, entertainment, playtime, or quiet moments under the stars. The spacious kitchen is ideal for cooking and connection, with ample storage, a breakfast bar, and a bright eat-in area. The open flow from the dining room to the living room makes entertaining effortless, while four bedrooms offer space for family, guests, a home office, or creative pursuits. Updated features include dual-pane windows, a tankless water heater, 200-amp electrical panel, and a newer HVAC and A/C system (installed in 2017). A two-car attached garage (direct access) with built-in storage and a wide driveway offer practicality and ease.  The flat grassy yard and patio are a blank canvas?ready for your dream garden, outdoor kitchen, or simply a place to unwind. Enjoy quiet strolls through the neighborhood, top-tier schools including a short walk to Vista Grande Elementary, and close proximity to parks, golf courses, hiking trails, restaurants, and shopping. This well-loved home is full of warmth, light, and potential. Come and see where your next chapter begins.","Asphalt, Shingle","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Sam","Lou","SLOUSAM","s