ted with HVAC system and attic fan, upgraded electrical system, new garage door and paved driveway, and a dedicated indoor laundry room for added convenience. Located just minutes from the Peninsula Center?s shops and dining, this home offers peaceful living with proximity to top amenities such as hiking trails with ocean views, excellent schools, and so much more! Don't miss this opportunity to own a stunning home in one of the most lovely and sought after neighborhoods on the Palos Verdes Peninsula!!","Asphalt","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","CRYSTAL","CHEN","SBCHENCRY","SB1376000","","","Crystal Real Estate","1750000","False","Full Service","DO NOT GO DIRECT! Home is occupied w/homeowners. A 2 hour notice required before showing. Text if need earlier time and I will see if we can accommodate your time need. TXT agent PRIOR to showing at 310.431.8826. Text me your business card, as well. LOCK ALL DOORS upon leaving.Please DOUBLE CHECK! COMBO USERS: Please do NOT leave combo code numbers on the combo upon leaving. Move numbers around and close cover.","True","Private, Above Ground, Heated","True","True","1935","Other","","CA","Closed","One","","","Monero","","6602","Drive","","Ranch","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","25107","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Available, Water Connected","Ocean, Peek-A-Boo","True","https://unbranded.youriguide.com/6602_monero_dr_rancho_palos_verdes_ca/","https://youtu.be/AJosXIDeIhU","Blinds, Double Pane Windows, ENERGY STAR Qualified Windows, Insulated Windows, Screens","1962","90275","3208","RPRS10000*"
