utifully remodeled kitchen with gorgeous stone counter tops, fine wood cabinetry, and stainless appliances. Directly off the open kitchen is the large dinning room with plantation style shutters allowing more natural light to enter the home. There are 4 bedrooms and 2 baths, all in a highly sought after single level floor plan, with a huge master suite, large walk-in closet and on suite bathroom. And lets not forget the manicured backyard and outdoor living spaces. Enjoy your time on the covered patio with family and friends while taking in views of the pacific ocean and Catalina Island. This home really feels like home. It's excellent condition provides a great opportunity for its next owner to move right in and continue the legacy of good clean living. This home is the perfect example of a true Rancho Palos Verdes gem!","","Entry, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Office, See Remarks, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Daniel","Grieco","PVGRIEDAN","V8040","","","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","1765000","False","Full Service","Please schedule showings by calling or texting (310) 977-0190. Please do not go direct. Shown by appointment only so please Do not use ""Showing Time"". Price reduced for quick sale. New electrical panel just installed. Owner passed away peacefully in the home of natural causes within the last 3 years.","","","","True","1856","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Abbottswood","","6528","Drive","","","Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","27134","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Ocean","True","","","","1963","90275","3106","RPRS10000*"
