tigious Los Verdes neighborhood of Rancho Palos Verdes, this exceptional home offers a perfect fusion of coastal elegance and practical design. Boasting 4 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms within its 1806 sqft expanse, this residence stands as a testament to thoughtful living in one of Southern California's most coveted communities. From the moment you arrive, the attached two-car garage delivers convenience and functionality. Stepping through the garage into the over-sized laundry room speaks to the practicality that underpins the residence, ensuring that daily tasks are met with ease. The heart of this home is the open living room and dining room combo, where a welcoming fireplace creates an intimate ambiance, perfect for both relaxation and entertaining. Expanding beyond the interior, the well-appointed backyard beckons with perfection?a carefully manicured landscape that invites you to savor the outdoors. An organic vegetable garden adds a touch of sustainable living, allowing you to enjoy the freshest produce just steps from your home. For those with a passion for leisure, a putting green awaits in the front yard, providing an oasis for golf enthusiasts. As you step onto the green, an ocean view unfolds, framing each day with the beauty of the Pacific and Catalina Island.  The home is situated just two blocks away from Agua Amarga Trailhead. This nature preserve and hiking trail takes you down a moderate descent of two miles and 577 ft to the bluffs at Lunada Bay where you can enjoy sunset views of the Pacific or venture down another short trail to the waters edge for exploring along the shore.  In addition to the allure of the surroundings, this residence is situated in a great school district, ensuring an excellent education for the family. With meticulous attention to detail and a location that embodies the best of coastal living, this home in Los Verdes is not just a property; it's an invitation to experience the quintessential California lifestyle in a setting where luxury meets tranquility.","Asphalt","All Bedrooms Down, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Media Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Vista Grande","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","Evan","Jay","SJAYEVAN","S5251","2.5","%","RE/MAX Estate Properties","1825000","False","Full Service","Showing by appointment only. Owner occupied. Pre-approval letter required before showing.","True","None","False","","1806","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Abbottswood","","6719","Drive","","Traditional","Cash to New Loan","","27134","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean","True","https://www.wellcomemat.com/mls/558r2eac13fa1lgu5","","Plantation Shutters, Screens","1963","90275","3178","RPRS10000*"
