s","902.88","This beautifully remodeled Rancho Palos Verdes home offers stunning ocean views and a thoughtfully designed living experience. Nestled on the west side of the Peninsula, just one block from Palos Verdes Estates and within the highly sought-after Palos Verdes school district, this move-in-ready gem has been meticulously upgraded for modern comfort and lasting value. Since its complete remodel in 2021, the current owners have continued enhancing the home with strategic upgrades, including all new window coverings with automatic blinds throughout the house, a new 200-amp electrical panel, a new furnace and A/C system, washer and dryer, and an upgraded garage with new cabinetry a water line to a second refrigerator. The kitchen has been completely remodeled with new countertops, backsplash, and high-end appliances, including a new stove, oven, hood, and wine refrigerator. The primary bedroom and bathroom have also been renovated to create a serene retreat with a small balcony, 2 large closets, double sink, and remodeled. The downstairs bathroom has been upgraded as well, enhancing both style and functionality. The backyard is perfect for entertaining with a new gas line to the pool and BBQ, upgraded electrical for outdoor lighting, and newly poured concrete and steps up the hill to a patio with a 180-degree ocean view of Catalina Island and Queen's Necklace?your very own oasis! Electrical was added to light the steps up to the patio. The pool was refinished with new plaster, tile, lighting, pumps, and filter in 2021, and the current owner added a pool heater. Additional upgrades to the outside include new fencing, gates, built-in storage on the side of the house, and new concrete along the side and front of the home?all enhancing functionality and curb appeal.  Located in one of the most sought-after areas in the Palos Verdes Peninsula, and just minutes away from dining and shopping (the Peninsula Center and Promenade PV), top-rated schools, parks, hiking, horse trails, Torrance Beach, golf and much more! With its modern updates, prime location, and potential for even greater personalization, this is an incredible opportunity for buyers looking for a move-in-ready home with long-term investment value. Don't miss your chance to own this beautifully updated property in a premier coastal community!","Shingle","Converted Bedroom, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Vista Grande","Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","Lauren","Yoon","VLEELAU","V8040","","","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","1850000","False","Full Service","The property is still occupied by Seller. Showings by appointment only. Next open house is Saturday 4/19 at 1-4pm.","False","","","","2049","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Monero","","6638","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","25107","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","Blinds","1962","90275","3208","RPRS10000*"
