indows framing breathtaking panoramic views of the sparkling Pacific Ocean. Natural light floods the room, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere. The kitchen, although in its original state, offers ample space and provides an excellent opportunity to design a culinary haven tailored to your tastes. Consider preparing your favorite meals while gazing out at the vast ocean. The five bedrooms offer plenty of space for your family, guests, or even a home office or hobby room. The three bathrooms provide everyone with convenience and comfort. Step outside to find a tranquil haven and an entertainer's paradise. The spacious backyard provides limitless opportunities for creating your own oasis, from hosting lively gatherings to quiet relaxation. The majestic ocean view provides a stunning backdrop for experiencing breathtaking sunsets and starlit nights. This home in Rancho Palos Verdes is located in a highly desirable neighborhood known for its schools, natural beauty, and tranquil surroundings. Enjoy the close proximity to beautiful hiking trails, picturesque parks, and the community's charm. Home has newer Air Conditioning and newer windows throughout.  Tons of potential to make it your own.  Don't miss your chance to make this haven yours and experience coastal living at its finest.","","All Bedrooms Up, Kitchen, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Justin","Miller","PVMILLJUS","S6107","2.5","%","Beach City Brokers","1890000","False","Full Service","Go Direct.  Please call Justin with any questions.  310-619-9389. Thanks for showing.","True","","","","2440","Estimated","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Trailriders","","28503","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","27133","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","","","","1964","90275","3049","RPRS10000*"
