 schools, and all the activities this vibrant community has to offer. Don?t miss the opportunity to call this modern luxury your home!","Composition, Metal","Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Vista Grande","Peninsula","Ridgecrest","","Chris","Adlam","vadlachr","V8107","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","2150000","False","Full Service","Easy to show. Go ahead and show the house at any time. Supra Lockbox is installed at the pipe inside the right side gate when you face the house.","","None","False","True","1973","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Braidwood","","28111","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","25108","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/467879","","Double Pane Windows, Roller Shields","1964","90275","3176","RPRS10000*"
