ing.  The kitchen has granite counters, an island with a butcherblock counter, a greenhouse window and custom touches.  There is direct access into the kitchen from the oversized 2 car garage. Up a short staircase is the large primary bedroom with a magnificent view and attached custom bath. The other three bedrooms (one has been turned into an office, but could be a bedroom again, if needed) are down a short staircase and have their own full bath.   This home is in the Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District with nearby shopping, dining, parks, golf course and hiking trails. What an opportunity!  What a special home!","Other","Converted Bedroom, Foyer, Great Room, Kitchen, Primary Suite, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Shawn","Nejad","VNEJASHA","V7804","","","Berkshire Hathaway HomeService","2350000","False","Full Service","Go direct.  Please be sure everything is locked when you leave.","True","None","False","","2484","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Hazelridge","","28413","Drive","","Mid Century Modern","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","27133","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Ocean","True","","","","1964","90275","3127","RPRS10000*"
