ITH CATALINA TO MALIBU UNOBSTRUCTED VIEWS****  Welcome home to this stunning, thoroughly remodeled single-family home nestled in the highly sought-after Los Verdes neighborhood of Rancho Palos Verdes. Boasting 2,056 sq ft of living space on an expansive 12,494 sq ft lot, this 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom residence offers a bright and open floor plan filled with natural light. Step inside to find elegant luxury vinyl plank flooring throughout, along with a thoughtfully designed laundry area featuring built-in cabinets and a washer/dryer for your convenience. The well-appointed kitchen is equipped with a gas range, dishwasher, and refrigerator, new countertops and backsplash that is perfect for all your cooking needs. Additionally, all three bathrooms have been tastefully remodeled. But the real showstopper is the backyard oasis that awaits you. Step outside and be mesmerized by the breathtaking panoramic ocean views that stretch from Catalina to Malibu. These incredible views can be enjoyed from the living room, dining room and two of the bedrooms, including the luxurious primary suite with a spacious walk-in closet and ensuite bathroom. This amazing property also includes a private front AND rear yard, as well as a 2 car attached garage with tons of storage. Don't miss out on the opportunity to call this home yours and wake up to these incredible views every day. This is a rare find that won't last long - come see it for yourself!","","Kitchen, Main Floor Bedroom, Utility Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Lisa","Bielat","OCBIELALI","OC07952","2.5","%","Compass","2395000","False","Full Service","Public Open houses will be May 18th/19th 1-4p. All other showings require 24-hour advance notice. Can go direct once approved by Listing agent.","","None","False","","2056","Public Records","","CA","Closed","One","","","Hazelridge Dr","","28523","","","","Conventional","","27134","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Conn