room, 3-bath house, with unobstructed panoramic ocean view from Catalina to Malibu, is a rare opportunity to own as home! Sitting in the backyard, with a cup of tea or coffee, enjoy the endless blue and fiery sunset and rest your mind. The ocean can be seen from the living room, kitchen, and bedrooms upstairs. Walk thorough the gated private front yard, you are welcomed by the panoramic ocean view and sufficient nature lights. Featured by the open floor plan, new engineered wood floor, and cozy fireplace, the living room is ideal for family entertainment and get-together. Newly remodeled kitchen has the door to lead to the backyard and features with the island, new appliances, and water purifier. The dining area is connected to the attached 2-car garage. All bedrooms are located upstairs. Master suite enjoys the fabulous view of ocean, and is featured with the walk-in closet and remodeled full bathroom. A lot of updates, new roof, new insulation at attic, new engineering wood floor, new bathrooms, new kitchen, new recessed lights, fresh interior paint and recently renewed due paned windows and sliding doors. The laundry area is in the garage. Located in the award-winning PVPUSD school district, near to Vista Grande Elementary, Ridgecrest Middle school and two high schools. Close to the hiking trails, Fred Hesse park, Ryan park, Los Verdes golf course, whale watching project point, Terranea Resort, and more, this property truly encapsulates the highly sought-after Palos Verdes' nature beauty and lifestyle. Do not let this rare opportunity to pass you by. It is a must-see!","Shingle","All Bedrooms Up, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Silvia","Schwar","sbschwsil","S6107","2.5","%","Beach City Brokers","2615000","False","Full Service","Easy to show. Please contact the listing agent Yang LI @3109952793 for the showing appointment. Offer submission is due at 5PM on March 19th. Please send th