ery level. Sunlight floods the home through large windows, highlighting elegant finishes and creating a warm, inviting atmosphere. The great room includes a built-in sound system, perfect for entertaining or relaxing in style. With three generously sized bedrooms, each room feels airy and open. The primary suite features vaulted ceilings and a spacious bathroom with dual sinks. The chef?s kitchen is a culinary dream, equipped with granite countertops, a breakfast bar, and top-of-the-line appliances, including a built-in Sub-Zero refrigerator. Direct indoor access from the attached garage, leading through a hallway that connects the laundry room, elevator, and kitchen?streamlining your daily routine. Just off the great room and entryway, a versatile bonus room ideal for a home office, creative studio, or personal retreat tailored to your lifestyle. Extremely convenient location close to shops and restaurants. Just 3?5 minute walk to Ralphs Fresh Fare, and nearly equal distance between the Peninsula Shopping Center and the Golden Cove Shopping Center.","","All Bedrooms Up, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, See Remarks, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","FAYE","ZHANG","WS82852","9657","","","HARVEST REALTY DEVELOPMENT","1500000","False","Full Service","Lockbox will be installed Saturday August 16th at 1 PM. The third bedroom does not have a closet in the room.  The seller is the original owner and when purchasing the home wanted an office.","True","","","","2546","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Pepper Tree","","15","Lane","","Mediterranean","Conventional, Trust Conveyance","","53174","","Single Family Residence","","Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Neighborhood","True","","","","2002","90274","5406","RECL*"
"","0.1302","Broker/Agent does not guarantee the accuracy of square footage, lot size, zoning, permits, schools, or other property details. Buyer is advised to independently verify all information through inspection and professionals. The home was previously in escrow but fell out due to a foundation issue, which has since been repaired (see supplement). Property is not in a landslide zone per RPV city website map. The photos were taken before the owners moved out; there is no furniture at the moment.","","","174 - Crest","Unknown","True","7574018018","Pool, Spa/Hot Tub, Tennis Court(s)","600","","False","3","","","","3","3","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Pager Ph","Agent Fax","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","27","1501000","#ERR","04/15/2025 12:12:38 PM","","04/24/2025 9:44:22 AM","06/18/2025 12:00:00 AM","06/18/2025 4:20:03 PM","","","10/10/2024 12:00:00 AM","05/14/2025 12:00:00 AM","06/18/2025 4:15:56 PM","06/18/2025 12:00:00 AM","06/18/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","27","","False","","","","","","","Cash to Loan","Living Room","True","","True","Central","True","High Ceilings, Living Room Balcony","True","True","","Supra","False","","","","33.763283","Gas Dryer Hookup, Washer Hookup","True","False","","","1599000","","","1650000","#ERR","310-720-9005","","hisglory@gmail.com","310-534-0325","Tony","310-782-3620","","Kim","","SKIMTONY","","","","","SB1350760","","Compass","310-241-3038","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.370718","","17","5670","0-1 Unit/Acre","Street Lights","","Assessor","","","SB25081841","","2","2","","1","Vacant","","","","","","","","","1","","Community","False","","501.17","Welcome to Villa Verde ? a peaceful, gated community where safety, privacy, and a true sense of neighborhood come together. This inviting home is in one of the best spots in the community, just a short walk from the tennis courts, the pool, and nearby hiking trails that the whole family can enjoy. The neighborhood is quiet and secure, making it a great place to settle in and feel at home. Larger than most in the area, the house offers a little extra room to stretch out?perfect for family life or hosting loved ones. Natural light fills the space through skylights, giving it a warm and welcoming feel from the moment you step inside. There's a separate family room and living room, plus a spacious kitchen that?s just right for cooking together or gathering around for meals and conversation. The master bedroom is conveniently located on the main floor and comes with double sinks, a separate tub and shower, and even a steam sauna for a little relaxation at the end of the day. Downstairs, there are two more bedrooms that share a Jack and Jill bathroom, along with a cozy wine cellar for the grown-ups. Each level also has bonus spaces that work great as a home office, study area, or reading nook. Wraparound balconies and a private patio offer the perfect place to enjoy fresh air, quiet evenings, and even a view of the city lights. This is more than just a house?it?s a place to create memories. Come imagine how you can make it your own!","","Family Room, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Living Room, Multi-Level Bedroom, Office, Sauna, See Remarks, Walk-In Closet, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Scott","Berglund","VBERGSCO","V7078","","","Peninsula Properties","1501000","False","Full Service","First showings will be during the open house. Call listing agent Tony Kim 310.720.9005 for inquiry","True","","","","2995","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Mela","","10","Lane","","","Cash to New Loan","","32614","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights","True","","","","1979","90275","5080","RPRS10000*"
