"True","3","","Association, Community, In Ground","False","Close Of Escrow","533.85","Nestled within the private, gated Villa Verde community of Rancho Palos Verdes, this rare offering presents a truly special opportunity to reimagine a home that was last sold when it was BUILT in 1980. Set in a serene and secure enclave, Villa Verde is known for its tranquil surroundings and resort-style amenities, including a tennis court, sparkling pool, and easy access to nearby hiking trails. The residence itself offers generous scale and endless potential, featuring multiple living spaces, soaring ceilings, and en suite bedrooms that provide a flexible foundation for creating your ideal dream home. From the living room, enjoy ocean views stretching to Catalina Island, adding a picturesque backdrop and a sense of coastal calm. With its prime location, peaceful setting, and exceptional upside, this is a rare chance to customize a home within one of Rancho Palos Verdes? most desirable gated communities.","","Den, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Susan","Jung","sbjungsus","SB1312000","","","Realty ONE Group United","1514000","False","Full Service","Text Matt at (903) 815-3088 to schedule a showing.","False","Association, Community","True","","2836","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Mela","","9","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","32614","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Ocean, Peek-A-Boo","True","","","","1979","90275","",""
