ces, and an expanded primary suite with private balcony provide a foundation for luxury coastal living. The first-floor bonus room can easily become a secondary living area, home office, gym, or potential 4th bedroom. Outside, the backyard invites entertaining with pool, waterslide, diving board, and built-in BBQ all framed by the coast. A newly rebuilt block wall, fully permitted, inspected, and signed off by the city, adds long-term peace of mind. This home embodies vision, structure, and long-term value, offering buyers an opportunity to build their legacy with stability and grounded growth. The space is ready for a fresh perspective so schedule a showing and plan your holidays in your new home.","","All Bedrooms Up, Entry, Kitchen, Living Room, Recreation, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Soleado","","Ridgecrest","","Jim","Ghannadi","VGHANJIM","V7946","","","Estate Properties","1600000","False","Full Service","Select a time on Showing Time to schedule a private showing.  Very easy to show.  Get confirmation and go direct.","True","None","False","True","2506","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Sunmist","","5726","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","27789","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Ocean","True","https://youtu.be/URtsmvArHDY","","Blinds, Drapes, Screens, Skylight(s)","1964","90275","4939","RPRS10000*"
