way in a gated community, this thoughtfully updated single-family home offers a perfect mix of security, comfort, and versatility. The neighborhood provides access to wonderful community amenities, including a heated swimming pool and tennis courts, while still offering the privacy and cozy charm of single-family living. Step inside to a bright, sun-filled interior where soaring vaulted ceilings create an open and airy atmosphere. Recently updated with fresh paint, new lighting and flooring. The main level includes a formal sunken living room, a spacious second bedroom with an attached bathroom, and a former library now converted into a third bedroom complete with a walk-in closet. The lower level features a generous laundry room with a walk-in closet, providing flexibility to expand your living space and abundant storage. Throughout the home, strategically placed skylights flood every corner with natural light, creating a warm and welcoming vibe. The upper-level primary suite is your private retreat, featuring an elevated bed area, a cozy sitting nook with a fireplace, a large walk-in closet, an additional smaller closet, and an ensuite bathroom for ultimate comfort and convenience. Originally designed as a two-bedroom layout, this home comes with excellent potential to be reconfigured into a four-bedroom home using existing framing?offering the benefits of a larger space at an outstanding value. This home is a wonderful blend of safety, style, and flexible living in an unbeatable location!","","Primary Bedroom, Sun","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Soleado","","Ridgecrest","","Ian","Ferguson","CLW-C121665","CLW-X82304","","","Greenspan Realty","1655000","False","Full Service","Vacant - Go Direct. For showing appointments please call Penny Wales at (310) 809-8073. Thank you!","True","None","False","","2836","Public Records","","CA","Closed","Three Or More ","","","Mela Ln","","28","","","","Cash to New Loan","","32614","","Single Family Residence","","","Hills,