ndows invite ample natural light, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. The kitchen has granite counters, plenty of cabinet space, a double oven, and a window to look over the garden. Adjacent to the kitchen, a spacious formal dining area accommodates gatherings of all sizes, while a smaller breakfast nook offers a cozy spot for casual meals. Unwind in the intimate family room anchored by a brick fireplace, a perfect space for relaxation with sliding doors leading to the newly landscaped backyard. A covered patio awaits, perfect for outdoor grilling, while a large grassy area offers plenty of space for recreational activities. On the lower level, a versatile bedroom can be transformed into a home office, with easy access to an updated bathroom with an oversized shower. Discover the spacious primary bedroom upstairs, offering ample closet space and a dedicated bathroom with dual sinks. Three additional bedrooms on the upper-level feature oversized windows that flood the rooms with natural light and allow a refreshing breeze to flow through. These bedrooms share a bathroom with a shower/tub combo and neutral white tile. This lovely home is conveniently located near the Peninsula Center and offers easy access to dining, shopping, and other services. It is centrally situated within the renowned Palos Verdes school district, ensuring a top-notch education for your family. Nearby elementary, middle, and high schools make daily commutes a breeze. At the end of each day, retreat to your backyard and enjoy the tranquility it offers.","","Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Brittney","Austin","SBUNNBRI","S5267","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","1775000","False","Full Service","Text agent Cari Corbalis for showing instructions 310-704-4014","","None","False","","2265","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Seamount Drive","","28312","","","Contemporary","Conventional","","28450","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Conne