"","0.2519","PLEASE READ ALL THE FOLLOWING NOTES: 1) Sellers are fully aware that this home is a fixer and have priced it under-market accordingly. Sold as-is, where-is ? with NO CREDITS OR REPAIRS CONSIDERED. 2) Bring your best offers. 3) FIRST and ONLY SHOWINGS will be Open Houses on Sat and Sun, March 29 & 30, 2-4pm (NO EXCEPTIONS & PLEASE DO NOT DISTURB OCCUPANTS), please make plans in advance with your buyers to attend (and, if desired, your trusted contractor). 4) OFFERS, IF ANY, WILL BE DUE TUESDAY, APRIL 1 (no ?fool?-ing!) at 5pm and counter(s) issued next day (with seller reserving express right to accept any exceptional offer, at any time). 5) Please see and familiarize yourself AND your buyers with Inspection Reports and Disclosures (NOW IN SUPPLEMENTS) BEFORE writing your offer. 6) Please also note that sellers will be asking for an up to 59-day leaseback after sale (form RLAS). 7) Please submit all offers in SINGLE PDF with current, clear proof of funds, and current Preapproval if financed (DU always preferred), and email to both TeamSteveSells@gmail.com (with a followup text to 818-749-5910 when sent to confirm receipt) AND to offers@jhhre.com. Standard Sale! Sold as is no warranties/guarantees made. Seller and/or seller?s agent makes no representation as to room size, lot size, etc. Buyer to verify with appropriate entities and satisfy self. Please email offers to offers@jhhre.com or fax to 8889656161. Please visit www.Johnhartrealestate.com/Seabryn. Thank you!","Built-In Range, Dishwasher, Double Oven, Electric Oven, Electric Cooktop, Disposal, Refrigerator","True","174 - Crest","Unknown","True","7585016007","","0","","False","3","","","","3","4","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","","","","","","Whole House Fan","True","Los Angeles","13","1835000","#ERR","03/21/2025 11:20:47 AM","","","04/09/2025 12:00:00 AM","05/09/2025 5:00:21 PM","","","11/20/2024 12:00:00 AM"