iving space, magically sited on a 10,971sf corner lot, ample room, inside and out, both for grand entertaining and for quiet family times. Rounding out the first level are a kitchen/family room with spectacular sea views, a downstairs en-suite bedroom plus expansive bonus room attached. Upstairs you?ll find 2 bedrooms with shared bath and a large, primary en-suite retreat. Other features include a vast backyard with potential for spacious, sunlit deck and a 3-car attached garage accessed via a pull-through driveway!  Located in one of the most sought-after areas in the Palos Verdes Peninsula, Seabryn is minutes away from dining and shopping (the Peninsula Center and Promenade P|V), top-rated schools, parks, hiking, golf and everything that makes life worth living! With a fixit mindset and some TLC, you can restore this architectural wonder to its magnificent oceanview beauty, enjoying the tranquility, elegance, and oceanfront lifestyle with family, friends and fabulous festivities for many years to come!","Concrete","Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Pantry","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Steven","Gutierrez-Kovner","g165111270","G7561","","","JohnHart Real Estate","1835000","False","Full Service","FIRST and ONLY SHOWINGS will be Open Houses on Saturday and Sunday, March 29 & 30, 2-4pm","","","","True","2466","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Seabryn","","6402","Drive","","Mid Century Modern","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","28457","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://www.zillow.com/view-imx/a0a76502-96d6-4bf7-96e8-b326cd00cb5c?initialViewType=pano&hidePhotos=true&setAttribution=mls&wl=true&utm_source=email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=emo-floorplancompleted","","","1968","90275","4756","RPRS10000*"
