uite Bathroom with separate Bath Tub and Shower. Step outside and enjoy coffee or wine on the private Balcony with breathtaking views. The fourth and fifth Bedrooms on the second floor each have their own special vistas with a peek-a-boo Ocean View. The generous sized Garage is perfect for children's play room or a home gym. Enjoy Staycations at this lovely home located on a quiet street and beautifully appointed neighborhood. This all located near some of the most gorgeous beaches and nature that Southern California has to offer!","","Family Room, Primary Bathroom","","","","","","CLW-10011010","Sandy","Malbrue","SMALBEMM","S4331","2.500","%","Century 21 Union Realty","1900000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Please email welcome@playarealtyca.com for all showing requests. 24 hour notice please. First Showing will be Tuesday May 28th. Thank you! Showing Information: 24-hr Notice,Call LA 1,Appointment w/List. Office ","","None","False","","2468","","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Stonecrest","","29504","Road","","Traditional","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","https://youtu.be/-L_UrYQSCLY","","","1964","90275","5712","RPRS10000*"
