bathroom, promises ultimate relaxation. Three additional bedrooms, including one conveniently located downstairs, offer flexibility for families of all sizes. Gather loved ones in the inviting living room, centered around the warmth of the fireplace, and create lasting memories. And in the modern kitchen, with its ample counter space and top-of-the-line appliances, your inner chef will be inspired to craft culinary delights. Step outside and be wowed by your own private California oasis: Picture hosting epic gatherings on the enormous flat patio and sprawling lawn, basking under the California sun. Imagine discovering the hidden tiki-themed lounge, a touch of whimsy and fun where you can unwind and soak up the warmth by the firepit. With ample room for everyone, both children and pets can play freely while you enjoy the outdoors. Beyond your doorstep, convenience awaits: Top-rated schools, a quiet neighborhood, and parks and shopping centers within easy reach. Family-friendly amenities at your fingertips, where you can easily explore nearby Del Cerro and Highridge Parks. Enjoy effortless living with everything you need and desire close by. This isn't just a home, it's a lifestyle. Schedule your showing today and experience California living at its finest!","","Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","VCURTJEF","Lauren","Yoon","VLEELAU","V8040","2.5","%","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","1910000","False","Full Service","The first showing will begin at the open house on Saturday, February 24th. Lockbox will be installed after the open house on Sunday.  Kindly ensure a minimum of three hours' advance notice for appointments. Thank you.","True","","","","2244","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Stonecrest","","29316","Road","","","Conventional","","27789","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","None","False","","","","1968","90275","5