m room to room, making it ideal for everyday living and entertaining.  Featuring a lovely updated kitchen with Kitchen-Aid stainless steel appliances and granite countertops, the amount of storage and convenient pullouts make it a dream!  The main floor bedroom is thoughtfully located near a bath, making it an ideal space for guests, older parents, or a caregiver.  All the bathrooms have been updated, ensuring comfort and style in every corner.  Several rooms on the upper level enjoy a peek-a-boo view of the ocean, adding just a bit of coastal charm to your daily life. Who wouldn't love that? Come enjoy a community known for it's award winning schools, popular hiking trails and stunning vista points, and wonderful carefree lifestyle boasting of outdoor concerts, street fairs, and movie nights in the park! This property and its location truly provide loads of features for comfortable and stylish living.   Don't miss the chance to make it yours!","","Main Floor Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","David","Schwartz","vschwdav","V8040","","","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","1935000","False","Full Service","Okay to go between 10am and 5pm on during weekdays. Need to schedule with agent on weekends, agent needs to coordinate showings with occupant (son).  Do not use ShowingTime please.","","","","","2135","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Seamount","","28414","Drive","","","Conventional","","28450","","Single Family Residence","","","Peek-A-Boo","True","","","","1971","90275","4750","RPRS10000*"
