ion. The separate dining room provides a comfortable setting for gatherings, while the kitchen opens to the family room, allowing for an easy flow that works well for both everyday living and entertaining. A bedroom and full bathroom on the main level offer flexibility for guests, extended family, or a home office. Upstairs, three additional bedrooms provide privacy and generous space, with ocean views enjoyed from the second level. Out back, the spacious yard is ready to be enjoyed. A fire pit area sets the stage for relaxed evenings, the paved patio is ideal for outdoor seating and dining, and a separate grassy section offers room to play, garden, or unwind. The attached 3-car garage adds valuable storage and convenience, ideal for vehicles, hobbies, or additional workspace. Located just moments from Hesse Park, this home is part of a highly regarded school district and set within an enjoyable, well-established coastal neighborhood known for its scenic surroundings and community feel. Thoughtfully positioned at a value that reflects room for updates, it offers the perfect canvas for a new owner to bring their vision to life and create the home they?ve been dreaming of.","","Family Room, Living Room, Multi-Level Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Matthew","Cox","PVCOXMAT","PV8612","","","Cove & Key Real Estate","1960000","False","Full Service","First showings at Open House (2/28 & 3/1). Call or text listing agent at 310.720.9005 for showings after.","","","","","2634","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Doverridge","","29010","Drive","","","Cash to New Loan","","28457","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","","","","1968","90275","",""
