tside to discover a generously sized backyard that offers breathtaking ocean and Catalina Island views?perfect for alfresco dining or hosting summer barbecues. The convenience of an attached two-car garage with direct access and washer and dryer hookups only enhances this remarkable property. Located just a short distance from top-rated PV schools, scenic hiking trails, delightful shopping, dining, and beautiful parks, this home truly has it all. Don?t miss the opportunity to make this exquisite property your own. **This is a MUST-SEE!**","Composition, Shingle","All Bedrooms Up, Family Room, Great Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes / LAUSD ? inquire","Soleado","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Ridgecrest","","Holly","Kauffman","SBKAUFHOL","S6107","","","Beach City Brokers","1980000","False","Full Service","Use Showtime System to Schedule an appointment. Or TEXT 310-567-3553, your name, broker's name, BRE number and desire time to show. ****For questions, please email us at Lisa.Ramsey@southbayspecialists.com or send a text message to (310) 567-3553****Please make sure front and patio doors are locked, all lights are off","False","None","False","True","2448","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Sunmist","","5722","Drive","","Traditional","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, Fannie Mae, FHA","","27789","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Coastline, Neighborhood, Ocean","True","https://wymangentry.hd.pics/5722-Sunmist-Dr/idx","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=Y3dVzCZVU7w","Screens, Shutters","1964","90275","4939","RPRS10000*"
