"","0.1929","*** Offers due Tuesday July 22nd at 6pm *** Seller on RPA to be Valiza Family Trust. Seller believes gas fireplaces to be in working order but will not provide credit/repairs. Buyers might be asked to cross qualify with preferred lender. Offers to be submitted with RPA, Proof of Funds and lender Pre-Approval if obtaining a loan. Tax records show 2,449 sq ft but seller believes it to be 2,585 after remodel. Broker/Agent does not guarantee accuracy of square footage, lot size, ordinances, zoning, rent control, permits, use code, schools and/or other information concerning the conditions or features of the property provided by the seller or obtained from public records or other sources. Buyer is advised to independently investigate all aspects of the property, verify the accuracy of all information provided through personal inspection & with appropriate professionals to Buyers satisfaction.","Built-In Range, Dishwasher, Double Oven, Disposal, Range Hood","True","174 - Crest","Unknown","True","7585002146","","0","","False","3","","","","3","5","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","","","","None","False","Los Angeles","7","2040000","#ERR","07/16/2025 12:07:50 PM","","","07/24/2025 12:00:00 AM","08/14/2025 10:50:50 AM","","","06/03/2025 12:00:00 AM","07/24/2025 12:00:00 AM","07/17/2025 8:27:52 AM","08/14/2025 12:00:00 AM","08/14/2025 12:00:00 AM","","West","7","Double Door Entry","False","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Breakfast Nook, Dining Room","","Stucco","","","","Cash to New Loan","Family Room, Living Room","True","Carpet, Tile, Wood","True","Forced Air","True","Ceiling Fan(s), In-Law Floorplan","True","True","Front Door","Supra","False","","","","33.774747","Dryer Included, In Garage, Washer Included","True","False","","","2000000","","","2000000","#ERR","","","pam@pamelapunzalan.com","","Pamela","","","Punzalan","","SBPUNZPAM","","","","","SB1350760","","C