sized 2 car garage conveniently opens into the kitchen. Living room offers large windows allowing for plenty of natural light and view of foliage and yard. A few steps down leads to a spacious yet cozy family room with abundant built-in shelves and storage plus sliding glass doors leading out to the lower level deck, yard/pool area. One bedroom, bathroom and laundry are also located on this lower level. A few steps up from the main level, it boasts 3 bedrooms and 2 baths, which includes the master suite and bath. Fantastic two-tiered backyard encompasses 2 spacious decks for children?s play, relaxation and family entertaining and a large flat grassy yard which leads down to the lower yard showcasing a newer resort-style sparkling salt water heated pool and jacuzzi surrounded by lush, mature trees providing a secluded backyard. All of this in a wonderful, peaceful and private environment that is conveniently located only a short distance to schools, parks, shopping, and restaurants.","","Family Room, Great Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Zheng (Helen)","Qi","SBHONGZHE","SB1301220","2.5","%","West Shores Realty, Inc.","2230000","False","Full Service","Please call or text Sunny with the day/time of showing. Wait for response and go.","","","","","2424","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Sunmist","","5672","Drive","","","1031 Exchange","","27789","","Single Family Residence","","","Pasture, Pool","True","https://www.zillow.com/view-3d-home/c5884684-659b-478a-8b72-d8191f635e4c?setAttribution=mls&wl=true&utm_source=dashboard","https://vimeo.com/930095572?share=copy","","1965","90275","4938","RPRS10000*"
