6630","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway","True","Patio, Stone","True","74","","Private, Fiberglass, Gas Heat, In Ground","True","Close Plus","1066.86","This quintessential coastal farmhouse in the heart of Palos Verdes boasts a unique blend of contemporary design and classic charm. You can literally watch the sun set over the Pacific Ocean out of one window and see a horse amble by on the adjacent trails out another.  This prime location just minutes from award-winning schools, shopping, restaurants, parks, hiking trails and the beach offers the perfect combination of luxurious living and seaside relaxation. The exterior of the home features crisp white siding, complemented by contrasting black shutters and white-washed brick. A welcoming front yard and expansive backyard with a pool and hot tub provide ample space for outdoor entertaining, while numerous fruit trees (lemon, lime, tangerine, navel orange, plum, avocado) and lush landscaping add to the natural beauty of the nearly quarter acre flat property. Inside, the home features an open floor plan that blends the living, dining, and kitchen areas. The living room boasts large windows that let in natural light, while a cozy fireplace adds warmth and ambiance on chilly evenings. The kitchen features stainless steel appliances, subway tile, honed black granite countertops, a large peninsula with ample seating for casual dining and a passthrough window out to the backyard with bar seating. There are 2 adjacent dining areas which provide plenty of space for hosting dinner parties, with French doors leading out to the backyard patio for alfresco dining under the stars. The lovely primary suite is a peaceful retreat, with large windows overlooking the backyard and views of the ocean, Santa Barbara Island and gorgeous winter sunsets.  It includes a walk-in closet and ensuite bathroom with dual marble vanities.  The additional 3 bedrooms offer plenty of space for family and guests and share a large bathroom with a tub and shower. The home has a new furnace and air conditioning installed in 2020, as well as brand new solar panels with the potential to eliminate energy costs. This perfect family home is truly a one-of-a-kind property, offering comfortable living in a serene coastal setting.","Composition","All Bedrooms Up, Attic, Living Room, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Edward","Shin","nonmember","NONMEMBERMRML","2.5","%","Grand Avenue Realty & Lending","2250000","False","Full Service","Please try to attend one of the scheduled open houses. The property is occupied by a busy family with dogs.  If you need to schedule an appointment, please call or text Jacqui Withers at 310-989-0871.","True","Private, Fiberglass, Heated, In Ground","True","True","2109","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Indian Valley","","29304","Road","","Traditional","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Lease Back","","27677","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean, Peek-A-Boo","True","http://sites.southbaypics.com/29304indianvalleyrd/?mls","https://vimeo.com/838959612?share=copy","Double Pane Windows, Screens","1965","90275","4813","LCR307"
