ter. It seamlessly flows into the spacious family room, which offers direct access to the inviting poolside area?a perfect space for relaxation and entertainment. Also, take a note of a two-way fireplace separates the enchanting living room from the cozy library. The home is designed with versatility in mind, offering one bedroom downstairs for convenience and four more on the second floor. The dramatic staircase leads you to the expansive master suite, a true retreat, filled with natural light while ensuring privacy. It features a luxurious master bathroom, a separate shower, double vanity, and his-and-her closets. Three additional spacious bedrooms are located on the upper level. The versatile fifth bedroom can easily function as a family room, office, guest quarters. Cozy up by one of the three beautiful fireplaces that add warmth and charm throughout the home. Outside, the gorgeous private backyard is an entertainer?s dream, complete with a sparkling pool and plenty of comfortable seating areas, ideal for family gatherings and quiet enjoyment. Additional highlights include direct access from the three-car garage, a separate laundry room, ample storage spaces, and so much more. This exceptional property is just minutes away from award-winning Palos Verdes schools, fine dining, and recreational amenities.","","Entry, Family Room, Game Room, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Rahul","Bhagat","SBHAGRAH","SB1338520","","","eXp Realty of California Inc","2380000","False","Full Service","Please text agent with 3 hours advance notice. First showing at the open house on Sunday 09/8.","True","","","","4459","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Indian Valley","","29004","Road","","","Trust Conveyance","","37205","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Water Connected","Peek-A-Boo","True","","","","1985","90275","4807","