of luxury living, full of opulent features and meticulous attention to detail. Inside, this sophisticated home features new Birch Bronze engineered hardwood flooring throughout, recessed lighting, custom wood details and crown molding. The kitchen features a Viking six-burner stove, double oven, warming drawer, granite countertops and a prep sink nestled into an oversized island with seating for six. Stainless steel appliances, glass tile backsplash and walk-in pantry ensure your culinary endeavors are well-equipped. Shiplap detailing adds a touch of charm. The living room and entryway are adorned with custom woodwork, including a hidden closet behind a Murphy door, a custom wood fireplace mantle and poured concrete fireplace and hearth. Vaulted ceilings amplify the sense of space and luxury. The primary bedroom is a haven of sophistication. Vaulted ceiling adorned with custom wood beams and uplights set a tone of grandeur. The oversized walk-in closet has built-in organization, with custom cabinetry and a hidden safe. The ensuite bathroom is a true spa-like retreat, featuring concrete countertops, dual vanity with sinks, heated towel rack and custom lighted framed mirrors. The dual shower with his and hers showerheads and the wet room, with its sumptuous soaking tub surrounded by custom tile, provide the ultimate in relaxation and luxury. A second upstairs bedroom showcases a custom-built bed with clever under-bed hidden storage and an ensuite bathroom adorned with custom tile and rain shower. In the backyard, you'll find yourself in an entertainer's paradise. The outdoor kitchen provides an ideal entertaining setting, enhanced by a stainless-steel built-in BBQ complete with burners and a hibachi top. Built-in ice holders for drinks and an outdoor sink adds convenience. The pool, equipped with solar heating, promises year-round enjoyment. The 3-car garage includes a custom workroom and a 220v plug for electric car charging. The exterior has received a fresh makeover, boasting new paint, wood, and metal siding. The lower level offers a haven of entertainment and productivity. A game room features new tile flooring, while the office/bedroom offers a sleeping and reading nook with storage and custom-made desks for standing or sitting. This remodeled Rancho Palos Verdes gem offers an extraordinary opportunity to embrace luxury living in a highly sought-after neighborhood.","Tile","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","David","King","sbkingdav","SB1379380","2.5","%","Compass","2660000","False","Full Service","Easy to show. Call or text 323-873-7685 with 2 hours notice.","","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","True","3359","Public Records","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Oceanridge","","29226","","","","Cash to New Loan","","28584","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=4hpm2CW1bT9","","","1968","90275","",""
