ks","True","5","","None","False","","850.05","VIEW. VIEW. VIEW. With unobstructed panoramic ocean views stretching from Malibu to Catalina, this 5-bedroom, 3-bathroom home offers more than just space; it offers a sense of place. Set on an expansive 13,187 sq ft lot, the home has been thoughtfully updated with new flooring, fresh paint, and beautifully landscaped grounds. From the moment you step inside, natural light pours in, and the home reveals a layout that is both bright and intuitively designed, ideal for everyday comfort and seamless entertaining. The first floor features both a living room and a separate family room, each with its own fireplace, plus formal dining and two bedrooms, including one with an adjacent full bath, ideal for multigenerational living. Upstairs, the primary suite offers a tranquil retreat with multiple closets and a spa-inspired bath with soaking tub and separate shower, along with ocean views from the bedroom. Two additional upstairs bedrooms also enjoy sweeping coastal vistas, filling the space with natural light and a strong connection to the outdoors. The outdoor spaces are what elevate this home into something extraordinary. Whether you're enjoying a morning coffee or hosting a summer evening gathering, the breathtaking view commands your attention: ever-changing, endlessly captivating. Additional amenities include central air and heat, a spacious laundry room with a convenient laundry chute, and a dedicated workshop area. Located in the prestigious Palos Verdes School District and close to parks, shopping, and dining, this home blends comfort, utility, and an inspiring coastal backdrop. This is the view people move for.","Spanish Tile","Entry, Family Room, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","Ridgecrest","","Pamela","Punzalan","SBPUNZPAM","sb1350760","","","Compass","2755000","False","Full Service","SHOWINGS STA