autifully crafted 5-bedroom, 5.5-bathroom Spanish modern masterpiece situated in the peaceful enclave of Rancho Palos Verdes. Extensive renovation recently completed in 2023, this home is a harmonious fusion of classic elegance and contemporary design. You're invited into the house through a gorgeous custom wooden door spanning a total of 10 feet tall with elegant steel and glass framing.  Upon entering you are greeted with an expansive open floor plan; the foyer area seamlessly flows into the living area and gourmet kitchen to the right and to the left the formal living area which has a gas fireplace and an exquisite wet-bar, with sliding doors that effortlessly blend the indoor and outdoor spaces. You'll find yourself drawn to the backyard oasis - an entertainer's dream - where there is a large pool and ample patio space, which creates an inviting atmosphere for dining al fresco or lounging in style. Also on this level is a convenient in-law suite that offers both privacy and comfort with seperate entrance and access to the pool area. The next level has 3 bedroom spaces - one with an en-suite full bathroom, 2 full bathrooms and a unique lounge/landing space that could be used as a multimedia space or a children's area, with a spacious balcony, overlooking the pool and backyard area. The primary suite is a sanctuary of indulgence, with high ceilings, fireplace and a reading nook that gives gorgeous views of the ocean, and of the picturesque Catalina Island. The zen primary bathroom exudes luxury, with a wet room offering his and her shower sides and an idyllic bath tub with Ocean and Catalina views. The primary suite's retreat area and private balcony provide moments of tranquility. In addition, the property has dual driveways with a 2-car garage and RV/boat parking, which elevate this property to one of functional luxury.","","Primary Bathroom, Formal Entry, Family Room, Retreat, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","","","","","CLW-2305617","Natalie"