 Soleado Elementary, Peninsula Hi, and the Peninsula Center.  There is a feeling of spaciousness when you enter the home, with high open beam ceilings and a manly wood-burning fireplace.  The lot is huge and a deck at the top rear would have a sweeping view of the city, mountains, harbor, etc.  Peek-a-boo view from the master suite.  This home features central air, a newer furnace, and laundry adjacent to the bedrooms.  All bedrooms have walk-in closets, with the rear (guest) bedroom including an outside door.  The master bath has been tastefully remodeled.  The garage has lots of storage.  Don't let this one get away!","","All Bedrooms Up, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Soleado","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Ridgecrest","","Rae","Xiao","pf23720m","pf11422m","2.5","%","Flyhomes","1620000","False","Full Service","No show till broker's open house Tuesday, 12/12 11-1:30.  Showing  9-5, just go.  Outside those hours or any questions, please call me at 310 613-1076.","True","None","False","True","1868","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Elmbridge","","27537","Drive","","Traditional","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","27980","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Mountain(s), Peek-A-Boo","True","","","Bay Window(s), Blinds, Drapes, French/Mullioned, Skylight(s)","1965","90275","",""
"","0.1614","To see property disclosures follow this link: https://app.disclosures.io/link/27508-Fawnskin-Drive-9a547180","Refrigerator","True","175 - Peninsula Center","None","False","7586008012","","0","","False","2","","","1","1","4","7097","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","3109389167","","brittaustin04@gmail.com","3103781997","Brittney","","","Austin","SBUNNBRI","","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","","","","","","","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Co-Agent Email","Agent Cell Ph","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","6","1625000","#ERR","05/30/2025 12:54:32 PM","","","06/05/2025 12:00:00 AM","07/10/2025 8:09:18 AM","","","05/17/2025 12:00:00 AM","06/05/2025 12:00:00 AM","05/30/2025 12:54:32 PM","07/09/2025 12:00:00 AM","07/09/2025 12:00:00 AM","","South","6","","False","Dining Room, In Kitchen","","","Wood","True","","Conventional","Living Room","True","Wood","True","Forced Air","True","Open Floorplan","True","True","none","None","False","","","","33.775713","See Remarks","True","False","","","1698000","","","1698000","#ERR","310-704-4014","","caricorbalis@gmail.com","","Cari","","","Corbalis","","SCLAYCAR","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.370416","","50","7030","Back Yard, Sprinkler System","Biking , Golf, Hiking ","","Assessor","","","SB25113174","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","","Garage - Two Door","True","Concrete","True","22","","None","False","Close Plus 2 Days","973.05","Welcome to this beautifully updated and maintained single-level residence nestled on a peaceful, tree-lined street in the desirable Peninsula Center neighborhood of Rancho Palos Verdes. With four spacious bedrooms and an ideal indoor-outdoor flow, this home blends comfort, functionality and California charm in one seamless package. From the moment you step inside, you're greeted by an open floor plan designed for effortless entertaining. The living room features gleaming wood floors, a handsome stone fireplace, and expansive picture windows that frame tranquil views of the large, flat backyard. Adjacent to the living space is a formal dining area with French doors that lead to a welcoming patio?perfect for alfresco meals or casual lounging under the stars. The backyard is a rare find?flat, fully usable, and thoughtfully landscaped with a meandering path that leads to a raised deck offering partial city light views. Whether you're gathering for dinner outdoors or enjoying quiet mornings with coffee, there's room here for both relaxation and entertaining. The heart of the home is the open kitchen, complete with a granite-topped prep island, stainless steel appliances, custom cabinetry and elegant granite countertops. Nearby, the oversized primary suite offers a serene retreat with recessed lighting, custom shutters, ample closet space and an updated ensuite bathroom featuring a quartz dual-sink vanity, quartz flooring and a generous walk-in shower. Three additional bedrooms also feature custom shutters, wood floors and easy access to a second upgraded bathroom with a tub/shower combination and quartz-topped vanity. Additional features include central air conditioning, a tankless water heater, EV charger, 7.38kw paid off solar system and direct garage access. All of this in close proximity to the shopping, dining and conveniences of the Peninsula Center, and within the highly rated Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District. Don?t miss this rare one-level gem in one of the South Bay?s most sought-after neighborhoods.","Composition","All Bedrooms Down, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Norman","Lucas","VLUCANOR","V7946","","","Estate Properties","1625000","False","Full Service","Text agent Cari Corbalis for showings:  310-704-4014","True","None","False","True","1670","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Fawnskin Drive","","27508","","","Contemporar