"","0.1622","Owner passed away in the home from natural causes.","","","175 - Peninsula Center","None","False","7586025031","","0","","False","3","1","","1","1","4","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","suzannetdyer@gmail.com","","Suzanne","","","Dyer","VDYERSUZ","","","","","","V8407","310-541-6560","Strand Hill Properties","310-541-6566","","Ellen","Chuan","SCHUAELL","S6486","Home Team Realty","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Agent Cell Ph","","","","None","False","Los Angeles","24","1650000","#ERR","07/15/2024 4:15:45 PM","","","09/05/2024 12:00:00 AM","09/05/2024 3:29:33 PM","","","07/15/2024 12:00:00 AM","08/08/2024 12:00:00 AM","07/15/2024 4:15:45 PM","09/05/2024 12:00:00 AM","09/05/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","24","","False","","","","","","","Conventional","Living Room, Gas, Wood Burning","True","Carpet","True","Central","True","","True","True","Front Door","Supra","False","","","","33.771699","In Garage","True","False","","","1690000","","","1690000","#ERR","3109844608","","jakesullivanhomes@gmail.com","","Jake","310-514-8021","","Sullivan","","PVSULLJAK","","","","","V8407","310-541-6560","Strand Hill Properties","310-541-6566","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.36476","","125","7067","0-1 Unit/Acre","Sidewalks","","Assessor","","","PV24145066","","2","2","","1","Vacant","","","","","","","","","44","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","732.03","First time on the market! Welcome to this charming and spacious single-story home, nestled in a serene neighborhood of Rancho Palos Verdes. As you enter, you are greeted by a covered front porch with lush greenery that sets a welcoming tone. The living room is the heart of this home, featuring high ceilings and a stunning PV stone fireplace, surrounded by picturesque views of the beautifully landscaped yard through the large windows and sliding glass door - offering a bright and outdoor feel inside the home. The kitchen and dining area are joined together in a large room that can seat dozens of people, providing an open concept area that is perfect for entertaining! This area includes a large counter for barstool seating, a partition wall to separate the room from the living room and hallway, and large windows looking out to the side yard. If the kitchen/dining area and the living room were joined together, it would make one massive entertaining space! This home offers four generously sized bedrooms, each with ample closet space and large windows. The primary bedroom is a tranquil retreat with an ensuite bathroom and a u-shape of windows looking out to the backyard, creating a seamless indoor-outdoor living experience. The backyard is a private oasis, featuring brand new sod, mature trees, and vibrant landscaping. The large brick patio on the side yard is the perfect setting for outdoor dining, relaxation, or entertaining under the shade of the pergola. Additional features include a two-car attached garage with a dedicated laundry area, central heating, and ample storage throughout the home. The floor plan is thoughtfully designed to provide functionality and flexibility for a modern lifestyle. The home had a new roof installed 7 years ago and the house was repiped 9 years ago. This home is located within the highly desired Palos Verdes School District, and is just a few blocks from Soleado Elementary School and Peninsula High School! Situated a quiet street in the center of Palos Verdes, this property is also just a few blocks from the mall, grocery stores, restaurants, and main roads which is perfect for shoppers, families, and commuters. Come see this home in person and you will be amazed by its floor-plan and potential! Don't miss the opportunity to make this delightful property your new home! *Some photos have been virtually staged.","","Formal Entry, Kitchen, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Tony","Chuan","SCHUATON","S6486","","","Home Team Realty","1650000","False","Full Service","Text Jake then Go Direct.","True","","","","2254","Assessor",""