less brick fireplace, offers a cozy retreat. Large picture windows that frame the verdant surroundings enhance the natural light-filled ambiance. Vaulted ceilings and recessed lighting further accentuate the freshly painted interior. Step outside to a charming outdoor haven featuring a covered patio perfect for al fresco cooking and dining, surrounded by impeccably manicured yard space. The primary suite offers a peaceful haven with plenty of closet space and an en-suite bathroom featuring a spacious shower. Three additional bedrooms await, with two sharing a well-appointed bathroom boasting dual sinks and a tub/shower combination. The 4th bedroom is perfectly positioned as a home office or study, with easy kitchen and dining area access. New AC and heating as well as an attached 2 car garage are added convenience features. This residence is situated in an ideal location and grants access to renowned Palos Verdes schools, scenic trails, and captivating sunset vistas. With Peninsula Center's array of shops and restaurants nearby, convenience is at your fingertips.","","All Bedrooms Down, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Cari","Corbalis","sclaycar","S5267","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","1715925","False","Full Service","Text agent Cari Corbalis for showing instructions 310-704-4014","True","None","False","","1787","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Longhill","","27527","Drive","","Contemporary","Contract","","24443","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected","None","False","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=LvgPvBCa9hn","","","1959","90275","3712","RPRS8000*"
