s.  Step inside to soaring cathedral ceilings in the living room, creating a bright and airy atmosphere. Just a few steps up, you?ll find the main living area featuring an inviting kitchen with an eat-in area, a formal dining room, and a convenient laundry room. The home boasts engineered hardwood tile flooring, elegant Italian porcelain, and dual-pane windows with shutters for added style and efficiency.  The backyard is your private retreat?spacious and serene, featuring a sparkling salt-water pool, a pergola, and plenty of room for entertaining or relaxing under the stars.  Additional highlights include:  Two-car garage with a large storage area.  Newer upgrades ? roof, exterior paint, vinyl fencing, water heater, and garage door.  Conveniently located in the Award-winning Palos Verdes School District, and situated minutes from Peninsula Center, Promenade Mall, restaurants, grocery stores, Starbucks, Target, and more!  This home is a rare gem in an unbeatable location?don?t miss the opportunity to make it yours!","Clay, Tile","All Bedrooms Up, Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","SPENNDEB","Edward","Kaminsky","skamiedw","SB1327500","","","eXp Realty of California, Inc","1760000","False","Full Service","Showings are only at Open House times. Open Sunday, Feb 23rd: 12-5.   Tuesday, February 25th: 11-2. Friday, February 28th:  3-6. Saturday, March 1, 12-3.","False","","","True","1868","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two, Multi/Split ","","","Larchbluff","","27403","Drive","","Traditional","Cash to New Loan","","27980","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Sewer Connected","City Lights","True","https://ingenious-media-lab.aryeo.com/videos/019523d7-650e-72d9-ba29-6205561b3f5d","","Bay Window(s), Shutters, Skylight(s)","1965","90275","3931","RPRS10000*"
