ing door opens to the paved patio with planters .   The kitchen offers a nice center cooking island with a new range, overhead exhaust vent,  lots of overhead lighting , room for a breakfast area and bar stools and a extended window for natural light.  It is large enough to host big family events.  Located close to shopping and schools with the Peninsula Center at the top of the street.    All 5 bedrooms are upstairs and are good sized with full closets.  The primary bedroom includes a private bath with shower.  The house has been freshly painted inside and out and includes;  New wall to wall berber carpet.   New Recessed (LED) lighting installed in all rooms.  New Central Heat & A/C system.  New oven/range.  New laminate flooring in kitchen and family room.   New front yard landscaping with sprinkler system.  Newer dual pane windown in all rooms.   The huge back yard has enough room for pool and includes a lower yard for additional opportunities. (Possible greenhouse, jacuzzi, kids play area, workshop or ADU).","Composition","All Bedrooms Up, Living Room, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Soleado","Peninsula","Ridgecrest","","Emmanuel","Solomon","SBSOLOEMM","S4703","","","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","1950000","False","Full Service","Supra on Front Door. All visitors must remove shoes or wear protective booties when on carpeted area. FIRST SHOWING SUNDAY 12/8/24 OPEN HOUSE  11:00-3:00 No SUPRA until after open house on Sunday.","True","None","False","True","2440","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Silver Arrow","","5062","Drive","","Modern","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, FHA","","30105","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Hills, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Panoramic","True","https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__ranchophotos.com_mls_5062-2Dsilver-2Darrow-2Ddr_&d=DwMCaQ&c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7