om with natural light. The elevated backyard is one of the standout features of this property. This lush, grassy area offers an escape with no neighbors behind, ensuring utmost privacy and tranquility. A retractable awning offers quick shade and a place to relax and entertain outdoors. The open-concept kitchen is equipped with granite countertops, stainless steel appliances and crisp white cabinetry. A casual breakfast bar provides a spot for meals on the go and morning coffee. The adjacent dining area is bright and airy, perfect for hosting dinner parties. Recessed lighting throughout the home enhances the elegant ambiance and highlights the beautiful finishes. The cozy family room is a great space for relaxation and entertainment, with sliding doors leading to a generous side yard, perfect for games, grilling, or simply enjoying the Southern California sunshine. Upstairs, the primary suite features plush carpeting, plenty of closet space, and tree-top views. The en-suite bathroom is a luxurious retreat with marble floors and shower, dual sinks on a newer designer vanity and elegant fixtures. Four additional well-appointed bedrooms offer tranquil retreats with plenty of natural light and share a roomy bathroom that features a vanity with dual sinks, and a tub-shower combination. The rare triple-car garage has a pull-down ladder for easy access to a large storage area above as well as direct access to the home. Located in a highly sought-after neighborhood, this home offers convenient access to award-winning PVPUSD schools, various parks and shopping.","","All Bedrooms Up","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Tiffany","Chin","CLW-C106570","CLW-X74850","2.5","%","Keller Williams Larchmont","2015000","False","Full Service","Call or text Britt Austin","","","","","2494","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Beechgate","","28006","Drive","","","Submit","","27337","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood","True","https://www.zillow.com/view-imx/465