"","0.1777","Offer deadline: Wednesday 7/5/23 by 5pm. Previously 4 beds - 1 of the bedrooms has been converted into a walk-in closet. Living room fireplace is strictly decorative - it is unusable. Brokers agent(s) do not represent or guarantee accuracy of the square footage, bedrooms/bathroom count, lot size, or lot dimension, fees or other information concerning the conditions and features of the property. Buyer is advised to independently verify all information with appropriate professionals. If you have any questions please call the listing agent, Michelle, at 310-750-7525. Please submit all offers with POF, Pre-qual letter, and FICO to michelle@thekondogroup.com.","Dishwasher, Disposal, Gas Range, Microwave, Range Hood, Refrigerator","True","175 - Peninsula Center","Special Assessments, Unknown","True","7575019033","","0","","False","4","1","","2","1","3","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","310-567-8790","","tadashikondo@gmail.com","","Tadashi","","","Kondo","pvkondtad","","","","","","v8542","","Compass","310-241-3038","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Text Message","Agent Email","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","7","2120000","#ERR","06/26/2023 6:43:49 PM","","","07/03/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/23/2023 11:05:18 PM","","","06/24/2023 12:00:00 AM","07/03/2023 12:00:00 AM","06/26/2023 6:26:20 PM","08/23/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/23/2023 12:00:00 AM","","","7","Double Door Entry","False","","","","","","","Cash to New Loan","See Remarks","True","Laminate, Tile, Wood","True","Central","True","Built-in Features, Granite Counters, Recessed Lighting","True","True","None","None","False","","","","33.78326","Individual Room, Inside","True","False","","","1899000","","","1899000","#ERR","650.241.0910","","MICHELLE@THEKONDOGROUP.COM","","Miki","","","Nishide","","PVNISHMIK","","","","","v8542","","Compass","310-241-3038","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.368131","","67","7740","0-1 Unit/Acre, Back Yard, Front Yard, Landscaped, Lawn, Sprinkler System","Curbs, Gutters, Sidewalks, Storm Drains, Street Lights","","Assessor","","","PV23113654","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","","","","Enclosed, Patio","True","39","","None","False","","947.7","Welcome to 5032 Rockvalley Rd, an exquisite one-level residence nestled in the prestigious neighborhood of Rancho Palos Verdes. This lovely property seamlessly combines luxurious elements, traditional charm, and comfortable living to create an idyllic retreat. Whether you're looking to move right in or customize your dream home, this prime location offers endless possibilities. The curb appeal and manicured landscaping surrounding the property will immediately draw you in. Step inside, and you'll be welcomed by the wooden floor that lines the expansive living areas, exuding timeless charm. Natural light fills the space through the sliding glass doors. The thoughtfully designed floor plan creates a seamless flow, ideal for both everyday living and entertaining guests. The gourmet kitchen is complete with top-of-the-line appliances, custom cabinetry, and a peninsula with seating for three. Adjacent to the kitchen, the dining area offers a great setting for intimate gatherings or formal meals, while a large sliding glass window give you the opportunity to connect the indoors with the outdoors. In addition to the three generously sized bedrooms, a versatile den awaits, ready to be transformed into your ideal space?a home office, an extra bedroom, or a cozy reading area. The luxurious primary suite featuring two separate en-suite bathrooms, a spacious walk-in closet with custom cabinetry, and a sliding glass door that overlooks the tranquil backyard. The en-suite bathrooms provide a ""his-and-her"" sanctuary, with one showcasing a soaking tub and a separate shower illuminated by a skylight, offering a natural brightness. The secondary en-suite bathroom features a shower and a custom vanity, with convenient access to the backyard. The two bedrooms are spacious and comfortable. There is another bathroom with an enlarged shower and a dual sink vanity, as well as a half bathroom located just off the laundry area for added convenience. The attached 2-car garage is easily accessible from the kitchen, allowing for easy grocery runs. Step outside into the private backyard, where meticulous landscaping and lush greenery create an oasis. The spa invites relaxation, while the patio offers the perfect setting for al fresco dining and enjoy the beautiful Southern California weather. This home offers a coveted lifestyle with its breathtaking coastal views just moments away, excellent PVPUSD schools, and convenient access to local activities, restaurants, and shops.","Spanish Tile","Den, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","John","Witherspoon","SWITHJOH","S5543","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","2120000","False","Full Service","Shown by appointment only. Call Michelle at 310-750-7525 to schedule an appointment with 24 hours notice. Property is owner occupied.","False","Private, Heated","True","True","2237","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Rockvalley","","5032","Road","","","Cash, Contract, Conventional, Submit","","19691","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","https://vimeo.com/839881861?share=copy","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=LVgnXC1Ecr3","","1966","90275","2454","RPRS10000*"
