"","0.2408","previous seller died peacfully in home at age 90 in November of 2021, he had lived there for many decades","Dishwasher, Double Oven, Gas Range","True","175 - Peninsula Center","None","False","7586019026","","0","","False","3","","","1","2","5","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Email","Agent Fax","Agent Voice Mail","","None","False","Los Angeles","57","2250000","#ERR","04/15/2024 4:36:57 PM","","06/04/2024 10:59:39 PM","06/11/2024 12:00:00 AM","07/09/2024 8:36:06 AM","","","04/15/2024 12:00:00 AM","06/11/2024 12:00:00 AM","06/01/2024 8:33:22 AM","07/08/2024 12:00:00 AM","07/08/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","57","","True","Area","","","","","","Cash","Family Room, Primary Bedroom","True","Laminate","True","Central","True","Beamed Ceilings, Cathedral Ceiling(s), Open Floorplan, Quartz Counters","True","True","","Supra","False","","","","33.774296","Individual Room","True","False","","","2350000","","","2490000","#ERR","310-378-9494","2397","jasonbuck@remaxpv.com","310-373-3427","Jason","","","Buck","","VBUCKRIC","","","","","V7186","310-373-3427","RE/MAX Estate Properties","310-378-9494","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.363501","","95","10490","Lot 10000-19999 Sqft","Curbs, Sidewalks","","Assessor","","","PV24074936","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","","","","Deck","True","41","","Private, Heated","True","","906.53","Welcome to your own slice of paradise perched atop the mesmerizing hills of Los Angeles! Behold this stunning Mid-century modern style residence boasting an incredible panoramic city light view from Malibu to LA Harbor that will leave you breathless.  Step inside and prepare to be captivated by the seamless integration of indoor-outdoor living, where every corner of this home is designed to maximize the awe-inspiring vistas of downtown Los Angeles, mountains, and LA harbor.   The heart of this 5 bedroom/3 bath home is a recently upgraded open kitchen featuring a sleek bar-top island, quartz countertops, skylight, walk-in pantry, stainless steel appliances and maple-lined cabinetry. With high vaulted ceilings and an open-concept layout, the kitchen seamlessly flows into the living space containing a beautiful PV stone fireplace, wall of glass sliding doors that enable you to enjoy the panoramic views from every angle.  Upstairs the Master suite enjoys the same fabulous view of mountains and city and is featured with a private balcony, his/hers closets (one walk in) and an updated primary bath that is a sanctuary unto itself, boasting a luxurious bathtub positioned to soak in the expansive city views. Two more bedrooms with vaulted ceilings and a full bathroom complete this level.  Downstairs you will find a lovely family room with built in bar/sink plus direct access to a heated pool with patio and a second city view sunning deck. Two additional bedrooms (one with built in library shelving) and a full bathroom complete this level. The garage has high ceilings, a large storage attic and direct access to the home through a dedicated laundry room. Outside, a charming front yard with lush green grass and a classic white picket fence adds to the curb appeal of this enchanting abode.  In the backyard, a gorgeous sparkling heated pool, 2 expansive sitting decks with panoramic views and a lava rock fire pit offers the perfect setting for al fresco gatherings or tranquil moments of reflection.   Located in the award-winning PVPUSD school district, this home is within walking distance to schools, restaurants, and Peninsula shopping.  Don't miss your chance to experience the epitome of luxury living in one of LA's most coveted neighborhoods. Come home to unparalleled beauty and sophistication ? where every day feels like a vacation in paradise.","","All Bedrooms Up","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Ming","Li","TRINGMLI","PB21555","2.5","%","Pinnacle Real Estate Group","2250000","False","Ful