Welcome to the most charming house on the hill ? a beautifully updated 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom home nestled in one of Rancho Palos Verdes? most sought-after neighborhoods. This residence offers the perfect blend of comfort, style, and the best of Southern California?s indoor-outdoor lifestyle. Set on a quiet, picturesque street with great curb appeal and easy access ?down the hill,? this home places you in a warm, welcoming community close to top amenities, scenic trails, and award-winning schools. Inside, elegance meets everyday living. The spacious living room boasts hardwood floors, vaulted ceilings, and a cozy fireplace?perfect for relaxing or entertaining. The separate formal dining room leads to a fully remodeled open-concept kitchen featuring high-end appliances, modern cabinetry, and premium finishes, including a Wolf range, and newer refrigerator and dishwasher. The kitchen flows seamlessly into a casual dining area and a comfortable family room, creating a harmonious space for everyday living. All three bathrooms have been exquisitely renovated, adding a luxurious touch throughout the home. The well-thought-out floor plan includes three bedrooms upstairs?including the sunlit primary suite with a walk-in closet and a spa-like bathroom?and a versatile fourth bedroom downstairs, ideal as a guest room or home office. Step outside to your private backyard oasis, designed for both relaxation and entertaining. A covered patio, spa, custom fire pit, and built-in BBQ create the ultimate outdoor entertaining space. As a bonus, the 3-car garage has been stylishly reimagined with finished flooring and custom cabinetry, offering a flexible area for families to play, hobbies, fitness, or entertaining. Located near top-rated schools, scenic trails, and just minutes from the coastline, this home offers the perfect balance of tranquility and convenience. Don't miss the opportunity to call this stunning home yours!","","Family Room, Foyer, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living