n bar with beverage fridge anchors the entertaining area, complemented by a modern gas fireplace. The chef?s kitchen is outfitted with custom soft-close cabinetry, a 6-burner Ilve range with center griddle, and integrated Fisher & Paykel refrigerator and dishwasher. Electrical outlets are discreetly hidden inside cabinets for convenience and clean design. Each bedroom has been upgraded with new custom closets with electrical and thoughtful lighting. The spacious primary suite features raised ceilings, a new window for added light, a walk-in closet with full custom cabinetry, and a completely remodeled bathroom with premium finishes and an outlet by the toilet for added flexibility. Significant structural and systems upgrades include all-newer plumbing, including a new sewer line to the street; updated electrical and subpanel in the garage; HVAC system and air conditioning; and a tankless water heater for on-demand efficiency. Garage is equipped with 220V EV charging outlets, and smart garage door openers have been installed. Additional improvements include a built-in surround sound system, a Ring-enabled alarm system, new backyard pavers, fresh landscaping in both front and back, and an above-ground hot tub. Even the laundry room features a built-in access hole for kitty litter or dog bed, reflecting the thoughtful customization found throughout the home. The backyard was extended by approximately eight feet to enhance both outdoor space and privacy, and the home enjoys complete seclusion with no visible neighbors.","","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Soleado","Palos Verdes","Ridgecrest","","Wendy","Sun","VSUNWEN","V7946","","","Estate Properties","2405000","False","Full Service","Thanks for your interest! PLEASE READ CAREFULLY: (1) Please schedule all showings by calling 1-800-746-9464 or through the SHOWINGTIME