tep onto the extra-long pebble tech driveway, offering ample space for boat or RV parking. Plus a 2 car finished garage. Inside, you'll find luxury vinyl flooring throughout and an open floor plan that flows seamlessly from room to room. An abundance of natural light and direct access to your large flat and grassy back yard is key as well! A standout feature of this home is the fully finished addition that has been transformed into an expansive bonus space?perfect as a family room, reading nook, or oversized dining area with an inviting indoor-outdoor feel with its' picture windows bringing your lush back yard front and center. The primary suite, located at the rear of the home for added privacy, boasts a new vanity and tiled shower. Dual-pane windows are installed throughout the home for energy efficiency and comfort. The fourth bedroom is currently set up as an office and opens to the dining area, but it includes a closet and can easily be enclosed for privacy. The kitchen has recently been refreshed with new quartz countertops, Stainless appliances, a ton of storage and counter space with an eat in kitchen nook for those busy mornings plus a formal dining room which is generously sized?ideal for entertaining large gatherings with family and friends. All this, just a stones throw from award-winning Silver Spur Elementary School. Plus you can walk up the the Peninsula Center and all it has to offer like Movie Theatres, shopping and great restaurants!","Composition","All Bedrooms Down, Bonus Room, Converted Bedroom, Den, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","DeDe","Hsu","PVDELIHSU","V7946","","","Estate Properties","1505000","False","Full Service","****PUBLIC OPEN HOUSES SAT Oct. 18th 1-4pm*** Please TEXT the listing agent w/very little notice, Heidi Ludwig at 310-920-2129 to schedule showings.","True","None","False","","1804","Assessor","","CA","Closed","O