pen floor plan flows easily into the dining and living areas, with trifold doors leading to the backyard for seamless indoor-outdoor living. The spacious and serene primary suite features windows overlooking the lush backyard and a ceiling fan for added comfort. The remodeled en suite bathroom includes dual sinks, a walk-in closet, and a dual shower setup with shower heads on opposite walls, creating a spa-like retreat. The two secondary bedrooms are well-sized and offer flexibility for guests, a home office, or more. The remodeled hall bathroom also features dual sinks and updated finishes. Soft, muted wall tones, light countertops, and warm hardwood floors create an inviting and cohesive feel throughout the home. The backyard is ideal for entertaining, with a large deck, a patio cover outfitted with overhead adjustable pergola louvers and side curtains for comfort and privacy, and plenty of space to gather. A charming greenhouse is also tucked into the garden. Additional features include new windows and Alexa-enabled smart home automation for lighting, blinds, doorbell, security system, oven, and microwave. A tankless water heater provides hot water on demand, and AC and heating are controlled by Google Nest thermostat. Located within the award-winning Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District, with access to Silver Spur Elementary, Palos Verdes Intermediate, and your choice of Palos Verdes High School or Palos Verdes Peninsula High School. Enjoy close proximity to shopping, dining, top-rated schools, scenic hiking trails, and the beach all under starlit night skies and with quiet ambiance.","","Great Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","Richard","Haynes","SBHAYNRIC2","SB1292440","","","Haynes Real Estate","1523400","False","Full Service","Showings by appointment only. Showings to begi