 an inviting floor plan.  A spacious living room features a warm fireplace, ideal for gathering with loved ones. It seamlessly flows into a dining area, where a sliding door beckons you to step outside onto the large patio, perfect for al fresco dining and entertaining. The separate large family room boasts an open beam vaulted ceiling, creating a spacious and airy feel. The roomy kitchen with a casual dining area is updated with shaker style cabinets, granite countertops, and a garden window that provides a picturesque view while you prepare meals. Retreat to the primary bedroom, complete with an en-suite bathroom for added convenience. Three other bedrooms are of good size, perfect for family, guests, or a home office. These bedrooms share a hallway full bathroom, beautifully appointed for your comfort. The backyard is truly a serene sanctuary, featuring an abundance of fruit trees and a tranquil view of the mountain and trees/greenery surrounding the house. On clear days, you can even enjoy a peek-a-boo view of the ocean and city, adding to the allure of this remarkable home. Don't miss your chance to make this delightful home your own!","","Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Montemalaga","Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","NANCY","KILAR","sbkilanan","SB1389340","2.5","%","Kilar Homes","1700000","False","Full Service","The property is in escrow. No more showing at this moment.","True","None","False","","2048","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Springcreek","","27013","Road","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","21355","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Ocean, Peek-A-Boo, Trees/Woods","True","","","Blinds","1960","90275","2118","RPRS8000*"
