n feature for busy family living. Hardwood floors and custom-remodeled bathrooms with thoughtful layouts highlight this three-bedroom home.  You will quickly appreciate how the laundry area is centrally located inside the home.  Recent updates include a spacious family area leading to the private backyard, perfect for playful pets and children to frolic. Enjoy the outdoor spaces with mature landscaping with plentiful citrus, apple, and avocado trees.  An EV charger completes your lifestyle in a new turnkey home.  Finally, checking all the boxes, this home is within walking distance of the highly coveted Silver Spur Elementary in the award-winning Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District, shopping, restaurants, and hiking trails.  Take advantage of this opportunity and make your next financial move today!","","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","kitty","Callahan","SBCALLKIT","SB1338520","","","eXp Realty of California Inc","1710000","False","Full Service","Please submit offers with POF and lender pre-approval to: kristin@kwarrickrealestate.com Please call or text listing agent for showing. Kristin Warrick,  Vista Sotheby's 714.914.0900","True","","","True","1613","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Graylog","","5564","Street","","","Cash to New Loan","","21169","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","https://vimeo.com/1053931550?share=copy","https://vimeo.com/1053931550?share=copy","","1956","90275","1732","RPRS8000*"
