n Ground, Tile","True","Close Of Escrow","1053.76","ABSOLUTELY BEAUTIFUL TURN KEY HOME IN ROLLING HILLS ESTATE WITH PANORAMIC VIEWS. HOME REHAB COMPLETED BY HGTV's TAREK and CHRISTINE FROM FLIP OR FLOP.  No expense was spared on this 3 bedroom, 2 bath remodeled home that sits on a beautifully manicured corner lot. The many picture windows and large sliding glass door provide plenty of natural light throughout the home.  The vaulted ceilings make an already open floor plan feel even larger.  There is all wood flooring, moldings, neutral paint, recessed lighting and paneled doors throughout the living areas.  The galley style kitchen is open to the living area and features an abundance of new custom white shaker cabinets, beautiful quartz counter tops, a subway tile back-splash, an oversize sink and newer appliances.  Both bathrooms have been upgraded with vanities, fixtures, low flow toilets and custom tile work throughout. New garage door openers. You can enjoy the city lights view and watch the sunset from your patio or enjoy a dip in your private, heated in-ground pool and spa. The options are endless. Bring your buyers to this home - they will not be disappointed!","Composition","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Formal Entry, Galley Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Marc","Brenneiser","SBBRENMAR","SB1343830","2.5","%","Las Lomas Realty, Inc.","1725000","False","Full Service","Agent go direct supra is active from 8 AM to 6 PM.  Please text or call listing agent to get the alarm code.","True","Private","True","True","1637","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Willow Wood","","5004","Road","","","Cash, Conventional, FHA","","21270","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Available, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Mountain(s), Panoramic, Pool","True","","","","1956","90274","2430","RERA10000*"
