tecture with a groovy flair. The super groovy kitchen is a showstopper, featuring sleek, retro-inspired cabinetry, vibrant accents, and a layout that?s both functional and fun, ideal for cooking and entertaining. The open-concept living and dining areas are bathed in natural light, with expansive windows that seamlessly blend indoor and outdoor living. The backyard is a private oasis, perfect for a growing family, weekend gatherings, or simply unwinding under the California sun. Whether you?re hosting a summer barbecue or enjoying a quiet morning coffee, this space offers endless possibilities. Located in a top-rated school district and just minutes from beautiful coastal trails, shopping, and dining, this home offers the perfect balance of style, comfort, and convenience. Don?t miss your chance to own this mid-century masterpiece in one of the best neighborhoods in Rancho Palos Verdes!","","Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","","Palos Verdes","","Jessica","Kim","PVKIMJESS","V7946","","","Estate Properties","1730000","False","Full Service","Vacant - Go direct. Contact Tony Accardo at (310) 855-3557 text/call for more information or showings - thank you!","True","None","False","","2050","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Shorewood","","27010","Road","","","Cash to New Loan","","21350","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","","","","1958","90275","2228","RPRS8000*"
