"Vacant","","","","","Driveway, Garage","True","","","1","","None","False","","1056.81","Nestled in desirable Rolling Hills Estates, this Mid-Century gem is not to be missed! Reimagined by Maverick Design, this light filled 3 bedroom, 2 bath home with an ideal floor plan and floor-to-ceiling windows is Southern California living at its best. Through the front gate, you will be welcomed by a private courtyard which leads you to the entry of the home. The living area?s dramatic vaulted ceilings, skylights, and stunning stone fireplace create a true focal point that celebrates the original architectural character. Connected seamlessly to a dining area, the living room opens to the manicured backyard through a large sliding glass door, creating a flawless transition between indoor and outdoor living spaces. Entertain guests while enjoying your partial views of Downtown LA! The designer kitchen is a culinary haven, featuring quartz countertops, handmade tile backsplash, new white shaker cabinets, white oak open shelving and new stainless-steel appliances. Soft-close drawers, antique brass hardware, and built-in counter-height breakfast bar are the finishing touches. Past the kitchen is another family room with high ceilings and large windows, providing a bright and airy atmosphere. Down the private wing of the house, each bedroom is a tranquil retreat, flooded with natural light to create a calming ambiance. The hall bathroom showcases designer finishes, dual vanities, and a modern tub. The primary ensuite bathroom features a large white oak vanity, designer tile, and finishes that create a spa-like experience within the comfort of your home. The home also features a dedicated laundry closet and air conditioning. Outside, the thoughtfully landscaped yard surrounds the home with a beautiful mix of mature landscaping, new sod in the backyard, and an irrigation system. The detached garage is a versatile space, offering options for your cars, home office, or exercise room to suit your needs. Situated just minutes away from shops, restaurants, the beach, and nestled in the prestigious PVPUSD School District, this Rolling Hills Estates residence is more than a home?it is a lifestyle! This is the Rolling Hills Estates property you have been waiting for. Go see it today!","","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","James","Abdelmalek","PVABDEJAM","V8040","2.5","%","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","1730000","False","Full Service","First showing open house, Saturday and Sunday November 18-19 from one to 4 PM. After, schedule through showing time. CBS code required.","","None","False","","1637","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Dunwood","","26459","Road","","","Cash, Conventional, Fannie Mae, FHA, Freddie Mac, Submit, VA Loan","","21271","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Neighborhood, Peek-A-Boo","True","https://youtu.be/y6qJUlXcMN8","","","1956","90274","",""
