 with the Anderson windows, and solid oak front door.   The spacious primary bedroom features a large walk-in closet, ensuite bath with an oversized sunken tub/shower and a sliding glass door that leads to a luxurious, custom built, in-ground heated spa complete with hand painted tiles, waterfalls and greenery wrapped in Palos Verdes stone.  Your own private oasis to relax and unwind!   The remaining four bedrooms provide a perfect place for your choice of family and work-from-home opportunities. With two expansive living areas, one with a Palos Verdes stone fireplace, and the other a den with a brick fireplace, built in custom cabinets and vaulted ceilings you?ll always have a place to relax or entertain with loved ones. Luxury vinyl plank flooring is new throughout the entire home, as well as new interior/exterior paint, and a newly installed Lennox Heating & A/C unit and Nest thermostat.   Custom oak cabinetry, recessed lighting, skylights and a bay window showcase the formal dining room and overlook the lush greenery of the front yard. In the kitchen, you?ll enjoy new gorgeous granite countertops, sink, and selected new stainless steel appliances (gas stove/oven w air fryer, built-in microwave, dishwasher, and wine fridge). The large private back yard invites you from the kitchen out to the beautiful wraparound deck and barbeque area making this a perfect place to entertain family and friends or a great play area!  There are several fruit trees in the fully fenced front & back yard from sweet dragonfruit to the most delicious figs from your 45 year old Mission fig tree.  Great neighborhood, walking distance to Peninsula Center Shopping, dog-friendly community and many award-winning schools in the Palos Verdes Peninsula School District!  This is a must see home offering sophistication, comfort, and accessibility!   Buyer to verify accuracy such as square footage, lot size and other information.","Asphalt","Atrium, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main 