ow","903.39","Welcome to this Exquisite Palos Verdes Pool Home. Offering nearly 2,000 square feet of beautifully designed living space, this residence masterfully utilizes every inch of its open layout. As you enter the stunning custom iron & glass double front door, you?re immediately embraced by a bright, airy atmosphere, enhanced by a gentle breeze. The main level features an open floor plan with elegant porcelain tile floors, ideal for both living and entertaining. The spacious living room flows into the dining area and the gourmet kitchen?a true centerpiece. This kitchen is a chef's delight, boasting top-of-the-line appliances including a New Sub-Zero refrigerator, New Wolf oven, wine chiller, and Ultracraft cabinetry, complemented by gorgeous granite countertops. Just down the hall, you'll find two well-appointed bedrooms and a remodeled bathroom with exquisite Japanese tiles & a rainfall shower. Upstairs, engineered flooring continues throughout the upper level, where a light-filled family room awaits. Large windows allow natural light to flood the space, while a cozy fireplace adds warmth. The primary bedroom features a freshly remodeled bathroom with a large shower adorned with beautiful stone and tile, a shower bench, and dual sinks. A highlight of this home is the LaCantina folding glass door on the main level, which opens to the lushly landscaped backyard. Here, a sparkling pool awaits?a private oasis perfect for relaxation and gatherings. The backyard is a gardener?s paradise with fruit trees like Japanese persimmon, donut peach, limes, dwarf avocados, lemon, Fuji apples, orange, tangerine & a ""Lovely Apple"" tree bearing fruit three times a year. The garden also features roses, orchids, & honeysuckle. With existing connections, adding an outdoor kitchen is easy. The sloped area offers potential for a multi-level deck with ocean views. Freshly painted in & out the home has many recent upgrades include Milgard dual-paned windows, a Navien tankless water heater, a high-efficiency HVAC system, modern linear AC vents, plumbing, electrical wiring, flooring. (much more) Completing the property is a large two-car garage with storage, automatic doors & a dedicated laundry room. The meticulously maintained exterior features lush landscaping. Located near award-winning PV schools and minutes from shopping, restaurants, & recreation, this home offers luxury & convenience. **Discover the beauty of this exceptional property and make it your own today!**","Shingle","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bedroom, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Ed","MacLaughlin","SMACLEDW","SB1300260","","","Re/Max Estate Properties","1758000","False","Full Service","Showings by Appointment, Text Kristen 424-571-2171","True","None","False","True","1946","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Montemalaga","","5530","Drive","","Traditional","Cash to New Loan","","24530","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","","","Double Pane Windows","1962","90275","1743",""
