versized 2 car garage with lots of built-in shelving is equipped with a 240V outlet for electric vehicles.   Cook to your heart?s content in the country style kitchen with center island and counter space to spare. A dual side gas fireplace graces the living and dining area.  Sliding glass doors open up to the backyard from the kitchen, breakfast area and spacious living room. This bright, freshly painted, turnkey home can be enjoyed now.  Education, recreation and any amenity is near at hand.  Conveniences abound as access to the 405 and 110 freeway is only minutes away.   Distinguished Award-Winning schools, Peninsula Library, Palos Verdes Art Center, Peninsula Shopping Center, Sunday Farmer?s Market, movie theaters, parks, dog park and hiking are only seconds from this fantastic location. In a great neighborhood, this home will not last!","","All Bedrooms Down, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","","Palos Verdes","","Veronica","Xu","PVXUVER","V8107","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","1788000","False","Full Service","Easy to show.  Contact agent JoAnn DeFlon 310-508-3581 joann.deflon@vistasir.com Call/text for CBS code","True","None","False","","2355","Public Records","","CA","Closed","One","","","Fond du Lac Road","","27128","","","","Conventional","","7099","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Available, Water Available","None","False","","","","1958","90275","2268",""
