ough and with access to an entertaining SunRoom equipped with its own custom grill. The design and floorplan/layout of this home masterfully uses every square foot available. Take notice of the lush well maintained landscaping that surrounds this gorgeous home. The living areas of the home feature a dual side fireplace along with access to the rear yard. The kitchen is designed to overlook the family/dining room and rear yard. The primary suite is adorned beautifully and leads you right into the primary bath and walk-in shower. The additional bedrooms are all ample in size and also feature plenty of natural light. As an added feature the home includes an abundance of Solar Panels allowing for no electrical cost and actually generating a credit. The entire design-arrangement of this home will have you and your Family/Friends cascading onto the entertaining rear yard perfect for twilight dining amongst the stars or that morning cup of coffee. The large private rear yard features mature fruit producing trees such as pomegranate, olive, orange and lemon. All walking distance to Peninsula Center and Peninsula High School. AN ABSOLUTE MUST SEE...","","Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Chris","Adlam","VADLACHR","V8107","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","1800000","False","Full Service","Easy to show. Please call/text agent Gustavo Cardenas 310-447-4771 with date/time and standby for confirmation.","True","None","False","","1890","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Waupaca","","5330","Road","","","Cash to New Loan","","21350","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood","True","https://show.tours/v/cDYCdfr","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=1YSzYs5mpaT","","1958","90275","2232","RPRS8000*"
