 home also includes a dedicated laundry room, a remodeled kitchen with top-tier cabinetry and countertops, and a host of modern upgrades: solar system, new ductwork, EV charging, newer electrical panel, sprinkler system, and proper drainage. Experience elevated living in a home that combines timeless style with practical, eco-conscious upgrades, your private escape awaits.","","Den, Entry, Living Room, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Deborah","Won","SBWONDEBO","sb1293690","","","Estate Properties","1800000","False","Full Service","*DO NOT GO DIRECT* APPOINTMENT ONLY - Please text or call Stella to schedule a showing  (310) 741-0303","","","","","1756","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Willow Wood","","5276","Road","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","21269","","Single Family Residence","","","Trees/Woods","True","","","","1956","90274","2369","RERA10000*"
"","0.2076","Shown by appointment only. Easy to show with a couple hours advance notice. Seller works from home and dog on property, so must have confirmed appointment. Please text George at (310)717-8767 with name, company, DRE# and requested date and time to show. https://www.themls.com/showing/request/25614549","Barbecue, Dishwasher, Double Oven, Disposal, Gas Cooktop, Microwave, Refrigerator","True","176 - Silver Spur","","False","7546010034","","","","False","2","0","0","0","2","3","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Co-Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","64","1820000","#ERR","11/04/2025 6:11:47 PM","","","11/25/2025 12:00:00 AM","01/08/2026 6:02:44 AM","","","11/04/2025 12:00:00 AM","11/25/2025 12:00:00 AM","01/07/2026 8:26:44 PM","01/07/2026 12:00:00 AM","01/07/2026 12:00:00 AM","","","64","Sliding Doors","","Breakfast Nook, Dining Room","","Stucco","Wood","True","","","Living Room, Fire Pit, Free Standing","True","Carpet, Tile, Wood","True","Central","True","Bar, Beamed Ceilings, Ceiling Fan(s), Crown Molding, Dry Bar, Open Floorplan, Storage","True","True","No Key Safe","None","","","","","33.790663","Dryer Included, In Garage, Washer Included","True","","","3rd Party Rights, Easements","1850000","Personal Property","","1850000","#ERR","310-717-8767","","george@georgesellsthesouthbay.com","","Georgiana","","","Rosenkranz","","CLW-C145558","","","","","CLW-X81461","","Compass","","","Seller Reserved","-118.371926","","","9041","Back Yard, Front Yard, Landscaped, Lawn","","","Assessor","","","25614549","","2","4","","","Owner","","","","","Built-In Storage, Driveway, Garage - Two Door","True","Patio Open, Slab","True","34","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","842.59","Tucked away in peaceful seclusion, this uniquely unassuming home is a true sanctuary offering panoramic views of the city skyline, distant mountains, and sparkling coastline. Thoughtfully updated and masterfully designed, every detail of the home is crafted to maximize the natural beauty of its surroundings while preserving a sense of privacy and effortless indoor-outdoor living. Light, airy, and functionally elegant, the home's open floor plan flows gracefully from one space to the next. The kitchen, complete with a cozy breakfast nook, overlooks city views and opens seamlessly into a formal dining room and an expansive family room. Entertain with ease at the built-in wet bar, or showcase your collection in the walk-in wine refrigerator. Oversized sliding glass doors lead to a one-of-a-kind backyard oasis that must be experienced to be fully appreciated. A wide and welcoming hallway leads to the bedroom wing, where the primary suite serves as a peaceful retreat. Featuring dual walk-in closets, a private bath, and breathtaking views, it's the perfect blend of comfort and luxury. Outdoors, the huge backyard is a haven for relaxation and entertaining. Multiple seating areas provide intimate spaces for conversation around the fire pits or beside a striking stone fireplace, all set against sweeping vistas. A shaded pergola with a mounted big screen TV invites guests to gather and unwind in comfort. The built-in BBQ is perfectly placed so the host can stay in the heart of the action while taking in views of Kings Harbor. A charming rustic bar, custom cornhole court and lush, thoughtfully curated landscaping complete this incredible space. Even the garage is masterfully designed and organized - a true extension of the home's thoughtful craftsmanship. Built-in custom cabinetry lines the walls, offering plentiful storage without clutter. Durable epoxy floors lend a clean, polished finish, while a dedicated laundry area has been seamlessly integrated for optimal function and flow. It's as practical as it is refined. This hidden gem is more than a home, it's a lifestyle, offering serenity, beauty, and connection in one extraordinary package conveniently located to shopping, dining, entertainment and the best the Palos Verdes Peninsula has to offer including the Palos Verdes Golf and Tennis Club, The Rolling Hills Country Club, Los Verdes Golf Course and Terranea Resort.","Composition, Shingle","Attic, Entry, Family Room, Great Room, Living Room, Walk-In Closet, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","CLW-10013316","Rebecca","Bond","SBBONDREB","S6107","","","Beach City Brokers","1820000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Easy to show with a few hours notice. Seller works from home and dog on property, so must have confirmed appointment. Listing Agent must be present. Showing Information: Call First,Appointment Only,Listing Agent Accompanies,Animal/Pets on Property,Text LA 1 ","True","None","False","","2160","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","One","","","Birchfield","","26228","Avenue","","Traditional","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, City Lights, Coastline, Hills, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/485316","","","1956","90275","1720","RPRS8000*"
"","0.2832","OFFER DEADLINE IS MONDAY AT 7:PM.","Dishwasher, Disposal, Refrigerator, Vented Exhaust Fan","True","176 - Silver Spur","Unknown","True","7577008021","","0","","False","2","","","","2","4","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Rod","Yoon","PVYOONROD","V8040","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","13","1827325","#ERR","03/19/2025 6:47:24 AM","","","04/01/2025 12:00:00 AM","08/26/2025 9:55:03 AM","04/30/2025 12:00:00 AM","","03/19/2025 12:00:00 AM","04/01/2025 12:00:00 AM","03/19/2025 6:47:24 AM","05/01/2025 12:00:00 AM","05/01/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","13","","False","In Kitchen, In Living Room","","HardiPlank Type, Stone Veneer, Stucco","Vinyl","True","","Conventional","Living Room","True","Laminate, Tile","True","Central","True","Open Floorplan","True","True","Front Door","Supra","False","","","","33.782901","Inside, Stackable","True","False","","","1849000","","","1849000","#ERR","","","EvanJay310@gmail.com","","Evan","310-864-1233","","Jay","","SJAYEVAN","","","","","S5251","310-378-1997","Estate Properties","310-378-7747","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.377776","","40","12335","Back Yard, Front Yard","Biking , Curbs, Golf, Hiking , Horse Trails, Park, Preserve/Public Land, Sidewalks, Storm Drains, Suburban","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","SB25041960","","2","2","","1","Vacant","","","","","Driveway, Electric Vehicle Charging Station(s), Garage","True","Patio","True","37","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","1094.21","This beautiful 4 Bedroom - 2 Bathroom home is in the highly desirable Silver Spur Neighborhood of Rancho Palos Verdes. Fully Remodeled in 2017 and ready to move right in. As you drive up to the home, you will instantly recognize the curb appeal and charm of this wonderful property. Long lasting Hardie-board wood style siding and stacked stone front entry with a large driveway with attached garage includes an electric car charger. Built in planters and nicely landscaped. This great home also includes a FULLY OWNED SOLAR SYSTEM WITH BATTERY BACKUP installed in 2024 with upgraded 200 Amp Electrical Panel! Upon entry you will love the open concept kitchen and living room with fireplace and built-in storage cabinets, wood laminate and tile flooring. The remodeled kitchen has a large center island with breakfast counter, quartz countertops with tile backsplash, white shaker cabinets, stainless appliances, induction cooktop and stylish pendant lighting. Nice dining area with slider doors to rear. The 4 spacious bedrooms include a primary bedroom with remodeled bathroom with a large walk in shower. The hall bathroom has a shower/tub combo with a glass door. This home has been owner upgraded over time including a replaced roof, HVAC, recessed LED ceiling lights, vinyl windows and sliders, wood shutters and window blinds, closet built-ins, gutters with stacked laundry closet inside the home. The two car garage has finished walls with large built-in storage cabinets and an elegant faux wood finish automatic garage door. The private rear yard includes newer sod lawn, concrete rear patio, vegetable garden area, vinyl fencing, exterior lighting and has an upgraded retaining wall to rear lot hillside. THE AWARD WINNING PALOS VERDES UNIFIED SCHOOL DISTRICT and within walking distance to Silver Spur Elementary and Peninsula High School. Close to the main Palos Verdes shopping centers and an easy off the hill location for commuters. This wonderful home is ready for you, DO NOT DELAY!","Composition","Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","Lauren","Yoon","VLEELAU","V8040","","","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","1827325","False","Full Service","Please text Evan Jay (310) 864-1233 your showing date and time and then go direct. BE SURE TO CLOSE AND LOCK ALL D