ites.  The 13,508 square foot lot gives you many options.  All bedrooms are large, with 3 on the main level.  The bathrooms and kitchen are all updated, and the kitchen is quite large, featuring newer appliances and Corian counters.  Apart from the master suite and 2 more large bedrooms, the main level includes the kitchen, living/dining room, and an enchanting, private indoor spa room.  The upper level includes 2 large bedrooms (one with walk-in closet), a full bath, and an office/storage room.  Most windows and doors have been upgraded to newer dual pane, and the home features central air conditioning as well as a re-circulating system for instant hot water.  The solar panels on the roof generate electricity, resulting in a very low electricity bill.  It's an easy walk to Silver Spur Elementary, Peninsula High, and the Peninsula Center.","Asphalt, Shingle","Den, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Miriam","Matzke","SBMATZMIR","SB1385640","","","Kielty Real Estate","1841000","False","Full Service","Vacant, just go.  Top lock only.  Lock box on 30dark30 Saturday 9/6.  I won't insult you by telling you to lock up . . . I mean, seriously.","True","Private, Fiberglass, Heated, See Remarks","True","True","3062","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Willow Wood","","5118","Road","","Traditional","Cash to New Loan","","21271","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Bridge(s), City Lights, Harbor, Ocean, See Remarks, Vincent Thomas Bridge, Water","True","","","Casement Windows, Double Pane Windows","1956","90274","",""
"2+ Access Exits, No Interior Steps","0.1929","1. ?Owners are selling because they are recent empty-nesters. ?Home and yard are too big, and they own other homes.  2. ?Bathrooms: ?Both were originally full baths, but over the years have been converted into two 3/4 baths. ?The hall bath could easily be converted back to a full. 3. ?The land behind the home is own by a conservancy and cannot be built upon. 4. ?There is no deadline for offers yet. ?We will respond to each as they come in. 5. ?LONG escrow or contingent escrow is fine. ?Sellers are in no rush. 6.  Living SF:  We had the home measured at 1,569.  Tax records say 1,538.","6 Burner Stove, Built-In Range, Dishwasher, Microwave, Refrigerator","True","176 - Silver Spur","None","False","7578006002","","0","","False","2","","","1","1","4","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","doug.edward.christensen@gmail.com","","Douglas","","","Christensen","sbchridou","","","","","","SB1332850","","Real Brokerage Technologies","619-248-6434","","Karen","Anderson","VANDEKAR","v8460","Keller Williams Realty","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Pager Ph","Agent Fax","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","16","1845000","#ERR","02/21/2025 4:28:30 PM","","","03/11/2025 12:00:00 AM","04/07/2025 8:25:48 AM","","","02/21/2025 12:00:00 AM","03/11/2025 12:00:00 AM","02/28/2025 11:08:55 AM","04/07/2025 12:00:00 AM","04/07/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","16","","False","Dining Room","Barbecue Private","","","","","Cash to Loan","Living Room","True","Wood","True","Central","True","Open Floorplan","True","True","front slider","Combo, See Remarks, Supra","False","","","","33.782154","Gas & Electric Dryer Hookup, Gas Dryer Hookup, Individual Room, Inside","True","False","","","1799000","","","1799000","#ERR","","","nick@peters-team.com","","Nick","","","Peters","","sbpetenic3","","","","","SB1332850","","Real Brokerage Technologies","619-248-6434","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.378098","","2","8401","Back Yard, Front Yard, Landscaped, Lawn, Level with Street, Lot 6500-9999, Rectangular Lot, Level, Yard","Sidewalks","Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","SB25038549","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Asphalt, Driveway Level, Garage, Garage Faces Side, Garage - Single Door, Workshop in Garage","True","","","53","","Private, In Ground, Solar Heat","True","","1175.91","Welcome to your forever home.  As you pass the lush green vine wall that encloses the front courtyard patio, where morning coffee/tea and a book seem appropriate, the surprises are just beginning.  A relaxing oasis awaits you where a 4 bedroom 1,500 SF+ home sits on a flat 8,400 SF lot.  ** Ever wondered how it would feel if Palm Springs was nestled on an island?  Wonder no more.  This home is the best of those 2 worlds.  **  As you look into the living room out through the glass double doors into a huge backyard with a pool, salt water spa, and mature fruit trees (Navel Orange, Grapefruit, Meyer Lemon, Lemon, Loquat, Guava); entertainer?s delight.  The owners remodeled much of the home to create a relaxing feel with a touch of class. The remodeled kitchen, with new flooring, cabinets, and counter tops and high end appliances, appeals to a master chef and opens to the living room.   The living room has a real wood burning fireplace for those chilly nights or to look out into the idyllic backyard and pool during the day (the blue lagoon at night). Both bathrooms are remodeled with Hansgrohe hardware and rainshower.  **  The house lays out much bigger than the SF suggests with flexibility in the purpose of the rooms.  The current office/library/family room can easily be a 4th bedroom or even a guest room/Junior ADU potential as it has an exterior separate door.  **  Another bedroom has new double glass doors that spill out to a wood deck to enjoy the sunshine in the backyard. It can also be an office or guest room with a built-in queen-sized Murphy bed and a connected bathroom with shower.  **  The wide 2 car garage has a workbench, but you can use it as a work out space as well.  **  New A/C installed.  **  The house is on the west side of the street where you get a nice breeze and it's cooler than the east side.  Home backs up to the Malaga Creek reserve which gives you a feeling of extra privacy.  This location boasts quiet living with the ease of local conveniences offered by the Promenade on the Peninsula which offers shopping, groceries and restaurants. PV Peninsula High School is only 0.3 miles away and Silver Spur elementary is 0.5 (a 90 second drive). 100 feet to the west is the Mossbank culdesac; 4,000 SF of flat, quiet space for kids activities. ** Note: Optional - the home can be purchased Partially or Fully Furnished!  **  Seller is open to offers contingent on selling a home!  **  Your forever home awaits!","","All Bedrooms Down, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bedroom, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Emmer","Ruano","SBRUANEMM","S4726","","","Keller Williams Realty","1845000","False","Full Service","**   The home can be shown anytime, but first get confirmation by texting BOTH the seller Carrie (310-529-0768) and Nick (310-308-2609) with your showing plans. ?We will reply asap with confirmation. **  There is a Supra on the front slider.  No CBS code.  Combo box is also there - ask Nick for combo. **   There is a small friendly dog (seller will manage the dog) and an indoor-outdoor cat that I've never seen. ? **   Leave all windows exactly as you find them. Seller has a cat who pops in and out via a window. **   Call me for any questions.","","","","","1569","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Basswood","","26815","Avenue","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, VA Loan","","21351","","Single Family Residence","","","Hills","True","","","Double Pane Windows","1957","90275","2207","RPRS8000*"
