ay storage and tack room along with a large turn out and direct access to miles and miles of trails on the Palos Verdes  Peninsula.  A short jaunt to Ernie Howlett Park is right down the street.  Easy access to south bay cities, beaches and freeway.  This home has a Pelican Whole house water filtration system and transferable solar panels. You don't want to miss this special home situated on a cul de sac street and park adjacent... the melding of all the best the Peninsula has to offer!!!!!","","Laundry, Main Floor Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Charlene","O'Neil","voneicha","V7946","","","Estate Properties","1850000","False","Full Service","Please text Charlene date and time of showing and leave card on kitchen counter.  Access backyard thru kitchen back door please (not through downstairs sliding door, new carpet just installed). Thank you for showing. Solar panel installed 10/2014 by ABC Solar, central inverter, 5.8kw, on grid, owned and transferable.","","","","","2172","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Rockbluff","","4604","Drive","","","Cash, Conventional","","21758","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Hills, Pasture","True","","","","1959","90274","1514","RERA10000*"
"","0.1991","Broker/Agent does not guarantee accuracy of square footage, lot size, ordinances, zoning, rent control, permits, use code, schools and/or other information concerning the conditions or features of the property provided by the seller or obtained from public records or other sources. Buyer is advised to independently verify the accuracy of all information through personal inspection and with appropriate professionals. All visitors to be advised home may have security recording systems.","","","176 - Silver Spur","Unknown","True","7577009021","","0","","False","3","1","","","2","3","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Home Ph","Agent Fax","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","6","1870000","#ERR","03/21/2025 1:23:09 PM","","","03/27/2025 12:00:00 AM","09/10/2025 8:48:54 AM","","","02/25/2025 12:00:00 AM","03/27/2025 12:00:00 AM","03/21/2025 1:23:09 PM","04/25/2025 12:00:00 AM","04/25/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","6","","False","Breakfast Counter / Bar","","","","","","Cash to Loan","Living Room","True","","True","Central","True","","True","True","Water pipe to the right of the front door.","Supra","False","","","","33.781712","Individual Room","True","False","","","1749000","","","1749000","#ERR","310-855-3557","","tony.accardo@compass.com","","Anthony","310-855-3557","","Accardo","","PVACCAANT","","","","","v8542","","Compass","310-241-3038","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.37699","","126","8673","0-1 Unit/Acre","Sidewalks","","Public Records","","","PV25060328","","2","2","","1","Vacant","","","","","Garage","True","","","34","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","1187.3","Nestled on a picturesque, tree-lined street, this beautifully updated Ranch-style home featuring 3 spacious bedrooms, 2.5 baths, and a permitted bonus room, this home is designed to meet all your needs in one of the most desirable neighborhoods in Rancho Palos Verdes. Completely refreshed in 2024, the residence showcases a thoughtfully designed kitchen with high-end appliances, including a Wolf range. Fresh interior and exterior paint, along with new landscaping, elevate both curb appeal and outdoor living. French doors and rich wood flooring throughout infuse the home with warmth and character, while custom California Closet systems in every bedroom ensure optimal storage and organization. Significant recent updates include energy-efficient new windows (excluding the garage), a tankless water heater system, an upgraded 220 electrical panel, a new garage door with an automatic opener. The garage is equipped with a Tesla charging station, as well as a car tire and bike compressor for added convenience. The home also features a high-quality water filtration system for peace of mind. The permitted, enclosed bonus room offers excellent flexibility?ideal as an office, guest space, or creative studio. The spacious, gated backyard is an entertainer?s dream, featuring a built-in BBQ, two refrigerators with a built-in ice cooler, making it perfect for hosting gatherings or enjoying quiet outdoor evenings by the built-in fireplace. Vaulted ceilings add to the interior living space with an additional fireplace, while the backyard offers opportunities for future expansion. Location couldn?t be better?this home is within walking distance to Silver Spur Elementary, Peninsula High School, the Peninsula Library, and the Peninsula Shopping Center. Don?t miss out on the opportunity to own a home that blends modern convenience with timeless appeal in one of Palos Verdes? most sought-after communities!","","Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","","Palos Verdes","","Dunham","Stewart","SBSTEWJAM","S1278850","","","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","1870000","False","Full Service","VACANT, GO DIRECT.  Contact Tony Accardo at (310) 855-3557 text/call for more information or showings - thank you!","True"