oms, each designed with a meticulous attention to detail, this residence offers a touch of luxury at every turn. Hardwood floors add warmth and sophistication, seamlessly connecting each space and creating a welcoming atmosphere throughout the home. Enjoy an abundance of natural light streaming through newer windows and French doors, creating a bright and airy ambiance. The addition of a tankless water heater ensures both efficiency and convenience, providing a modern touch to this classic residence.  Step outside into your own private oasis, where a beautiful pool becons for relaxation and rejuvenation. Entertain guests on the upper deck while basking in breathtaking city lights views, creating the perfect backdrop for memorable gatherings. For added convenience and security, a detached gated garage provides ample space for parking and storage. This residence at 5413 Diversey Drive seamlessly combines timeless elegance with modern amenities, offering a perfect blend of comfort and sophistication. Welcome home to a lifestyle of luxury, entertainment, and tranquility in the heart of Rancho Palos Verdes.","Shingle","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Ritesh","Kohad","TRKOHARIT","PB3216","2.5","%","T.N.G. Real Estate Consultants","1950000","False","Full Service","Please call or text listing agent to schedule a showing. DO NOT USE SHOWING TIME - SHOWING TIME REQUESTS WILL NOT BE ANSWERED.","True","None","False","True","2579","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Diversey","","5413","Drive","","Contemporary, Traditional","Conventional","","21169","","Single Family Residence","","Sewer Connected","City Lights, Mountain(s), Panoramic, See Remarks","True","","","Double Pane Windows, Plantation Shutters, Roller Shields","1956","90275","1727","RPRS8000*"
