tric fireplace adds a touch of warmth and charm, seamlessly connecting the living and dining spaces. The kitchen features a peninsula with a breakfast bar, stainless steel large kitchen sink, very bright and modern, a culinary haven to be. With four bedrooms, including a gorgeous view in primary suite, there's ample space for you and your family.  Home also has an attached 2 car garage and laundry closet in hallway. Conveniently located in award winning PVPUSD schools, walking distance to Cornerstone Elementary which is one of the best, lots of restaurants, shopping, Parmadale and grocery stores. 15 minutes to 405 or 110 freeway. You have to come see the view.  Photo can't capture it all.","","Great Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","Peninsula","Ridgecrest","","Dyan","Naylor","SMURPDYA","S4164","","","Estate Properties","1995000","False","Full Service","Text your name, company name, and  BRE number and go direct. For more information: http://www.26915grayslakeroad.com/ 3D tour: https://my.matterport.com/models/4dmDbQJ59Ky","True","","","","1890","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Grayslake","","26915","Road","","","Cash to New Loan","","24423","","Single Family Residence","","","Coastline, Ocean","True","","","","1960","90275","2106","RPRS8000*"
