 rear yard is a private oasis framed by cypress and pine trees, tall hedges and gravel paths. A built-in BBQ station with prep space, a raised dining deck and a privacy gate make it perfect for both intimate dinners and festive gatherings. The chef?s kitchen features granite counters, a glass tile backsplash, stainless steel farmhouse sink, upgraded appliances and sleek cabinetry, plus a casual breakfast area for everyday meals. A built-in entertainment buffet adds functionality with a second sink, beverage fridge and extra storage. The spacious primary suite is bright and tranquil, with recessed lighting, a custom walk-in closet system and a spa-inspired bathroom showcasing a light-up mirror, granite dual vanity and a walk-in glass shower with rain shower head and designer tile. Two additional bedrooms share a well-appointed bath with tub/shower combination. Additional highlights include: Tesla home charger, Charge Point charger, new roof and attic insulation (2024), air conditioning, tankless water heater, built-in speakers, custom remote-control blinds, a finished garage with storage system and direct access to the home, plus Ring camera system with 10 cameras throughout the property. This is a turn-key, private escape in one of RPV?s most convenient and coveted neighborhoods.","","All Bedrooms Down","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Ryan","Shaw","SBSHAWRYA","sb1350760","","","Compass","2020000","False","Full Service","Text agent Cari Corbais for showings 310-704-4014.","","","","","2097","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Basswood","","26803","Avenue","","","Submit","","21351","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","","","","1957","90275","2207","RPRS8000*"
