 sod, and colorful planters create an inviting entrance. Upon entering you will notice original hard wood floors that were completely refinished, a feature you will not find in any other home. A brand new kitchen, island, 48"" stove, custom hood enclosure, walk-in pantry will be the center of attention for all your gatherings. Standing in the kitchen you can look out into the open floor plan and see the opulent living room, dining area and large back yard. Move over to the Master, you will find a large bedroom with fireplace, walk-in closet and an en suite that is meant for the best of the best. On top of the 4 bedrooms 2 full baths and one half bath, anyone working from home will find this separate home office the perfect place to focus and work productively. Don't forget that this incredible property sits on a 8,836 sqft lot and has no neighbors behind. Standing out in the backyard you will find peace and serenity. If that was not enough the location of this property, puts you within walking distance of the best school system in the country, Palos Verdes Peninsula High School and Silver Spur Elementary. With the renovations, the location and the community, this property will not last long on the market.","Composition","All Bedrooms Down, Den, Entry, Kitchen, Living Room, Office, See Remarks, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","Palos Verdes Peninsula","","","Richard","Warren","SWARRRIC","S9298","2","%","Palm Realty Boutique, Inc.","2100000","False","Full Service","Property available to show beginning Friday April 5th. Text 949-212-7468 for showing instructions and questions. Email all offer to chrismark.hm@gmail.com. Buyer to verify all information, permits and sqft. Selling Agent/broker is a member of the LLC that owns the property. Not included in sale: All interior furniture, paintings, personal items, refrigerator, 2 front planter boxes and 3 planters near garage door.","True","None","False","True","2131","Estimate