tched ocean views! A rare opportunity to secure this sunny and inviting single family home with 4 well appointed bedrooms all on one level. Did we mention the views? No clever camera tricks needed here as the property features endless panoramic ocean views from Malibu to the majestic snow-capped mountains. Watch the sunsets and the lights twinkle across the horizon along with the panoramic ocean, coastline, city and mountain views. Enjoy an eat-in functional kitchen with updated appliances and farmhouse sink, or spend time relaxing in the open concept of the living and dining room. Newly finished wood floors throughout with top of the line amenities and finishes. Cozy up to the wood fireplace in the winter and cool off in the summer with air conditioning. Trendy and updated bathrooms, recessed lighting, Nest thermostat, tankless water heater and ceiling fans in bedrooms make this home move-in ready. Spot the Santa Monica Pier, Hollywood Sign, Sofi stadium, and Downtown LA right from the comfort of your new home. Spacious 2-car garage with additional storage space and plenty of unrestricted street parking. The flat grassy backyard is practical for kids to play while picking plums and lemons from the trees in the backyard while the adults take in the unforgettable views. Walking distance to top-rated Silver Spur Elementary School and Pacific Sage Preschool. Located in the popular Grandview Estates, a safe, quiet neighborhood with sidewalks and friendly neighbors. So sit back, sip lemonade from your tree, and watch the grey whales migrate across the bay as the sunsets from your unforgettable new home!","","Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","","","","Rick","Edler","VEDLERIC","V8107","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","2100000","False","Full Service","Please text Anna Perry at (310) 874-9668 to schedule an appointment to show and get the access code.","True","None","False","True",