ll of sliding door to the backyard.  Enjoy cozy evenings by the fireplace in the living room, while having the convenience of a centrally located gourmet kitchen with stainless steel appliances, sleek countertops, and ample storage. The elevated primary suite has a large view window with peekaboo ocean view, a oversized walk-in closet has plenty of space for customization.  The en-suite bathroom is designed with dual vanities and a free-standing oval tub. Two guest bedrooms in the front area are generously sized and versatile, sharing two spacious bathrooms. One bedroom with en-suite bathroom and a secluded loft retreat located at the back.  Powder room next to family room provides convenience and privacy.  The property also offers a 2-car garage with interior access to the house. Located in a highly sought-after Silver Spur neighborhood, this home is just minutes away from Cornerstone Elementary School, Silver Spur Elementary, Ridgecrest and Peninsula High.  Variety of parks and shopping nearby, easy commute to the ocean or down the hills for dining or shopping. Don?t miss your chance to own this gem in one of Southern California's most desirable communities!","","Atrium, Dressing Area, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Retreat, Separate Family Room, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Amie","Schneider","sbabadami","SB1379330","","","Tower-60","2200000","False","Full Service","Supra on front door, go direct. Mingli: 310-293-0250.","","","","","2658","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Clint","","5930","Place","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, Submit","","24423","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=YYCBsAujdUd","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=YYCBsAujdUd","","1960","90275","2101","RPRS8000*"
