e hall you will find a full bathroom, to the right you will find the first bedroom just off of the living room with a fireplace and sliding door leading to a deck, adjacent to the living room you will find the updated kitchen as you continue through the kitchen you will find a full bathroom to the right and the 2nd bedroom. There is a partially finished basement that is used as a workshop. Outside of the workshop is the backyard perfect for an intimate gathering. This home boasts tankless water heaters, owned solar with 2 Tesla Powerwall batteries, dual pane windows, recessed lighting, central HVAC and much more. This is a MUST SEE and will not last long!!!","Spanish Tile","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","OUT OF","AREA","irecp","RECP","2.5","%","OUT OF AREA","2275000","False","Full Service","Please Note: Minimum Two hour notice required for all showings. Property is available for showings on week days after 5:00 PM. Property is generally available for showing anytime Fridays and Saturdays. DO NOT VISIT THE PROPERTY WITHOUT NOTICE OR APPOINTMENT. There are dogs and cats on the property that will have to be put away for the showing. Please text Ray with a picture of your business card, day and time you would like to show the property to Ray Ortiz, 714-488-5452 and we will get you in there. Do not use Showing Time. Email offers on a CAR RPA or RIPA including the POF to offers@gsstrategiesre.com. For questions regarding the Partition Referee or transaction please call or text john at 909-228-5255.","","None","False","","3550","See Remarks","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Montemalaga","","6055","Drive","","Modern","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, Subject To Court","","31394","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Hills, Neighborhood","True","https://1-sv.aryeo.com/sites/ygg