e, Paved, Driveway Level, Garage, Garage - Single Door, Private, RV Potential, Side by Side","True","Covered, Enclosed, See Remarks","True","29","","None","False","Negotiable","1035.1","Did you say you wanted a panoramic view?  Check.  Unobstructable?  Check.  One level house?  Check.  Large lot?  Check.  Quiet street?  Check.  Walk to schools?  Check.  This one level home features a sit-down, panoramic, unobstructable view from Pt Dume to Long Beach and is for sale for the first time since 1958.  As is often the case with panoramic views, the pictures do not do it justice.  From the updated kitchen and baths, to the low traffic street (if they're driving on Bluemound, they either live there or are lost), to the huge back yard, to the easy walk to schools, this lovely home was meticulously maintained by the owner of 66 years and is ready for the next family to make it their own.  The original 4 bedroom floor plan is still there and can easily be restored.  The high ceilings throughout give a spacious feel.  The enclosed rear patio feels like part of the house, is light and open, and features the absolutely stunning view.  The rear slope includes a switchback path to the bottom and offers endless opportunities, besides protecting the view from any obstruction.","Composition","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, See Remarks, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Edward","Kaminsky","SKAMIEDW","SB1327500","2.5","%","eXp Realty of California, Inc","2300000","False","Full Service","No show till broker's open Tuesday, 3/26.  After that, just go. Please do not use Showing Time. Supra on door to right of the front door.  We will look at offers end of day Saturday, 3/30.","True","None","False","True","2222","Taped","","CA","Closed","One","","","Bluemound","","5159","Road","","Traditional","Conventional","","21271","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Ava