lass and sophistication with a warm family home feel along with excellent overall design and flow. The entertaining open floorplan leads directly into the kitchen and family room. The home offers natural ambient light throughout. The living areas are adorned beautifully and adjusts to any lifestyle from the family/kids play-hang out area to the jet-setter entertainment space. The bedrooms are all ample in size. Take notice of the two en-suites. Both offer outdoor seating, the primary bedroom opens to the rear yard and of course the majestic views. The kitchen is conveniently stationed at the center of the home and offers a double oven, plenty of cabinet/storage space along with a newer Bosch dishwasher. Take notice of the newer ceiling fans, lighting, tankless water heater, primary bath remodel, drywall and insulation throughout, and a quiet garage door motor. Additional upgrades and features include newer interior paint and new landscaping, central vacuum system, attic space with pull-down access ladder, newer pavers, large capacity mailbox, the living room addition included 6 caissons, 8 mature fruit trees surround the property. The spacious rear yard offers plenty of room to entertain or simply enjoying a game of catch all while soaking in the spectacular views. Located within walking distance to Peninsula High School and Peninsula Center, this home offers an unbeatable blend of comfort, style and convenience. Whether you're entertaining guests or enjoying a quiet night in, this home is an absolute GEM and a must see !!!","","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Retreat","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","DeDe","Hsu","PVDELIHSU","V7946","","","Estate Properties","2312000","False","Full Service","Easy to show. Cat may be on property please close all doors/sliders behind you. Please allow 2hrs notice and knock first as the seller may be home