m and stairwell. The open-concept layout blends kitchen and dining for effortless entertaining. The kitchen is beautifully refreshed with refinished cabinetry featuring new doors and hardware, a large center island, quartz countertops, glass tile backsplash and premium appliances including a Sub-Zero refrigerator, Thermador cooktop, Monogram double oven with warming drawer and Bosch dishwasher. The adjacent living/bar area has matching quartz counters and cabinetry, plus a 10-foot Milgard sliding glass door that opens to the view. Upstairs, the primary suite is a true retreat with a fireplace, cedar-lined closets, walk-in closet and a private view balcony with a glass railing and sliding door. The spa-like primary bath features dual walk-in showers with rainfall heads, double sinks and a backlit mirror with LED lighting and built-in Bluetooth speaker, plus all-new plumbing. Outside, the upgrades continue: Trex decking, a striking 65-foot glass fence, new hardscape in the yard and driveway and an expanded driveway designed to accommodate a boat or RV. Pet lovers will appreciate the pet-friendly artificial grass, a fenced dog run, and additional enclosed outdoor space just off the kitchen?perfect for easy everyday living. Additional highlights include newer double-paned Milgard windows, separate HVAC for upstairs/downstairs with Nest thermostats, upgraded PVC drainage and plumbing to the main line, an electric panel in the garage with easy potential for EV charging and new redwood fences along both sides of the property. Because the home faces west, the backyard is especially enjoyable in the afternoon while the house and yard stay cooler in the summer, all just minutes from the top-of-the-hill shopping and dining.","","Bonus Room, Family Room, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Danielle","Mortensen","CLW-C136037","CLW-X7898404","","","eXp Realty of California Inc","2358615","False","Full Service","Text agent Cari Corbalis for showing appoin