"","0.2591","No blind offers will be entertained. Garage is attached but has no direct access to the home.  NOTE: Realist tax data show 2 bedroom, 1 bath & 807 square feet. Great room, laundry room, flex room & workshop Sq. Ft. was taped for the floorplan rendering used by listing agent for marketing purpose only & is approximate.  The Sq.Ft.is an estimate and has not been verified by agent or seller. There are several different ways to determine the square footage of rooms in a home.  Buyer to hire appropriate specialists to verify square footage and condition of home & all other aspects of the home during buyers investigations to satisfy themselves.    The additional rooms listed above were already there when owner took possession of property.   These rooms were added WITHOUT permit.  multiple offers were received within days of listing & an offer was accepted for $1,150,000. The Property appraised at value.  Escrow fell out of escrow due to the buyer could not add 3 bedrooms in  due to strict State & Insurance matters for assisted living.  The Buyer had an inspection performed & a lot of repairs need to be done.  Seller had a termite report prepared on 1/18/2024.  The estimate is $14,539 with several areas noted with ""subject to further inspection"". With the knowledge of the repairs needed along with the termite inspection report, seller has reduced the property almost $125,000 from the appraised value.  Property is being sold in its AS IS condition.","Disposal, Microwave, Refrigerator","True","177 - Eastview/RPV","Unknown","True","7557029007","","0","","False","1","","","","1","2","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Pager Ph","Agent Fax","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Email","None","False","Los Angeles","46","1000000","#ERR","01/26/2024 3:42:10 PM","","03/07/2024 2:00:10 PM","03/12/2024 12:00:00 AM","04/16/2024 10:59:41 AM","","","01/26/2024 12:00:00 AM",