om which is ideal for an office, library, hobby room or?  The Great Room has custom wood and glass accordion doors that open outdoors to a large deck which over looks a private and lushly landscaped backyard which is a beautiful garden oasis complete with mature avocado tree, fig tree, spacious lawn and brick walkways.  The deck off the Great Room wraps around to a large enclosed workshop ideal for the hobbyist to use for a myriad of projects.  Tucked away on a less traveled cul-de-sac in the desirable Eastview area in RPV where there is an option for children to attend the Palos Verdes School  district or LAUSD.  Centrally located and close to shops, restaurants, Trader Joe?s, movie theater, banks, gas stations and minutes away from the 110 freeway.","","Bonus Room, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, See Remarks, Workshop","","Palos Verdes / LAUSD ? inquire","","","","","Riley","Eastman","SBEASTRIL","sb1350760","2.5","%","Compass","1000000","False","Full Service","DO NOT USE MLS TO SCHEDULE SHOWING.   TO SHOW: DUE TO LARGE DOGS, DO NOT ENTER PROPERTY WITHOUT CONFIRMATION FROM THE LISTING AGENT.  FOR ALL SHOWINGS TEXT THE LISTING AGENT SHARI B WITH YOUR NAME, DRE # AND DATE AND TIME YOU WANT TO SHOW AND WAIT FOR A REPLY.   THANK YOU FOR YOUR COOPERATION.","True","None","False","True","807","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Homeworth","","1855","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","16010","","Single Family Residence","","Sewer Connected","Peek-A-Boo","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/457104","","","1950","90275","2025","RPRS-4*"
