wo generously sized closets and an ensuite bathroom complete with a shower. This property is equipped with a 220V electrical setup, suitable for outdoor appliances or EV charging. The home also features a two-car garage secured behind gates, providing both privacy and peace of mind. Located just minutes away from shops, restaurants, and the beach, this property is in the prestigious PVPUSD School District. Embrace the full potential of this property, creating the home of your dreams in this sought-after community. Don?t miss out on this rare hidden gem?seize the opportunity today! Square footage is approximate. Buyers to verify all details, including permits and condition, with professionals. Call for more info.","","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Ruibin","Zhang","SBZHANRUI","sb1376790","","","Circa Properties, Inc","1140000","False","Full Service","Shown by appointment only. 24 hour advanced notice is required. Dogs on premises but will be removed for scheduled showings","False","None","False","True","1690","Estimated","","CA","Closed","One","","","Caddington","","1971","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Contract, Conventional, Submit","","21184","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Neighborhood, Peek-A-Boo","True","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lU-xkUjEWtE","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lU-xkUjEWtE","Shutters","1956","90275","2040","RPRS-4*"
