the exterior front entryway of the house. The northeast bedroom also has an extended walk-in closet. The driveway, garage, front yard, most of the rear yard, and the house are conveniently flat for older occupants/visitors and toddlers. A Jacuzzi is located at the south edge of the rear yard with an easterly view. While the view is already abundant, a future second story modification could enhance the view and the resulting market value. The house has a 2-car garage and space for two additional vehicles, and Bernice Drive normally has plenty of convenient street parking for visitors. Schools, Parks, Shopping Centers, and plenty of Restaurants are nearby. There is a warm fireplace near the Dining Area just south of the Living Room.","Flat, Mixed, Shingle","All Bedrooms Down, Kitchen, Living Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes / LAUSD ? inquire","Dapplegray","","Miraleste","","Laura","Zinniger","SSOCHLAU","s4331","2.5","See Remarks","Century 21 Union Realty","1200000","False","Full Service","No Showings until after the Sunday, April 21, 2024, Public Open House (12:30 to 4:30pm), thereafter by ADVANCE appointment ONLY. Owner prefers 24 hour notice, but minimum 4 hour advance notice may work. Avoid Tuesday and Thursday appointments. (See Supplements for a rough/simplified floor-plan with set backs)","True","Above Ground, No Permits, See Remarks","True","True","1753","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Bernice","","29608","Drive","","Mid Century Modern","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","16726","","Single Family Residence","","Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Harbor, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic, See Remarks","True","","","Screens","1955","90275","1319","RPRS-4*"
