signed for both relaxation and entertaining, offering abundant natural light from windows located in the high-pitched front wall.  A gorgeous, wood burning stacked stone fireplace awaits you in the living room.  Each bedroom is a tranquil retreat, with custom closets, providing comfort and privacy for family and guests. Outside, the property truly shines. A private, elevated, and fenced yard ensures serenity and seclusion, shielded from neighbors and the street. The backyard is a personal sanctuary featuring a bubbling fountain and meticulously designed hardscape and landscape and is perfect for unwinding or hosting gatherings under the shade of a pepper tree. Pet lovers will appreciate the custom Catio, thoughtfully crafted to keep your feline companions safe while they enjoy the outdoors. Situated just minutes from top-rated Palos Verdes schools, shopping, parks, and miles of hiking trails, this home offers privacy, comfort, and convenience. Don't miss your chance to own this exquisite property?schedule your showing today!","","All Bedrooms Down, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Suzy","Palumbo","CLW-C141136","CLW-X7688901","","","Douglas Elliman of California, Inc.","1237650","False","Full Service","Please call or text me with a copy of your business card and I will send you the combo.","True","None","False","True","1367","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","W","","General","","2133","Street","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","16726","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Harbor","True","","","","1955","90275","1323","RPRS-4*"
"","0.5738","WHOLESALERS STAY AWAY, WE ARE NOT INTERESTED AND WILL NOT RESPOND TO YOUR OFFERS. PROPERTY WILL QUALIFY FOR CONVENTIONAL FINANCING BUT NOT VA OR FHA, SORRY. OFFERS DUE AT 6:00 PM, JULY 14TH. SUBMIT YOUR CLIENT'S HIGHEST AND BEST AS THERE MOST LIKELY WILL NOT BE A MULTIPLE COUNTER.This is a trust sale being sold in its present condition, seller will not make any repairs. Submit complete offer package with Trust Advisory to gary@sellnsp.com.","Dishwasher, Double Oven, Gas Oven, Gas Cooktop, Range Hood","True","177 - Eastview/RPV","Unknown","True","7552016005","","0","","False","2","","","1","1","4","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Offers Email","","","","","None","False","Los Angeles","14","1238500","#ERR","07/01/2025 3:44:50 PM","","","07/16/2025 12:00:00 AM","08/06/2025 12:13:48 PM","07/18/2025 12:00:00 AM","","07/01/2025 12:00:00 AM","07/16/2025 12:00:00 AM","07/02/2025 11:56:54 AM","08/06/2025 12:00:00 AM","08/06/2025 12:00:00 AM","","East","14","","True","Area","","","Chain Link, Vinyl","True","","Conventional","Living Room","True","Carpet, Tile, Vinyl","True","Central, Forced Air","True","","True","True","Front Door","Supra","False","","","","33.765152","In Garage","True","False","","","1199000","","","1199000","#ERR","310-732-1202","","gary@sellnsp.com","310-832-7682","Gary","310-519-8422","","Krill","","SKRILGAR","","","","","SB1350760","","Compass","310-241-3038","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.318082","","88","24995","Back Yard, Front Yard, Landscaped, Lot 20000-39999 Sqft, Yard","Biking , Curbs, Dog Park, Fishing, Foothills, Golf, Park, Watersports, Sidewalks","","Assessor","","","SB25138785","","2","8","","1","Vacant","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Garage, RV Access/Parking, See Remarks","True","","","44","","Private, In Ground","True","Close Of Escrow","664.43","LOCATION, LOCATION, LOCATION! That has been the adage about how to buy real estate since the beginning of time and it still holds true today. Buy the home that needs work in a great location and turn it into the home of your dreams. Well, here's your opportunity. This one-level pool home is sits on a lot that totals just under 25,000 sq ft and it's located on a flat and quiet cul-de-sac made up of only 13 homes. That means no through traffic and no noise except for the birds chirping in the trees that line the South side of the property. The home itself is the popular U-shaped plan and it's mostly original. You can do a bare-minimum cosmetic upgrade with flooring, paint, fixtures and appliances and do the rest over time OR you can do a major remodel now, your choice. The swimming pool is not what you see going into homes today, small and shallow. This pool is a massive resort size with a 12 foot deep end (buyer to verify) and room for al the family, friends and whoever else you want to invite to the pool party. There's a large patio area around the pool and a big side yard on the South side of the property that can be improved to accommodate an outdoor kitchen, kids playground or a parking area for all your weekend toys and/or RV. Best of all, the rear yard is totally private thanks to the mature trees and shrubs on the hillside. The home is built around a center courtyard that makes another great place to relax or it can be incorporated into the remodel to become additional living space. Two car attached garage with direct access houses the laundry facilities and the extra wide driveway can handle at least six vehicles and provides easy access to the RV parking pad if you choose to go that route. Don't forget that you also get the option to attend the highly regarded Palos Verdes Unified schools with this home. This is a chance to get into a unique property that has not been on the market since 1967. DON'T MISS IT!!","Composition, Shingle","Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Sep","Ebrahimi","pvebrasep","V7804","","","Berkshire Hathaway HomeService","1238500","False","Full Service","Submit request through the Showingtime link in the listing. CBS code will be in the confirmation. Please be sure to turn off lights and lock all doors. Thanks for showing and good luck!","True","None","False","","1864","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Alaflora","","27909","Drive","","Modern","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","24543","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=WCvUtPubs44&brand=0","","","1959","90275","1211","RPRS-4*"
