nstairs impresses with a contemporary above-counter sink. Durable vinyl, tile, and engineered wood flooring extend throughout the living spaces, and the 2-car garage, with direct access, further enhances functionality by featuring a washing machine paired with a small pedestal washer and two 240-amp electrical vehicle plugs. An expansive driveway provides ample space for gated RV or boat parking, and the inclusion of a 200-amp electrical panel alongside a LifeSource water filtration system for the entire house underscores the exceptional efficiency and convenience of this remarkable property. Situated in the highly acclaimed Palos Verdes School District, this home is an incredible opportunity in a prime location. 28630 Mount Shasta Drive is more than just a home; it?s a lifestyle.","","All Bedrooms Up, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Justin","Capizzi","SCAPIJUS","OC03224","","","eXp Realty of California Inc","1275000","False","Full Service","No showings until open house on February 4, 2025 from 12pm-2pm. Offers due Tuesday, February 11th by 11:00am. Flyer with features in supplements section of MLS. At least 4 hour notice for all showings. Please call ShowingTime at (800) 746-9464 or click the ShowingTime link in the MLS to schedule an appointment and to obtain a CBS code for the Supra. In an offer, please put ""Jennifer A. Klain Family Trust"" as the Seller, and ""Keller Williams Realty L.A. Harbor"" as Listing Agent's office.","True","Private, Heated","True","","1768","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Mount Shasta","","28630","Drive","","","1031 Exchange, Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, Fannie Mae, FHA, Freddie Mac, Government Loan, Submit, VA Loan","","30657","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","None","False","https://my.homediary.com/u/478053","https://video214.com/play/pg2Y7Qv1ZH0O4q0I