nd a charming front breakfast nook with a bay window. Two bedrooms open directly to the backyard through sliding glass doors, creating an easy indoor-outdoor connection to the pool and backyard. The bathrooms have been beautifully renovated, featuring custom vanities, updated plumbing, modern fixtures, and refined finishes that add a polished, spa-like feel. Thoughtful upgrades throughout the home include dual-pane windows and doors, central heating and air conditioning, copper plumbing, smooth ceilings, recessed lighting, ceiling fans & custom closet doors in the bedrooms, and an upgraded electrical panel, enhancing comfort, efficiency, and everyday livability. Refinished hardwood floors, a refaced fireplace with solid wood beam mantle, updated HVAC ducting, and in-wall AV conduit further elevate the interior. The exceptional lot configuration truly sets this property apart, with wide side yards on both sides of the home. The west side features a gated drive with ample off-street parking, ideal for a boat, trailer, or additional cars, while the east side offers open, usable space?perfect for expanded yard area, garden, play space, or future addition. A large, grassy front yard adds to the sense of openness and curb appeal, creating multiple outdoor zones. The home and detached two-car garage are connected by a covered atrium, adding architectural interest, privacy, and a seamless transition between indoor and outdoor living. Additional improvements include a newer roof, rebuilt chimney, perimeter fencing with pool and side gates, smart thermostat, and Ring security system with cameras. Located within the award-winning Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District option, this home offers a rare combination of substantial land, thoughtful upgrades, and long-term flexibility in a highly desirable Eastview location.","","Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes / LAUSD ? inquire","","","","","Erik","Lim","CLW-C143284","CLW-X8257519","","","Hollywood Estates","1310000","Fals