highly desirable City of Rancho Palos Verdes has it all?a wonderful sense of indoor/outdoor living, great floorplan &tremendous natural light. House is positioned near the front of a large 10,550 sq. ft. lot at the end of the cul de sac in order to provide maximum enjoyment of the fully perimetered very private backyard w/ expansive grassy lawn, spacious patio, pool & huge side yard?plenty of room for entertaining, family gatherings or kids to play as well as great potential for gardening, pet enclosures or added play space in the large currently unused side yard.  The house takes full advantage of the wonderful floorplan which provides an L shaped indoor/outdoor flow.  Multiple French doors provide tremendous natural light as well as direct access to patio 7yard from living &family rooms w/ further access from the 4th bedroom/office?a setup great for entertaining &family enjoyment of the property.  Numerous recent upgrades enhance one?s enjoyment of this quiet haven from fresh paint inside &outside to beautifully refinished floors to new heating &air conditioning systems to new wood fence to new oven &cooktop to new pool pump &filter. The heart of the home is the family room/kitchen/breakfast nook w/ light streaming in from 2 sides of the house onto the glowing wood floors & with easy egress into the lush green lawn or tile patio or the ability to continue on into the living room w/ fireplace & more doors to the outside. The functional kitchen w/ corian like counters overlooks the family room & breakfast nook and guarantees that the cook of the house is not boxed in a corner & has a pleasant experience with the new oven and cooktop.  Throughout the house are the beautiful glowing floors as well as ceiling fans to maximize the comfort from the new air conditioning.  The bedroom wing is very private with a primary suite that has its own bath as well as 3 more bedrooms that share a full bath.  The fourth bedroom with its door to the outside patio would make a great office/den.  The 2 car garage offers the convenience of direct access to the kitchen making grocery shopping more pleasant.  And this world apart retreat is just an easy drive to shopping, restaurants, abundant recreational facilities & major freeways plus children are eligible to attend the award winning Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District!","","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes / LAUSD ? inquire","","","","","Sheila-Anne","Teisher","vteisshe","V7186","2.5","%","RE/MAX Estate Properties","1334500","False","Full Service","NO SHOWING TIME","True","None","False","","1790","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Alvesta","","27600","Place","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","24436","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Pool, See Remarks","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/467111","","Blinds, Garden Window(s), Wood Frames","1960","90275","1019","RPRS-4*"
