anicured lawn, colorful flowers and an inviting courtyard all before you get to the front door! A soaring stacked stone entry frames a gorgeous distressed wood door with sidelights and iron accents. Vaulted ceilings and lots of sunlight greet you when you step into the home, and you see living space in every direction.  Step down into a spacious living room anchored by a cozy fireplace ? the perfect setting for your holiday entertaining!   The kitchen has been updated with Kraftmaid cabinets and quartz countertops and a colorful tile backsplash that releases the ?joie de vivre? of your inner gourmet! The breakfast counter is a great place to start your day, and the adjoining family room is a great gathering place to reconvene and enjoy the evening. There are also two bedrooms and a full bath on this main level, great for multi-generational living,  At the top of the stairs, beyond double doors, is a spacious master suite with plenty of room for your king-size bed as well as a sitting area, a walk-in closet with organizers and two additional closet spaces. There is an additional bedroom as well as a loft area that is a perfect playroom or home office space. If you like to entertain, the back yard is sure to impress! Hang out on the large patio area, or lounge around the bar complete with fridge, cooler and beer tap. There is also a large deck area bordered by a mosaic tile wall which adds some fun and visual interest to the space. A landscaped hillside offers shade and privacy to the yard. As an added bonus, there is a separate office/studio/game room with AC ? a great separate space if you are working from home.  This home offers a direct access 2 car garage, central AC, dual pane windows, and a solar power agreement that significantly reduces your electric bill!  The location can?t be beat, with super easy access to stores, major streets, the freeway and the bridge, and the option to attend top rated Palos Verdes schools!","","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Ro