ccess from the kitchen service door. Outside, the large 9281 square foot lot provides ample space for outdoor enjoyment, complete with an in-ground heated pool and a thrilling water slide. The cape cod wooden siding adds to the home's coastal charm, creating a serene and inviting atmosphere. Also features a covered patio with a brick BBQ pit perfect for entertaining and outdoor cooking! Recent upgrades include a newer central air conditioner and forced air gas furnace, newer water heater and brand new ceilings fans in all three bedrooms and vertical window treatments in all windows and front and backyard sprinkler timer. With a large covered carport, this property offers both convenience and functionality with RV, Boat or Camper room to park in the newer pavers driveway! Boasting a total of 1507 square feet, this move-in-ready home presents a great opportunity to live in the coveted Coastal Eastview neighborhood of Rancho Palos Verdes. Conveniently located near local restaurants, shopping, and the South Shores coast, this home offers a perfect blend of tranquility and accessibility. Close to Crestwood Street Elementary & Dodson Middle School in the award winning Palos Verdes Unified School District! Don't miss out on the chance to make this Rancho Palos Verdes gem your own. Schedule a showing today and experience the coastal lifestyle you've been dreaming of!","Composition, Shingle","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Formal Entry, Great Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Crestwood","Peninsula","Dodson","","Rob","McGarry","SBMCGAROB","S1278850","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","1350000","False","Full Service","Vacant, Go Direct, Supra located on front door.  Please leave your business card, turn off lights, close/lock ALL doors and return key to SUPRA lockbox before you leave the property.","True","None","False","True","1507","Assess