ay and a beautiful entry with a gorgeous leaded glass/wood door. This home offers wide open living spaces no matter which direction you go. A spacious living room is anchored by a beautifully tiled fireplace and floor to ceiling windows.  The kitchen has been completely remodeled and expanded with new cabinetry and granite counters and includes a spacious ?butler?s pantry? for extra storage, coffee bar or buffet space. Adjacent to the kitchen is a dining and family room area which is perfect for entertaining and keeping an eye on the kids.  A powder room is conveniently located nearby to accommodate your guests. Down the hall you will find 4 bedrooms including a spacious master with a remodeled en-suite 3/4 bath. The 4th bedroom has an exterior entrance and would be a perfect home office! The main hall bath has also been renovated with a dual sink vanity with added storage. The tile work in both bathrooms is stunning. This home is built around a central courtyard that been enclosed to provide a sunroom or entertaining space including epoxy floors and telescoping doors to bring the outside in! There is also a large flat private backyard for pets and play, and several fruit trees too. This home has many updates including custom window coverings, dual-pane windows and doors, LED recessed lights throughout, 200 amp electric panel, central heat/air, a large Tuff Shed for added storage, and a direct access 2 car garage with storage shelving. The 4 flat screen TVs you see are also included! This home was substantially remodeled in 2018 and is turnkey. Stores, schools and thoroughfares are easily accessible (yet  this is far above Western -you don?t even know it?s there!). The icing on the cake is the option to attend top rates Palos Verdes schools! This is the perfect home to start your new year right!","","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes / LAUSD ? inquire","Dapplegray","Pen