ooring, a natural stone fireplace, and soaring vaulted ceilings. The expansive primary suite includes dual closets with custom cabinetry. Complete with a limestone stand-up shower, double sinks, and a quartz vanity. A generous junior suite with its own private bath, along with two additional bedrooms and a full guest bath, provide ample space for family and guests. The serene, private backyard is a true retreat, featuring a well-maintained pool, a spacious patio area, and a lush grassy yard?ideal for outdoor relaxation and entertaining. Additional highlights include dual-pane windows, plush carpeting in the bedrooms, and an attached 2-car garage with laundry facilities. Ideally located near top-rated Palos Verdes schools, this home provides the perfect blend of style, comfort, and convenience.","","Den, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Multi-Level Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Marianna","Smith","SBSMIMARI","SB1293130","","","Redfin Corporation","1400000","False","Full Service","Contact Listing Agent Joseph Nwabuzor (310) 989-0997","True","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","","2100","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Mount Rainier","","1218","Road","","Contemporary","Contract","","30657","","Single Family Residence","","","Bridge(s), Peek-A-Boo, Pool","True","https://vimeo.com/1050938248","","Blinds, Double Pane Windows, Screens, Shutters","1973","90275","1912","RPRS-4*"
