 The moment you enter the redwood gate, you are greeted by a professionally manicured lush landscape. The house and curated garden offer the perfect indoor-outdoor South Bay lifestyle, and have been showcased in several photo shoots over the years. Open the La Cantina glass folding doors to let the outdoors in for the ultimate open-concept dining and living experience. The ""Ipe"" wood deck or beautiful flagstone patio are the perfect places to soak up the sunshine then rinse off in the outdoor shower. There is direct garden access outside 3 of the 4 bedrooms and you can enjoy avocado, citrus, pomegranate and persimmon trees that offer a bounty throughout the year and herbs that are ready to be picked for your summer barbecues. This oasis offers the  perfect ""work from home"" environment or creative space that you will never want to leave. Sunlight streams in through the windows and offers an abundance of natural lighting that creates a warm and inviting atmosphere and there are peekaboo views of the LA Harbor and coastline outside the east facing windows. Enjoy your morning coffee in the peaceful backyard sanctuary next to the bubbling fountain and under the Bougainvillea tree which blooms almost year round. The concrete fire pits offer the perfect ambiance for relaxing with a glass of wine after a busy day or hosting gatherings under the stars. Inside, during the cooler winter months, you can cozy up next to the wood burning fireplace. This wonderful home is minutes away from top rated Palos Verdes schools, easy freeway access, miles of hiking trails along the peninsula, shopping, restaurants, beaches and so much more. With it's classic design, natural beauty and relaxed vibe, this well loved home captures the essence of So Cal living.","Composition","All Bedrooms Down","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Matthew","Engle","PVENGLMAT","v8491","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","1401865","False","Full Service","** OFFER DEADLINE ** Please sub