y gatherings and entertaining friends, seamlessly flows into the inviting family room. The family room is highlighted by vaulted wood beam ceilings, another brick fireplace, and a custom bar, with plenty of windows allowing for an abundance of natural light and creating a warm atmosphere. The expansive sliding glass door grants access to the backyard oasis which is an entertainer's dream, complete with an in-ground spa, covered patio, and an ample grassy area. The beautifully manicured hillside, filled with trees and greenery, gives the outdoor space a park-like ambiance. The attached garage offers not only convenient parking but is also equipped with a 1,500-pound hydraulic motorcycle lift mounted in the garage floor. Plus, you'll have peace of mind with the 22KW Generac backup generator and automatic switching station, ensuring you will never be left in the dark. Additional features include a powerful 5-ton AC unit, brand new copper plumbing throughout, a new 1-inch copper main water supply, a new 50-gallon water heater, and a new gas line for the spa equipment. This home is located just minutes away from shops, restaurants, and beautiful nearby beaches. And to top it off, this home is also in the prestigious Palos Verdes Peninsula school district. Embrace the opportunity to make this house your own, tailoring every detail to your preference and style. Don?t miss out on this exceptional property!","","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Dapplegray","Peninsula","Miraleste","","Maria","Lauro","SBLAURMAR","S4726","2","%","Keller Williams Realty","1415000","False","Full Service","Call agent to schedule a showing. First showing will be 6/15/24.","True","Heated, In Ground","True","True","2188","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Pontevedra","","27837","Drive","","","Submit","","24543","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","","","","1959","90275","1233","RPRS-4*"
