 after area of Eastview in Rancho Palos Verdes.  This beautiful home boasts a great floorplan with spacious living room and dining/family room leading through the sliding doors to the spectacular resort-like back yard with a sparkling swimming pool, plenty of patio space, and a fire pit. The feeling of indoor/outdoor living is obvious? while you prepare family meals, you can watch the children play in the backyard. The private bedroom wing offers a primary suite that has its own bathroom as well as three additional bedrooms that share a full bathroom. The fourth bedroom that has a door to the outside patio could be used as an office or guestroom. This gem has modern updates throughout, including kitchen and coffee bar, bathrooms, electrical and pool equipment, a perfect blend of tranquility and convenience.  A true delight - Award winning Palos Verdes schools and easy access to shopping, fitness center, dining and movie theater, 110 Fwy, upcoming massive Waterfront Project at Port of LA makes this a winner. This home is move-in ready! Be the first to be impressed!","Composition","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room","","Palos Verdes / LAUSD ? inquire","Dapplegray","Peninsula","Miraleste","","Becky","Poe-Anderson","VPOEABEC","V7946","","","RE/MAX Estate Properties","1425000","False","Full Service","DO NOT GO DIRECT!!!  Call/Text Haley at 310-415 4351 for appointments. Thank you for showing! NO SHOWING TIME!!!  Agents, we do have a deadline as of Wednesday 7/31/24 at 5pm.","True","None","False","True","1790","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Avenida Feliciano","","2021","","","Modern","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","24436","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Neighborhood, Pool","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=XqFEot3c7Ti&brand=0","","Double Pane Windows","1961","90275","1008","RPRS-4*"
