windows. The spacious, modern kitchen is equipped with sleek quartz countertops, stainless steel appliances, and custom cabinetry, providing both beauty and functionality for everyday living and entertaining. Hardwood floors throughout the main living areas enhance the warm, contemporary feel of the home. Upstairs, the master suite serves as a peaceful retreat, showcasing stunning views of the harbor and surrounding hills, along with a beautifully updated en-suite bathroom with a modern vanity and a walk-in shower. Each of the additional bedrooms offers generous space, large closets, and modern finishes, making the home perfect for families or anyone needing extra space for guests or a home office. The additional bathrooms have also been fully updated with sleek tiles, modern vanities, and high-end fixtures.  The outdoor space of this home is just as impressive, with the expansive backyard offering endless possibilities for outdoor living, whether you envision a tranquil garden, a spacious entertainment area, or even a custom pool. The corner lot provides a sense of privacy and space, making it ideal for relaxation and entertaining alike.  Located in a peaceful neighborhood with top-rated schools, parks, and easy access to shopping, dining, and entertainment options, this home provides both serenity and convenience. For those who enjoy outdoor activities, the surrounding area is filled with scenic parks, hiking trails, and recreational opportunities. Plus, it offers convenient access to major highways, making commuting a breeze while still enjoying the quiet ambiance of Rancho Palos Verdes. This fully renovated home is truly move-in ready and offers a rare opportunity to own a piece of luxury with incredible harbor views, modern updates, and a prime location. The spacious two-car garage and additional driveway parking ensure that you have ample space for vehicles. This home combines timeless elegance with modern comforts, making it the perfect sanctuary for its next owners. Don't miss your chance to own this beautifully upgraded home in one of the most desirable locations in Rancho Palos Verdes.","","Entry, Family Room","","","","","","CLW-103012103","Tamer","Makeen","SMAKETAM","SB1323040","","","DOMO Real Estate","1450000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: For showings, please contact Agent 1 directly via call or text. Kindly note that no showings will be available prior to the first open house on Friday Showing Information: Call LA 2 ","False","None","False","","2106","","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Eldena","","27630","Drive","","","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Harbor","True","","","","1963","90275","1023","RPRS-4*"
