s are beautiful!  Gleaming hardwood floors. Side sitting area off of formal living room can be set up as a dining room, or for an office.  That space also has potential to add a wall for a small 4th bedroom. Newer redwood deck enjoys the same sweeping views. There is a BBQ area adjacent to the deck and the kitchen.  It has built in gas bbq as well as a separate Weber Charcoal Grill. Family/Media room is just off the kitchen, high ceilings, perfect for popcorn and movies, or hosting that Super Bowl party. Great mid century kitchen with lots of cabinets and storage, and granite counter tops for a chef, or even 2 chefs! Private and lush backyard is divided into two spaces. One side for lounging, and a dog run. The other side is perfect for kids play equipment or a vegetable garden. There is more space for a children's play area, or a vegetable garden, and possibly room to add a pool. New fencing and drought tolerant landscaping surrounding the curb side of the property. Oversized garage is 21' x 33', over 600 sft! 2 cars plus your own 200 sqft workshop or storage area. Have a jet ski or a quad runner to store?  Laundry area is in the garage with a sink and folding counter, too! Master bedroom has 2 wardrobe closets and an ensuite 3/4 bath. The roof is approx 2 yrs old, and inside reveals beautiful vaulted wood ceilings in most of the home.  Air conditioning. Optional school zone - Palos Verdes or LA Unified (inquire at PVUSD). UPDATE: PVUSD has approved the use of a grandparents address to permit attendance at PVUSD schools.","Composition","Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Suite, See Remarks, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes / LAUSD ? inquire","","","","","Fred","DiBernardo","SDIBEFRE","SB1353620","","","Fred DiBernardo","1480000","False","Full Service","DO NOT USE SHOWING TIME. Call or text Cheryl for an appt to show. 310-488-6359.  She will arrange to take the dogs out.  Do Not Go Direct.  Spa and canopy are negotiable.","True","","","True","2148","Assessor","","C