"","0.2443","See floor plan in supplements - actual square footage is approx. 2000 sq ft.  We believe the dining room area may have been an enclosed patio at one time, but has been this way since current owner purchased it.  Seller requests 30-45 day escrow and will need a rent back to early September to ready their new home (already purchased) for move-in.","Dishwasher, Disposal, Gas Range, Microwave","True","177 - Eastview/RPV","Unknown","True","7550011036","","0","","False","2","","","1","1","3","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Fax","Agent Email","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","9","1510000","#ERR","07/10/2023 11:12:59 PM","","","07/19/2023 12:00:00 AM","09/06/2023 2:00:16 PM","","","07/10/2023 12:00:00 AM","07/19/2023 12:00:00 AM","07/10/2023 11:14:42 PM","09/06/2023 12:00:00 AM","09/06/2023 12:00:00 AM","","South","9","","True","Dining Room","","","","","","Conventional","Living Room, Gas Starter","True","Carpet, Laminate, Tile","True","Central","True","Cathedral Ceiling(s), Ceiling Fan(s), Copper Plumbing Full, High Ceilings, Quartz Counters, Recessed Lighting","True","True","NONE","None","False","","","","33.75695","Individual Room","True","False","","","1369000","Refrigerator, wine fridge, washer/dryer, ring cameras","","1369000","#ERR","310-707-2186","","karen@prestigeteamhomes.com","310-519-9980","Karen","","","Anderson","","VANDEKAR","","","","","v8460","","Keller Williams Realty","310-519-1080","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.317685","","11","10642","0-1 Unit/Acre, Back Yard, Sloped Down, Front Yard, Lot 10000-19999 Sqft, Sprinkler System, Yard","Curbs, Sidewalks","","Assessor","","","PV23123631","","2","4","1","1","Owner","","","","","Driveway, Concrete, Garage, Garage Faces Front, Garage - Two Door, Garage Door Opener","True","Patio Open","True","67","","None","False","See Remarks","809.65","Your search is over!  Located on a quiet interior street, this Eastview home is the one you?ve been waiting for! Remodeled, open floor plan, amazing canyon, harbor and city view?what more could you want?  With curb appeal galore, the house is unassuming as you approach, but when you enter you?ll be taken with the soaring ceilings, beautiful laminate floors, and the view that awaits as you make your way to the backyard. The living room is anchored by a beautiful fireplace and is a wonderful gathering spot for family and friends. The recently remodeled kitchen is a chef?s delight , with beautiful white shaker cabinets, quartz countertops,  slide-in range with downdraft exhaust, counter space galore, and adjacent pantry/laundry room ? storage is no problem here! There is a huge peninsula for casual dining, as well as a family room and dining room creating a ?great room? feel. The space is illuminated by multiple clerestory windows  and beautiful pendant lighting.  Further flooding the space in natural light is a wall of floor to ceiling windows overlooking the backyard. Down the hall you?ll find the bedrooms ? 2 spacious secondary bedrooms, a completely remodeled full bath with a separate tub and shower, white cabinetry and quartz counter with a breezy coastal feel. The master suite does not disappoint ? it is open and spacious, with wall-to-wall closets, and a completely remodeled en-suite spa-like bath  with a beautifully and tastefully tiled shower, high-end fixtures, dual sinks set in a quartz counter with rich wood cabinetry. Throughout the home you will find smooth ceilings, LED recessed lighting, dual-pane windows and so much more! There is an oversized 2 car garage which actually fits 2 cars with storage space along the sides. As if all of this was not enough, the backyard is your private oasis! Start with a tasty burger cooked on your built-in BBQ, then enjoy  the warm summer nights sitting around the firepit or soaking in the bubbling spa while gazing across the canyon at the twinkling harbor lights! Although this home feels worlds away from the hustle and bustle, it is close to stores, major streets and offers easy freeway access, but the icing on the cake is the option to attend the highly rated Palos Verdes schools!  This home truly has it all!","","All Bedrooms Down, Bonus Room, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes / LAUSD ? inquire","Dapplegray","Peninsula","Miraleste","","George","Harris","SHARRGE1","S4723","2.5","%","Harris Realty","1510000","False","Full Service","First showings Wednesday at Broker's Open. Public Open house Saturday & Sunday, 7/15 & 16, from 1-4p.m. Other showings are by appointment with minimum 2 hour notice - owner works from home.","True","Above Ground","True","True","1865","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Ronsard","","2159","Road","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, FHA, Submit","","18617","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights","True","https://vimeo.com/843020672","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=Y6FWeoEddxV","Double Pane Windows, Screens","1957","90275","1623","RPRS-4*"
