custom woodwork including a cozy window seat create an ambience that welcomes you in and makes you want to stay and relax.  A custom kitchen features beautiful shaker cabinets, a farmhouse sink, quartz counters and stainless appliances. With abundant cabinet and pantry space, and even a butler?s pantry, this kitchen is a chef?s delight. Informal and formal dining areas make this the perfect home to host your family and friends. On the main floor you will also find a cozy den (the 5th bedroom) and a ? bath ? perfect for your overnight guests who can?t climb the stairs. As you ascend the stairs, the intricate woodwork will catch your eye. There are 4 spacious bedrooms here, including an extremely spacious ensuite primary bedroom with a remodeled bathroom with a large walk-in shower featuring custom work. A full bathroom is also redone and serves the additional 3 bedrooms. If you think the inside is spectacular, you haven?t seen anything yet! French doors lead to the backyard ? your very own piece of paradise! The lot is over 10,000 square feet of lush landscaping and pure joy! Spend the summer entertaining on the stamped concrete cobblestone-look patio, which you watch the kids and pets play on the big, flat, low-maintenance lawn! Surrounded by mature trees, there is complete privacy here, and you?ll feel like you?re out in the country away from all the hustle and bustle of the world outside. It is clear the owners have taken impeccable care of this home. Other features include dual-pane casement windows, central heat and air, a ?hidden? spa in an alcove outside, and so much more. This well-located home offers access to the award-winning Palos Verdes school district, and easy access to stores, major arteries, the freeway and the bridge. This is a home you won?t want to miss!","","Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes / LAUSD ? inquire","Dapplegray","Peninsula","Miraleste","","Riley","Eastman","SBEASTRIL