"","0.3778","Private Remarks: All MLS data is assumed reliable but is not guaranteed. Buyer and buyer?s agent are responsible for independently verifying all information, including but not limited to square footage, permits, zoning, and property condition. Listing agent is a distant relative of the seller. Property to be sold in as-is condition. Seller will not accommodate any repair requests. For any questions, offer instructions, or additional information, please contact listing agent Alex Grammatico at 951-970-0092.","","","177 - Eastview/RPV","None","False","7552015007","","0","","False","2","","","","2","4","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Pager Ph","Agent Fax","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Email","None","False","Los Angeles","6","1700000","#ERR","04/09/2025 8:36:32 PM","","","04/16/2025 12:00:00 AM","05/27/2025 2:52:18 PM","","","04/09/2025 12:00:00 AM","04/16/2025 12:00:00 AM","04/10/2025 4:46:40 PM","05/27/2025 12:00:00 AM","05/27/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","6","","True","","","","","","","Cash","Den, Dining Room, Living Room","True","","True","Solar","True","","True","True","","SentriLock","False","","","","33.767081","In Garage","True","False","","","1750000","","","1750000","#ERR","","","Broker@GlobetrotterRealtyGroup.com","","Alex","","","Grammatico","","SWGRAMALE","","","","","SWGRGINC","","Globetrotter Realty Group Inc","800-484-5448","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.318068","","78","16457","0-1 Unit/Acre","Biking , Curbs, Fishing, Foothills, Sidewalks, Storm Drains","","Assessor","","","SW25078613","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","","","","","","36","","Private, Fenced, Heated, In Ground, Solar Heat, Waterfall","True","","677.29","Nestled in the desirable city of Rancho Palos Verdes, this exquisite single-story residence offers an unparalleled blend of comfort and elegance. Boasting four spacious bedrooms and two well-appointed bathrooms, the home spans approximately 2,510 square feet of thoughtfully designed living space in addition to paid solar panels, providing efficiency and long-term savings with no lease or financing to assume. Situated on a large corner lot, the property features an expansive backyard that is beautifully landscaped and perfect for entertaining. The outdoor space includes a sparkling pool, a relaxing hot tub, a vast grassy area, and a large concrete patio with a built-in barbecue and charming wooden pergola. Lush greenery and fruit trees create a serene and inviting atmosphere, offering a private retreat ideal for gatherings under the California sun. A secure, gated RV storage area sits neatly on the side of the house, enclosed by a privacy fence and easily accessible through a wide, lockage gate. Step inside to discover a harmonious open floor plan adorned with elegant tile flooring throughout. The generous living areas flow seamlessly, creating an inviting atmosphere that caters to both daily living and festive occasions. Each bedroom offers ample space, ensuring comfort and privacy for all occupants. Enhancing the property?s appeal are eco-friendly features, including fully paid solar panels that power both the home and the pool, along with a solar-powered pool pump. These sustainable additions reduce energy costs and promote a more environmentally conscious lifestyle. Uniquely positioned, this home offers the rare opportunity to choose between the Los Angeles Unified School District or the highly acclaimed Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District. Experience the perfect fusion of luxury and practicality in this Rancho Palos Verdes gem?a place you?ll be proud to call home.","","All Bedrooms Down, Den, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Sauna","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Bill","Ruane","SRUANWIL","S5228","","","Estate Properties","1700000","False","Full Service","Property is owner-occupied. Showings are by appointment only and must be