 and upscale entertaining. The formal living and dining rooms flow effortlessly with an elegant fireplace for your enjoyment. Every space is designed with attention to detail?offering both beauty and function. The primary suite is a sanctuary of its own, complete with a spa-inspired ensuite bath and double doors leading to the outdoor deck that overlooks a dreamworld backyard oasis. The second guest bedroom also offers its own view off the outdoor deck to the luxurious backyard oasis that sits on a 1/3 of an acre. The two additional bedrooms are spacious and provide flexibility for guests, home offices, or growing families, with each room offering generous closet space and serene views of the lush surroundings. There is also an additional room on the main level that can be used as a creative studio, library, den or fourth bedroom if desired. Step outside to your private backyard oasis, reminiscent of a summer in the Hamptons?complete with a sparkling salt water heated pool, raised jacuzzi, sun-drenched patio, and lush hedging for ultimate privacy. The expansive yard is ideal for al fresco dining, weekend entertaining, or relaxing poolside under the stars.  Located in a prestigious, quiet neighborhood conveniently located  to award-winning Palos Verdes schools, coastal trails, and world-class golf courses, this home is the definition of luxury and lifestyle.","Composition","All Bedrooms Up, Attic, Bonus Room, Den, Foyer, Kitchen, Library, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes / LAUSD ? inquire","","","","","Debbie","Martin","SMARTIDE","SB1332850","","","Real Brokerage Technologies","2100000","False","Full Service","OFFER DEADLINE IS WEDNESDAY, JUNE 18TH AT 5:00 P.M. Showings are by appointment only! DO NOT USE SHOWING TIME! Please text Maggie a business card and pre-approval letter prior to showing. Offers will be forwarded as they arrive for seller's review.","Tru