oorplan.  The refinished, original hardwood floors and restored bathrooms reflect the high quality of workmanship of times gone by. Enter the living room through an original slate floor entry that is highlighted by a PV stone fireplace with the same slate hearth and is adjacent to a lovely dining area with a porcelain tile floor that extends into the kitchen. Utilize the convenience of the laundry room with sink. Step outside and enjoy a relaxing dip or vigorous swim in the large rectangular pool.  Located on an oversized corner lot, you will be in close proximity to Trump National Golf Course and the Terranea Resort to say nothing of local shopping, restaurants and an elementary school just minutes away. Other features include a two-car garage, an RV pad and a 7-year old roof.  Your new, warm and happy home is waiting to welcome you with open arms.","Composition","Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Los Angeles Unified","","San Pedro","","","Ryan","Crabtree","SBCRABRYA","SB1378050","","","Ryan Crabtree, Broker","975000","False","Full Service","CBS code required.  Please call or text Evon (310-503-9142) or JoAnn (310-567-6577) to show.","True","","","","1394","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","W","","26th","","1901","Street","","Ranch","Cash, Conventional","","17400","","Single Family Residence","","Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","None","False","https://ranchophotos.com/mls/1901-w-26th-st/","","","1959","90732","4613","LAR1"
