lete with a spacious patio, it creates an ideal setting for unforgettable BBQ?s and social gatherings. Entertaining will be a cinch.  Heading down the hallway, you?ll discover a generously sized bathroom and two comfortable bedrooms. The master bedroom features its own sliding glass door to the backyard and a convenient master bathroom.  The home features copper plumbing. It is in need of some TLC, but has tons of potential to be a beautiful home.  Come see for yourself before it flies off the market! Some of the photos have been digitally staged.","","Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Michael","Harper","VHARPMIC","PV8635","2.5","%","HH Coastal Real Estate","1054000","False","Full Service","Email desired day and time along with license information to ricky@westshoresrealty.com with at least 2 hours notice before showing.","","","","","1427","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Mantis","","2011","Avenue","","","Cash to New Loan","","20754","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","","","","1961","90732","4211","LAR1"
