uth Shores!  Now is your chance to feel the ocean breeze and enjoy a partial ocean view and Catalina view from the front bedroom slider and kitchen window!  Come and see this incredible opportunity to own a partial fixer priced for you to be able to afford beautiful South Shore living.  Newer double pane windows throughout and a beautiful updated kitchen with a ton of storage, eating area and convenient laundry area.  One full bath has been completely remodeled and just so you can add your own touches you have the opportunity to completely re-envision the Primary bath in the ensuite Primary bedroom.  Two bedrooms have beautiful original hardwood flooring as well as the living and dining area.  The entire electrical panel was upgraded to 200 Amps in 2015.  A new roof was added in 2015 and many improvements were made during the sellers ownership, including all copper plumbing. A new sewer cleanout to the street was also completed. However there are things that you may want to renovate or maybe even add a second level or a rooftop deck to REALLY expand your views!  This is a fantastic walking neighborhood just up the hill from the beautiful Royal Palms beach and White Point.  Take a stroll along the nature path to the conservation land and enjoy ocean living at an affordable price.  The home has some unique features and to add to your ability to store your extra 'stuff' there is a large storage shed in the back.  The large front yard is an open book, allowing you to design a beautiful landscape to your specific style.  Low maintenance Pavers line the driveway and back yard and there is a super sturdy front wall separating the property from the sidewalk.  Come and see this incredible opportunity to own in South Shores and put your own creativity to work!","Asphalt","Attic, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Los Angeles Unified","Southshore","San Pedro","Dana","","Stephanie","Flores","OCFLORSTE","OC120