"","0.1285","TRUST SALE. Being sold in its present ""as-is"" condition subject to buyers inspection rights. Email offer to gary@sellnsp.com with usual supporting documents and Trust Advisory.","Dishwasher, Double Oven, Disposal, Gas Cooktop, Microwave, Refrigerator","True","179 - South Shores","Unknown","True","7563010006","","0","","False","2","1","","","1","3","","San Pedro","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","","","","None","False","Los Angeles","10","1110000","#ERR","09/01/2023 11:54:20 AM","","","09/11/2023 12:00:00 AM","11/01/2023 1:55:51 PM","","","09/01/2023 12:00:00 AM","09/11/2023 12:00:00 AM","09/03/2023 6:15:20 PM","11/01/2023 12:00:00 AM","11/01/2023 12:00:00 AM","","South","10","","True","Breakfast Nook, Dining Room, In Kitchen","","","Block, Vinyl","True","","Conventional","Living Room, Wood Burning","True","See Remarks, Tile, Wood","False","Central, Forced Air","True","Ceiling Fan(s), Corian Counters, Recessed Lighting, Wainscoting","True","True","Front Door","Supra","False","","","","33.724697","Individual Room, Inside","True","False","","Death On Property < 3 yrs","1079000","","","1079000","#ERR","310-732-1202","","gary@sellnsp.com","310-832-7682","Gary","310-519-8422","","Krill","","SKRILGAR","","","","","SB1350760","","Compass","310-241-3038","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.319593","55x97x54x105","69","5599","Back Yard, Corner Lot, Front Yard, Sprinkler System","Biking , Curbs, Dog Park, Fishing, Golf, Hiking , Park, Watersports, Preserve/Public Land, Street Lights","","Assessor","","","SB23153104","","2","2","","1","Vacant","","","","","Driveway, Garage, RV Potential, See Remarks","True","Concrete, Patio, Front Porch","True","51","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","853.85","Fresh ocean air and cool afternoon breezes are yours to enjoy daily from this delightful one-level home located in the very desirable lower South Shores area. This special home was custom-built back in 1955 by the same family that owns it now and has never been on the market. It has been lovingly maintained for 68 years and is finally ready for it's second owner. It's great from the curb as it sits elevated on a corner lot wrapped in green grass and low-maintenace landscaping. Brick walkway leads you up to the inviting covered front porch and original front door with diamond cut windows. Enter the foyer and to your right will be the spacious sunlit living room that includes a brick fireplace and large windows to let the natural light into the space. Next is the formal dining room with wainscoting and access to the charming kitchen featuring corian counters, built-in appliances and a cozy breakfast area. Adjacent to the kitchen is a laundry room and a 1/2 bath with easy access from the rear yard. Main hallway leads you to all three bedrooms and the upgraded full bathroom with separate shower and tub and a vaulted beam ceiling that adds some style to the room. The original oak hardwood floors were covered with carpet for all those years but are now exposed and have been refinished in a warm color to compliment the style of the home. Rear yard features fruit trees, grassy area, two patios and a vegetable garden. There is a detached two car garage and an area that can be utilized for RV parking on the East side of the property. Other features/upgrades include plantation shutters, re-pipe with Pex tubing, dual-pane vinyl windows, dimensional composition shingle roof and vinyl gates and railings. Located just 1 mile from this home are the ocean bluffs, White Point Nature Preserve and Royal Palms State Beach. Just a little further away are Trump National Golf Course and the world-class Terranea Resort. This is a fantastic opportunity to enjoy Coastal California living for substantially less than it would cost you in the surrounding beachside communities. HURRY!!!","Composition, Shingle","Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Lesli